    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Items</head>
                <p xml:id="del-2025-08-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-29T17:14:25.321+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR5c0126-en-4e004912">【通釋】所謂“‘海運’者，海動也“（林希逸），可見大鵬徙於南冥，亦順自然，借時勢而行。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-29T17:17:56.994+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR5c0126-en-4e004912">【通釋】此處引”齊諧“（書名或人名）深論，而非正典，凸顯”志怪“特色，彰揚大鵬霸悍博大。但以”三千“、”九萬“、”六月“而計，仍屬有形有限。為後文論述作鋪墊。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-29T17:21:21.179+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR5c0126-en-4e004912"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-29T17:22:44.394+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR5c0126-en-4e004912">【通釋】此節開篇，以”鯤化鵬”寓言，說理不著一字，僅直觀描述“鯤化鵬”狀態，氣勢撼人。可說明者：一、此處最可關注的，是三個動詞，前後呼應：化、飛與徙，勾勒變化無拘的任性狀態，與“逍遙遊”一脈相承。二、三字之中，“化”最為神奇，超越形象與物種限定，但氣象上，皆“不知幾千里”，無法估量，直抵淋漓本心。因此，“鯤化鵬”的“化而為鳥”，“化”字筆畫簡單，且無任何修飾副詞，乾乾淨淨，瀟瀟灑灑，自自在在。此“神妙難測”（王孝魚），有悖理性邏輯，反通宗教信仰與藝術直覺，可謂“真‘逍遙遊’”。但需注意的是，“鯤化鵬”未必是莊子理想的“逍遙遊”，屬”相對自由“，有別於”絶對自由“。此點後文補論。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-29T17:31:07.586+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR5c0126-en-4e004912">【通釋】此節回應前者“海運”時勢，又以大小之辯，闡述“培風”修養的重要性。二者皆屬逍遙主體特質：審時度勢，必反求諸己，從而保證自身與時代的張力聯繫：如何能在恰當時機，彰顯個人獨特性體，也是每個人都應面對的“命運之問”。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-29T17:47:47.352+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR5c0126-en-4e004912">【通釋】此小大妙喻，無窮變化，影響深至中國文學藝術想象傳統，如《西遊記》悟空與二郎神的變化追逐。現代文學，卞之琳《距離的組織》：“我的盆舟没有人戲弄嗎”，即源於《聊齋》之《白蓮教》中微觀與宏觀比對（詳見詩人註釋）。比照莊子以此“三言”與瑰奇文風說理，柏拉圖對話也有呼應之處。大與小，上與下，深厚與無力，感性與理性，其自身位置與評價，雖如前述高低視角下客體本身未變，但也在比照中時時變動。真逍遙者，但堪破此局面。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-29T18:12:52.54+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR5c0126-en-4e004912">【通釋】積，《說文》釋為”聚“，由小而大，從少至多，考驗耐心。與注重內在的”養“不同，”積“似乎側重外在，當然也離不開內在“修養”。王孝魚此節細論“積”字，強調莊子“逍遙”，“不惜合於儒家”（《莊子內篇新解》），也注重日常認知。甚是。不過，跳出此節，回顧前文之“化”，鯤鵬之類，尚且懂得“培風”，莊子又何嘗不可“大化”，超越所謂的“家”“門”之限？進言之，何為理想的詮解？首先當藉助文字義理，超越文字義理之限，直擊活生生，潑喇喇的心跳妙得。若奢以一小念，囊括一“大人”、“聖人”，可有“不化”的危險？</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-29T18:13:26.143+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR5c0126-en-4e004912">【通釋】積，《說文》釋為”聚“，由小而大，從少至多，考驗耐心。與注重內在的”養“不同，”積“似乎側重外在，當然也離不開內在“修養”。王孝魚此節細論“積”字，強調莊子“逍遙”，“不惜合於儒家”（《莊子內篇新解》），也注重日常認知。甚是。不過，跳出此節，回顧前文之“化”，鯤鵬之類，尚且懂得“培風”，莊子又何嘗不可“大化”，超越所謂的“家”“門”之限？進言之，何為理想的詮解？首先當藉助文字義理，超越文字義理之限，直擊泼喇喇的心跳意动，活生生的迁想妙得。若奢以一小念，囊括一“大人”、“聖人”，可有“不化”的危險？</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-80a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:02.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Unable to rectify and advise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-80a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:02.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it can be said that harm will only increase.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-81a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:02.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-81a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:02.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-82a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:02.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-82a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:02.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Unable to rectify and advise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">it can be said that harm is greatly increased.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Even raising an old animal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">one still hesitates to kill it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">how much more so a ruler?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He turned around and slandered Zǐjiā.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zǐjiā, fearing this, followed him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">they assassinated Lìng Gōng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The record says, "The Zheng noble, Gōngzǐ Guīshēng, assassinated his ruler Yí,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">because his authority was insufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:23.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The gentleman said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zǐgōng and Zǐjiā plotted to strike first.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zǐjiā said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Even when raising an old animal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">one still hesitates to kill it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">how much more so a ruler?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He then turned around and slandered Zǐjiā.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zǐjiā, fearful, followed him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-77a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">they assassinated Lìng Gōng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The history records: "The Zheng nobleman, Guīshēng, assassinated his ruler Yí,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">indicating his authority was insufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The noble person said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"To be benevolent without being martial [firm],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">one will be unable to succeed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In all cases of regicide,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">when the ruler is mentioned by his title,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">it is because the ruler was without principle;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-78a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">when the minister is mentioned by his title,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-79a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">it is because the minister is guilty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-79a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of Zheng wanted to install Zǐliáng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-79a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He declined, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-85a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:58:41.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are something that even the sage cannot overcome,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-85a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:58:41.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much more so you</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-79a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Judging by virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-79a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then Qùjí is not sufficient;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-86a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:58:41.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-79a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">judging by obedience,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-86a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:58:41.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being in a lower position, took upon themselves the worries of the superior,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-79a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then Gōngzǐ Jiān is the eldest."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Therefore, they installed Xiāng Gōng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-86a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:58:41.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which was not their responsibility.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xiāng Gōng intended to remove the Mù clan,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-87a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:58:41.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】Posthumous laws,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and spare Zǐliáng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zǐliáng would not allow it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"If the Mù clan should survive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then I would certainly wish for it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">If you are going to destroy them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:57:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then let all be destroyed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:59:58.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zǐliáng refused,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:59:58.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:59:58.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"If the Mù clan should remain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:59:58.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">that is what I truly wish.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:59:58.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">If they are going to be destroyed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-80a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T21:59:58.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then let all be destroyed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-81a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:50.78+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">lest you be caught in disaster."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-81a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:50.78+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">And weeping, he said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-81a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:50.78+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Even ghosts seek food;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:50.78+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">won't the ghosts of the Ruò Áo lineage be starved!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:50.78+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">When Prime Minister (Lìngyǐn) Zǐ Wén died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-87a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:59.239+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Citing the past to verify the present,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:50.78+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Dòu Bān became Prime Minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-87a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:59.239+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is sufficient to serve as a lesson.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-87a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:59.239+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">From this, we know that Yán Huí's attempt to transform Wèi</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-87a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:59.239+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">was unlikely to succeed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:59.239+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text:] 《關龍逢》 Guān Lóng Féng was a virtuous minister of Xià Jié.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:00:59.239+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《王子比干》 Wángzǐ Bǐ Gān was the uncle of Yīn Zhòu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-87a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using the past to prove the present,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-87a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is sufficient to serve as a mirror for reflection.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-87a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus we know that Yán Huí's 顏回 transformation of Wèi 衛</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-87a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">was a principle that could not be put into practice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】Guān Lóngféng 關龍逢 was a worthy minister of Xià Jié 夏桀.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Wángzǐ Bǐgān 王子比干 was the uncle of Yīn Zhòu 殷紂.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-81a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Unable to escape the calamity."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《以下》xiá jià fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-81a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">And weeping, said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《傴》yū fǔ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《拊》xú xiàng yīn fǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-81a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Even ghosts still seek food.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ Yún 李云 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Wouldn't the ghosts of the Ruò'áo (若敖) clan be starving!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">When the lìng yǐn Zǐ Wén (子文) died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Yū fǔ 傴拊,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Dòu Bān (鬭般) became lìng yǐn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to cherish and love.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and Zǐ Yuè (子越) became sīmǎ (司馬).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī Yún 崔云 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Wěi Jiǎ (蒍賈) became gōng zhèng (工正),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is like "ǒu hù 嘔呴,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">slandered Zǐ Yáng (子揚) and killed him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning to nurture.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《拂其》fú fú fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zǐ Yuè (子越) became lìng yǐn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:02:57.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The army was afraid</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:09.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, due to the adornment of worthy ministers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:02:57.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and retreated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and he (Wěi Jiǎ) became sīmǎ (司馬).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī Yún 崔云 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:02:57.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The king sent someone to inspect the army, saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:09.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they unleashed their venom and trapped them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zǐ Yuè (子越) also hated him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To disobey.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:09.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Their intention was to vie for fame and pursue profit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:02:57.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"My late lord, King Wén (文王), conquered Xī (息),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-88a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Also, fāng fú fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and so, using the pretext of the Ruò'áo (若敖) clan,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:02:57.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and obtained three arrows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:09.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and so they reached this point.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">imprisoned Bó Yíng (伯嬴) at Liáoyáng (轑陽) and killed him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-89a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【二】【Note】They did not want ministers to have a reputation that surpassed that of the ruler.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, relying on the embellishments of virtuous ministers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Then he stationed himself at Zhēngyě (烝野),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:02:57.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bó Fén (伯棼) stole two of them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】Jǐ 擠 means to push down,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:09.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】《以擠》xú zǐ jì fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they freely employed their *zhèn dú* (poisonous nature) to entrap them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to cause to fall,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">intending to attack the king.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The army was afraid and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:09.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also zǐ lǐ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Their intention lay in contending for fame and pursuing profit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to entrap,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The king offered the sons of the three previous kings as hostages,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">retreated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and that's why they reached this point.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but he did not accept them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to poison.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">King Chéngwáng 成王 sent an inspector to the army, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] *"Yǐ jǐ"* (以擠): Xú Zǐ (徐子) pronounces it *jì* with the fourth tone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xià Jié 夏桀 and Yīn Zhòu 殷紂,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He arrayed his troops at the banks of the Zhāng (漳) River.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Our late lord, King Wénwáng 文王, conquered Xī 息 and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also *lǐ* with the third tone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">were rulers without principle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">obtained three arrows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ (司馬) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In the autumn, on the wùxū (戊戌) day of the seventh month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the ruler of Chǔ (楚) fought against the Ruò'áo (若敖) clan at Gāohǔ (皋滸).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means "poison."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bó Fén 伯棼 stole two of them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">who did not measure themselves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">yet still coveted a good reputation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One explanation says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">exhausting his luck with them."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bó Fén (伯棼) shot at the king.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means "to entrap."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He beat the drum and advanced the army,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, they relied on the embellishments of virtuous ministers</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The arrow went through the chariot shaft,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and reached the drum support,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to freely administer poison and trap them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and then annihilated the Ruò'áo 若敖 clan.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Fāngyán* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">sticking into the qíníng (丁寧).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means "to destroy."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Initially,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Their intention lay in competing for fame and pursuing profit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He shot again,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Ruò'áo 若敖 took a wife from Yūn 鄖,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-90a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and it was because of this that they came to this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jiǎnwén (簡文) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】《Yǐ jǐ》: Xú pronounces it jì, reversing it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and she gave birth to Dòu Bóbǐ 鬭伯比.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the arrow went through the chariot shaft,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means "to repel."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*"Shì hǎo"* (是好): Pronounced *hū bào* with the fourth tone and fourth tone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">When Ruò'áo 若敖 died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:34.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also pronounces it lǐ, reversing it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and pierced the hub cap.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The army was afraid and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Dòu Bóbǐ 鬭伯比 followed his mother and lived in Yūn 鄖.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-91a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*"Yù lìng"* (欲令): Pronounced *lì chéng* with the fourth tone and second tone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He had an affair with the daughter of the Lord of Yūn 鄖,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-92a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Third Note] Now, tyrannical rulers do not merely seek to indulge their desires,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">retreated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and she gave birth to Zǐ Wén 子文.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-92a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but also seek fame;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">King Chǔ sent someone to inspect the army, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-92a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">however, what they seek is not the proper way.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Lady of Yūn 鄖 ordered him to be abandoned in the Mèng 夢 (marsh).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"My late ancestor, King Wén of Chǔ, conquered Xī and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A tiger nursed him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">obtained three arrows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] The two rulers, Yáo (堯) and Yǔ (禹),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Lord of Yūn 鄖 was hunting</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-82a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:01:54.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bó Fén stole two of them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">have already been explained earlier.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and saw him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cóng Zhī (叢枝),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He was frightened and returned home.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xū Áo (胥敖),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Lady told him about it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and Yǒu Hù (有扈)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and so he ordered him to be taken in.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are all names of states.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of Chǔ 楚 called milk "gǔ 穀,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yǒu Hù (有扈)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is now the Hù (鄠) County in Yōngzhōu (雍州).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and called tigers "yú tū 於菟."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Therefore, they named him Gǔ Yú Tū 穀於菟.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A dwelling without people is called *xū* (empty),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-83a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He married his daughter to Bó Bǐ 伯比.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and a ghost without descendants is called *lì* (fierce).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">She was in fact the Lìng Yǐn 令尹 Zǐ Wén 子文.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">His grandson, Zhēn Yǐn Kè Huáng 箴尹克黃, was on a mission to Qí 齊.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is said that the rulers of these three states</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">On his return, he reached Sòng 宋</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">were all without principle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and heard of the rebellion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and loved to initiate warfare,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">His people said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"We cannot enter (Chǔ 楚)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">launching campaigns to conquer other states.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:04:15.517+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zhēn Yǐn 箴尹 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:03:59.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How could they only greedily seek tangible profit?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:31.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">His grandson, Zhēn Yǐn Kè Huáng, was sent on a mission to Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:31.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Returning and passing through Sòng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:31.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">he heard of the rebellion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:31.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">His attendant said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:31.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"We cannot enter."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-84a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:31.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zhēn Yǐn said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:43.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">a ghost without descendants is called a wraith (lì).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:43.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is said that the rulers of these three states</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:43.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">were all without virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:43.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">enjoying starting wars,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:43.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">attacking and conquering other states.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-93a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:23:43.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How could they only be greedy for real benefit?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-88a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:06.696+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.5.2 In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-88a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:06.696+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke returned from Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-89a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:06.696+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-89a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:06.696+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.5.3 In autumn, the ninth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-89a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:06.696+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Gāo Gù of Qí came to escort Lady Shū back.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-90a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:06.696+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-97a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:54.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.5.4 In winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-97a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:54.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">she came;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-98a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:54.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">it was a return of horses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-98a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:54.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.5.5 The Viscount of Chǔ attacked Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-98a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:54.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Chén and Chǔ were at peace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-98a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:25:54.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xún Línfǔ of Jìn rescued Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-107a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:26:46.22+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Chì Dí (赤狄) attacked Jìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-107a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:26:46.22+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">besieging Huái (懷) and Xíngqiū (邢丘).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-107a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:26:46.22+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Jìn ruler wanted to attack them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-107a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:26:46.22+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zhōngháng Huánzǐ (中行桓子) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-107a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:26:46.22+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Make their people suffer</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-107a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:26:46.22+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">so as to fill their measure (of wrongdoing)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-113a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:29.585+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.7.2 In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-113a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:30.29+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.7.2 In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-113a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:29.585+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke met with the Marquis of Qí 齊 to attack Lái 萊.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-113a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:29.585+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke met with the Marquis of Qí 齊 to attack Lái 萊.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-114a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:30.29+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-114a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:30.29+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-114a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:30.29+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.7.3 In autumn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-114a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:30.29+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.7.3 In autumn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-114a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:30.29+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke returned from attacking Lái 萊.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-115a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:27:30.29+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-94a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:13.652+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìng Fān suggests that 虛厲 (*xūlì*) is actually 虛戾 (*xūlì*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-94a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:13.652+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the "Lǔ Wèn" chapter of the *Mòzǐ*, a state is referred to as 虛戾 (*xūlì*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-94a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:13.652+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and in the *Zhào Cè*, Qí is referred to as 虛戾 (*xūlì*);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-94a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:13.652+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">both are written with 戾 (*lì*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-94a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:13.652+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In ancient times, the sounds and meanings of 戾 (*lì*) and 厲 (*lì*) were interchangeable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-94a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:13.652+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The "Jié Nán Shān" section of the "Minor Odes" in the *Book of Poetry* has "降此大戾" (jiàng cǐ dà lì)...</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-121a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:31.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">seizing the grain of Xiàngyīn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-121a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:31.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.7.4 Zhèng was at peace with Jìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-121a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:31.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">due to the planning of Gōngzǐ Sòng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-121a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:31.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">therefore, he assisted the Count of Zhèng to attend the meeting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-121a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:31.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-121a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:28:31.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">they pledged alliance at Hēirǎng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-97a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:29.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Correction】 (1) The Zhào Advisor's version does not have the character 之 (zhī).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-98a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:29.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Although,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-98a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:29.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if there must be a reason,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-126a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:37.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zhòng Suì died in Chuí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-98a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:29.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">try to tell me! 【一】"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-126a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:37.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">On Rénwǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-99a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:29.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一】【Explanation】 嘗 (cháng) means "to try".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-126a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:37.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">they still performed the Yì dance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-126a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:37.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Wàn entered [the temple],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-126a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:37.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">without the reed pipe.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-127a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:29:37.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-134a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:30:56.18+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.8 "Zuǒ Zhuàn, Year 8 of Duke Xuān"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-135a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:30:56.18+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-135a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:30:56.18+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.8.1 In the spring of the eighth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-135a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:30:56.18+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the White Di and Jìn made peace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-135a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:30:56.18+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-103a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:31:08.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I dare to state the reason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-135a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:30:56.18+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">they met with Jìn to attack Qín.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-104a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:31:08.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【二】【注】Speaking of being humble and not divided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-105a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:31:08.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】Exhorting body and mind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-105a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:31:08.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">serving the country with utmost sincerity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-105a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:31:08.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">speaking and acting with loyalty and caution,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-105a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:31:08.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and having no difference or doubleness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-139a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:36:38.837+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">It rained,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-139a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:36:38.837+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the burial could not be completed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-139a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:36:38.837+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">which was in accordance with ritual.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-139a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:36:38.837+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">According to ritual,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-139a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:36:38.837+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">when divining for a burial date,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-139a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T22:36:38.837+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">one should first choose a distant day.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-111a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:08.484+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Two】【Note】It means that the lord of Wèi's 衛君 (state) *kàng yáng* 亢陽 (excessive *yáng*) nature is filled within and extremely displayed without,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-111a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:08.484+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the height of strength and resistance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-112a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:08.484+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】*Yáng* (陽),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-112a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:08.484+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is forceful and fierce.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-112a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:08.484+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Chōng* (充),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-112a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:08.484+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is full.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-148a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:37.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-148a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:37.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.6 In the eighth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-148a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:37.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Viscount of Téng 滕 died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:37.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:37.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.7 In the ninth month, the Marquis of Jìn 晉,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:37.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-148a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-148a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.6 In the eighth month, the Viscount of Téng died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-148a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.7 In the ninth month, the Marquis of Jìn, the Duke of Sòng, the Marquis of Wèi, the Earl of Zhèng, and the Earl of Cáo met at Hù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-150a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-150a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.8 Xún Línfǔ of Jìn led an army to attack Chén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:12:26.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like indulgence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-151a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:12:26.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When people use pleasant and good matters to admonish and move him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-151a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.9 On the day Xīnyǒu, Marquis Hēitún of Jìn died at Hù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:12:26.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the ruler, because of their loyal remonstrance, suppresses and frustrates them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-151a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:12:26.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in order to seek pleasure and indulgence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-152a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-152a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.10 In the tenth month, on the day Guǐyǒu, Marquis Zhèng of Wèi died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:12:26.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">fulfilling his licentious desires.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-152a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-119a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:12:26.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Textual Explanation] "Cuò zhī (挫之)" is pronounced zi wò fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-153a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-148a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This means indulging oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">People use pleasant and good matters to admonish and move [the ruler],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-153a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.11 The people of Sòng besieged Téng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-148a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.6 In the eighth month, the Viscount of Téng died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-148a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but the ruler, because of their loyal remonstrations, instead suppresses and thwarts them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-154a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in order to seek pleasure and indulgence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-154a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.12 The Viscount of Chǔ attacked Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-155a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.7 In the ninth month, the Marquis of Jìn, the Duke of Sòng, the Marquis of Wèi, the Earl of Zhèng, and the Earl of Cáo met at Hù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thereby fulfilling his lewd and dissolute intentions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-155a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.13 Xì Quē of Jìn led an army to rescue Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-119a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】《挫之》(cuò zhī): zǐ wò fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-119a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《從容》(cóng róng): qī róng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-156a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is like indulging oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-156a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.14 Chén killed its Grand Master Xiè Yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-120a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Six】【Commentary】It means that the words are few and many,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-157a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">People use good and pleasant matters to admonish and move him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-120a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without the advantage of turning back or yielding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-149a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】The unprincipled behavior of the Lord of Wèi (衛侯)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-157a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9 *Commentary on the Ninth Year of Duke Xuān*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but the ruler, because of their loyal remonstrations, instead suppresses and thwarts them</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:57.247+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-150a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in order to seek pleasure and indulgence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:57.247+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has been going on for a long time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:57.247+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.1 In the spring of the ninth year, the king sent an envoy to solicit betrothal gifts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus fulfilling his wild and licentious desires.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-150a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.8 Xún Línfǔ of Jìn led an army to attack Chén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:57.247+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Day by day, [even] the virtue of gradual permeation</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.1 In the spring of the ninth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the King sent someone to request a betrothal gift.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.1 In the spring of the ninth year, the king sent an envoy to request betrothal gifts. In summer, Mèng Xiànzǐ went to Zhōu as an envoy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-119a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】《Cuò zhī (挫之)》: Zǐ wò fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-151a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">still cannot be achieved,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:57.247+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In summer, Mèng Xiànzǐ paid a formal visit to Zhōu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-119a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Cóng róng (從容)》: Qī róng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:57.247+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much less can the grand model of sagely brightness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-151a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.9 On the day xīnyǒu, Marquis Hēi Tún of Jìn died at Hù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-120a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Six】【Commentary】 Saying that the words are few and many,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Mèng Xiànzǐ went to Zhōu on a diplomatic visit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-151a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">be hoped for!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:57.247+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The king considered him to be versed in ritual.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:11:54.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The King considered him to be knowledgeable in propriety</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This means indulging in licentiousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The king considered him to be respectful of propriety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-122a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Seven】【Commentary】Therefore, he clings to his original intentions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-152a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-120a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is no victory of returning and descending.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When people offer sincere advice and remonstrations with the intention of improving things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.1 In the spring of the ninth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】Adorning faults, a benighted ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-152a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.10 In the tenth month of winter, on the day guǐyǒu, Marquis Zhèng of Wèi died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 The wickedness of the Lord of Wèi (衛)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is unable to accept advice like a flowing stream.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the King sent an envoy to request a betrothal gift.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has been going on for a long time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the ruler instead suppresses and frustrates them for their loyal admonishments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-159a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and rewarded him generously.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what benefit would action bring?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-152a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what benefit would action bring?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The way to transform Wèi (衛),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-153a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-159a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.2 In autumn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Firmly clinging to his original heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">seeking pleasure and indulgence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The way to transform Wèi (衛),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Mèng Xiànzǐ paid a formal visit to the Zhou court.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Even if the virtue of daily gradual soaking</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could it be accomplished?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-118a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus fulfilling his own licentious desires.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How could it be used?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-119a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】《挫之》(cuò zhī): zi wò fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.1 In the spring of the ninth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This then rejects the technique of superficial sincerity from the beginning, deeming it unsuitable for implementation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-159a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Gēnmó was seized,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">still cannot be achieved,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">who would be willing to transform from evil to good?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The King considered him to be observant of proper etiquette and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-153a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.11 The people of Sòng besieged Téng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What benefit is there in acting?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the art of rejecting and questioning the front end is not suitable to be practiced.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】《不訾》(bù zī): xiàng xú yīn zǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the king sent an envoy to request a betrothal gift.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-160a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">indicating its easiness to conquer.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-119a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《從容》(cóng róng): qī róng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-159a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">bestowed generous gifts upon him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much less so with great model and sagely brilliance;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-154a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-124a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Eight】【Commentary】Outwardly compliant but inwardly not criticizing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is the Way of Wei (衛) [to seek such benefits].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of Text] 《Bù Zī 不訾》, Xiàng Xi 徐 has the sound of zǐ 紫.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-124a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is simply [the same as] the previous superficial sincerity and forced uniformity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can it be hoped for!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-120a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Six】 【Commentary】 His words are few and his deeds many,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.3 Duke Zhāo of Téng died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī 崔 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-154a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.12 The Viscount of Chǔ attacked Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How could this be acceptable?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-159a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.2 In autumn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Mèng Xiànzǐ paid a formal visit to the Zhōu court.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-124a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">saying that this is not enough to transform him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.4 There was a meeting at Hù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-122a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Seven】【Commentary】 Therefore, he clings to his original intentions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-155a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-120a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">lacking the merit of repentance and submission.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To destroy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-159a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Gēn Móu was taken;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the art of rejecting the front and feigning emptiness is not suitable for practice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The king considered him to have proper etiquette</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">to punish those who were not harmonious.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】Outwardly assuming a reverent posture,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 He adorns his faults and is a benighted ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-155a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.13 Xì Quē of Jìn led an army to rescue Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-159a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and rewarded him generously.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the text] "Bù Zī (不訾)" Xiàng Xú pronounced it "zǐ (紫)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-160a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">it is said that it was easily done.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 The lack of moral principles of the Marquis of Wèi</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-127a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Proofreading] (1) In Zhao Jianyi's 趙諫議 edition, "kuài 快" is written as "shǐ 使".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Marquis of Chén did not attend.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to fully display respectful humility,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-156a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has been long-standing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">unable to follow (people's) admonishments like a flowing stream,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-159a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.2 In the autumn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"If that is the case, then I am upright inwardly and yielding outwardly;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.3 Duke Zhāo of Téng died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">inwardly compliant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xún Línfǔ of Jìn, leading the armies of the various lords, attacked Chén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-156a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.9.14 Chén killed its grand master, Xiè Yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The virtue of gradual influence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-159a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Gēn Móu was taken;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">stubbornly clinging to his original heart.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means to slander.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Marquis of Jìn died at Hù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">daring not to criticize or defame.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">having achieved something, I compare it with that of my superiors.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.4 There was a meeting at Hù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-157a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is still insufficient to bring about change,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-160a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">this indicates its easy conquest.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Who would be willing to transform from evil to good?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">With this to request action,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-162a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and so they returned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-127a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Corrections] (1) In the Zhao Admonishing Official's edition, "kuài (快)" is written as "shǐ (使)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be upright inwardly</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:50.742+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">to punish those who were not harmonious.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-157a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9 *Commentary on the Ninth Year of Duke Xuān*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much less can one expect the broad model and sagely brightness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.3 Duke Zhāo of Téng died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-124a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Eight】【Commentary】 Outwardly compliant but inwardly not critical,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What benefit is there in doing so?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-162a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.5 In winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a companion with Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"If so, then inwardly I am upright, and outwardly I am yielding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-121a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be effective!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-124a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">namely, directing towards the front with emptiness and forcing singularity;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.4 There was a meeting at Hù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-162a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the people of Sòng besieged Téng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(It is) the way to defend (Wèi).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be a companion with Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.1 In the spring of the ninth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and having achieved [something], I compare myself to the ancients.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-124a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">saying that this is not sufficient to transform him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-122a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Seven】 【Commentary】 Therefore, he clings to his original intentions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">to punish those who were not harmonious.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">taking advantage of their mourning period.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How can it be acceptable!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:07.4+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the king sent an envoy to request a betrothal gift.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 Outwardly kneeling upright</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to know that the Son of Heaven and I are both children of Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Being inwardly upright [means]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 The ruler glosses over his faults and remains unenlightened,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Marquis of Chén did not attend.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.6 Duke Líng of Chén, along with Kǒng Níng and Yí Xíngfù, had illicit relations with Xià Jī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, rejecting the techniques of specious beginnings is not suitable to be practiced.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to exhaust the deference of the feet,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and (ask myself) why should I expect others to praise me because of my words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being a companion of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】Explanation of Words: In "Bù Zī" (不訾, lit. "not to criticize"), Xiàng Xù pronounces "zī" as "zǐ."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">inwardly compliant and obedient,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">all wearing her undergarments</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">unable to accept (others') admonitions like flowing water.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">or expect others to dislike me?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xún Línfǔ of Jìn, leading the armies of the various lords, attacked Chén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Being a companion of Heaven [means]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He obstinately clings to his original mindset,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If that is so,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-161a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Marquis of Jìn died at Hù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">daring not to criticize or slander.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">to jest at court.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:13:14.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">knowing that the Son of Heaven and oneself are both children of Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">people will call me a child;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-123a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so who would be willing to transform from evil to good?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xiè Yě advised, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so why seek praise from others solely based on one's own words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-162a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">so they returned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using this to request to be put into practice,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">or seek to avoid their criticism?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"If dukes and ministers openly engage in lewdness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what benefit will come from its practice?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-162a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.5 In winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-124a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Eight】 【Commentary】 Outwardly conforming but inwardly not criticizing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is what it means to be a companion with Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-124a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is merely extending the practice of feigned sincerity and half-hearted effort,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be yielding outwardly</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If so,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-162a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the people of Sòng besieged Téng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the people will have nothing to emulate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">As for the way to transform Wèi (衛),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">taking advantage of their mourning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-124a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indicating that this is insufficient to transform him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">people will call one a child;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and it will be known as unvirtuous.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can it be achieved?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a companion with people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 Outwardly adopting a kneeling posture</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This then rejects the technique of directing towards the front with emptiness as not suitable for implementation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.6 Duke Líng of Chén, together with Kǒng Níng and Yí Xíngfù, had illicit relations with Xià Jī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">May your Lordship accept my advice!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is what it means to be a companion of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To hold up things, to kneel, to be respectful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Being outwardly yielding [means]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】《Bù zī (不訾)》: Xiàng Xú sound "zǐ (紫)".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to show utmost respect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and they all wore her undergarments inside their clothes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are the rituals of a minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being a companion of men.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:14:23.962+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">inwardly compliant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I can change."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and joked about it in court.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Everyone does them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Propping oneself up on one's knees and bending into a fist,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are the etiquette of a subject.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xiè Yě remonstrated, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">daring not to criticize or denigrate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke told the two men.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how dare I not do them?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Seeking to proceed in this way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Everyone does them;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The two men requested that he be killed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"If dukes and ministers openly indulge in licentiousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To do what others do,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">people will not find fault with me.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what benefits can be achieved?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke did not forbid it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how dare I not do them?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the people will have nothing to emulate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:15:30.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and so they killed Xiè Yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The way to transform Wèi</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and moreover, it is heard to be improper.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what it means to be a companion with people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Doing what others do</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Your Lordship should put a stop to it!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can that be accomplished?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To achieve something and compare it with that of my superiors</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means that people will find no fault</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus, it rejects the idea that the pretense of sincere reverence is an appropriate tactic to employ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a companion with antiquity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is what it means to be a companion of men.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】《不訾》(bù zī): xiàng xú yīn zǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Achieving [something] and comparing oneself to the ancients [means]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Though the words may be instructive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I am able to change."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:16:42.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they are in reality critical.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being a companion of the ancients.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke told the two men.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The two men requested that he kill him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What the ancients had</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Although the words are instructive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke did not forbid it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they are actually reproaches.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:17:31.302+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is not what I have."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:13.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and so they killed Xiè Yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the ancients possessed it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-29T23:18:46.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is not something I possess."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what benefits will come of the proceeding?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The way of transforming Wèi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can it be achieved?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This then rejects the previous technique of presenting emptiness as inappropriate to implement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】《不訾 (bù zī)》: xiàng xú yīn zǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(It means) to destroy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-127a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【校】Corrections: (1) In the copy of Zhào Councilor, "kuài" is written as "shǐ."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"If that is the case, then I am inwardly upright but outwardly compliant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and succeed by comparing (myself) to superiors. [一]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What benefit is there in acting?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Way of Wei (衛) in transformation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">'Inwardly upright' means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being a companion to Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can it be used?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the techniques of rejecting the front end and pursuing emptiness are not suitable for practice and use.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be a companion to Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:35.976+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means knowing that the Son of Heaven and oneself are both children of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation] *Bù Zī* (不訾), Xiàng Xú (向徐) reads the sound as *zǐ* (紫).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:35.976+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.1 In the spring of the ninth year, the King sent an envoy to request a betrothal gift.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-158a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:35.976+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Why then should one seek praise or blame from others based solely on one's own words?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Why should one desire others to approve or disapprove? [二]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To destroy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If that is the case,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is the way to protect (wèi) oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-127a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Note] (1) In Zhao Jianyi's (趙諫議) version, *kuài* (快) is written as *shǐ* (使).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">people will call him a child.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"If that is so, then I am inwardly upright but outwardly yielding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How can mediocrity be tolerated?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and achieving success by comparing myself to those above [one].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-125a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus, the art of dismissing the beginning and emptying the end is not suitable for practice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what it means to be a companion to Heaven. [三]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] 《Bù Zī》: Formerly, Xú's pronunciation was zǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">'Outwardly compliant' means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be inwardly upright</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being a companion to people. [一]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a companion with Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be a companion with Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-126a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To destroy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To hold up (offerings), kneel, and bend the body</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are the rites of a minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-127a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Notes] (1) In Zhao Jianyi's version, kuài is written as shǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to know that both the Son of Heaven and oneself are children of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How could one desire that others approve of one's words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"If that is the case, then I am straight within and crooked without,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Everyone does them;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">accomplished and compared to those above.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how dare I not do them?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">or desire that others disapprove? [two]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one is like this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be straight within</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To do what others do</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a companion of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means that people will find no fault with you. [四]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">people will call him a child,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is what it means to be a companion with Heaven. [three]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be a companion of Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what it means to be a companion to people. [五]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">'Succeeding by comparing (oneself) to superiors' means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to know that the Son of Heaven and oneself are both children of Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be outwardly yielding</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and to only seek for oneself that people praise or do not praise what one says.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being a companion to the ancients. [六]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a companion with people [one].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:30.001+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The duke said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:36.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Achieving success by comparing oneself to those above</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Although the words are instructive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Do you seek that people do good or do not do good?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:30.001+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I can change."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To hold things up, to kneel, to be submissive:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:36.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a companion with the ancients [six].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one is like this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:30.001+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The duke told the two men.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">their substance is criticism. [七]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are the rituals of a subject.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What the ancients had</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Everyone does them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:36.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Even if the words are instructive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:30.001+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The two men requested that he kill him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:08.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To complete and then compare oneself upwards,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">people will call him a child.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:36.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they are in fact a criticism [seven].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how dare I not do them?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:30.001+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the duke did not stop them;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what it means to be a companion of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:45:56.788+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is not what I have. [八]"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:08.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to make the ancients one's peers [six].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I can change."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:48:30.001+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">so they killed Xiè Yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:08.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Although his words may be instructive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be crooked without</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Doing what others do</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:08.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">their substance is criticism [seven].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a companion of people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will not be criticized [four].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I can change."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke told his two sons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke told his two sons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:08.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is something that the ancients possessed</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what it means to be a companion with people [five].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The two sons requested to kill him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Holding things, kneeling, bending the fists,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To become accomplished and model oneself after the ancients,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The two sons requested to kill him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are the rituals of a subject.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke did not forbid it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:08.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is not something I possess [eight]."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and so they killed Xiè Yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a disciple of the past [six].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke did not forbid it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Everyone does them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Though their words may be instructive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and thus Xiè Yě was killed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Kǒngzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how dare I not do them?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Kǒngzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To do what others do,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The *Book of Odes* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they are in reality a form of criticism [seven].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The *Book of Odes* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What the ancients possessed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">'The people have many faults,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">people will not find fault</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:46:18.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is not what I possess [eight].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what it means to be a companion of people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">'The people have many vices;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">do not yourself create faults.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To be accomplished and compared to those above</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">do not create vices yourself.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-165a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">It is about Xiè Yě!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-165a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.7 The Viscount of Chǔ, because of the campaign against Lì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to be a companion of the ancients.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-165a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Is it not referring to Xiè Yě!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-165a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.7 The Viscount of Chǔ, because of the expedition against Lì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">attacked Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Although the words are instructive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they are in reality accusations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.8 Jìn's Xì Quē rescued Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">attacked Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What the ancients possessed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Earl of Zhèng defeated the Chǔ army at Liǔ Fén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.8 Xì Quē of Jìn rescued Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of the state were all happy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Earl of Zhèng defeated the Chǔ army at Liǔ Fén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-128a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:47:02.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is not what I possess.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">only Zǐliáng worried and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of the state were all happy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"This is a disaster for the state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">only Zǐ Liáng worried and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"This is a disaster for the state;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-167a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">my death is not far off."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I can change."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-167a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10 *The Annals of the Tenth Year of Duke Xuān*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-167a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">my death is not far off."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-168a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-167a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10 *Annals of the Tenth Year of Xuān Gōng*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Duke told his two sons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-168a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The two sons requested to kill him (Xiè Yě),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-168a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.1 In the spring of the tenth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-168a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.1 In the spring of the tenth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-163a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke did not forbid it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-168a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke went to Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-168a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke went to Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-169a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and so they killed Xiè Yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-169a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Kǒngzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-169a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.2 The Duke arrived back from Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-170a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The *Book of Poetry* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-169a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.2 The Duke arrived back from Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-170a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">'The people have many crooked ways,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-170a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.3 The people of Qí returned the fields west of the Jì River to us.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-164a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">do not create crooked ways yourself.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-170a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.3 The people of Qí returned the fields of Jì Xī to us.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:54:34.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It says that my inner heart is of a pure and sincere nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.4 In summer, the fourth month, bǐng chén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-165a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Is it not talking about Xiè Yě!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">there was a solar eclipse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.4 In the fourth month, on *bǐng chén*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:54:34.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">sharing the principles of nature and being of the same kind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-165a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.7 The Viscount of Chǔ, because of the events at Lì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">there was a solar eclipse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:54:34.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is to understand that the emperor and I,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">attacked Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">B7.9.8 Xì Quē of Jìn rescued Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.5 Jǐ sì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:54:34.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">both receive from nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Count of Zhèng defeated the Chǔ army at Liǔ Fén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Marquess Yuán of Qí died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:54:34.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, we can forget nobility and baseness in the relationship between ruler and subject,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.5 On *jǐ sì*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of the state were all happy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-173a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:26.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:54:34.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and disregard good and evil in honor and disgrace,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Marquis Yuán of Qí died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">only Zǐ Liáng worried and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-173a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:49:51.447+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-166a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"This is a disaster for the state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-167a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">my death is not far off."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-167a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10 *The Annals of the Tenth Year of Duke Xuān*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-168a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-168a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.1 In the spring of the tenth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-168a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Duke went to Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-169a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-169a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.2 The Duke returned from Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-170a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-170a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.3 The people of Qí returned the fields west of the Jì River to us.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.4 In the fourth month, on the day bǐng chén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">there was a solar eclipse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.5 On the day jǐ sì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Marquis Yuán of Qí died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-173a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T02:53:34.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Saying that my inner qualities are genuine and honest,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I align myself with the principles of nature and make them my companions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Knowing that emperors and I</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">both receive our nature from Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can we be mindful of the difference between noble and base in the relationship of ruler and subject,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">abandon good and evil based on honor and disgrace,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">or preserve our reputation to avoid evil,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and seek goodness from others?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Possessing such an open mind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-133a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one is probably in accordance with reason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-134a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】"Qí hū" (蘄乎) is pronounced "qí" (祈).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-135a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【三】【注】Relying on the principles of Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-135a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">extending one's own (nature) [trusting] (two) fate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-135a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">like a baby moving straightforwardly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】Yes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Tóngzǐ (童子),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a baby.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If, as previously explained,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one follows reason and advances straightforwardly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">acting like a baby,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then people call him Tóngzǐ (童子).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Concluding the previous meaning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-136a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore this is called being a companion of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【四】【疏】Those whose external form is crooked</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and who follow the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are taking human relations as their companions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Raising hands and kneeling,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">bending low at the waist and bowing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">bowing up and down and prostrating themselves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the etiquette of subjects.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But harmonizing with the dust and dirt,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">accepting prosperity and disgrace and yielding to things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:00:39.603+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">everyone does this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:12.783+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.4 Summer, fourth month, bǐngchén day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-171a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:12.783+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">there was a solar eclipse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:12.783+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:12.783+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.5 Jǐsì day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-172a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:12.783+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Marquis Yuán of Qí died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:27.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">bending over and bowing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-173a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:12.783+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:27.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">prostrating and submitting,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:27.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are the rites of a subject.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:27.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And harmonizing with the dust and dirt,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:27.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">accepting prosperity and disgrace according to circumstances,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-137a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:03:27.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">everyone does this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-144a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:05:53.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to blame.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-144a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:05:53.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The words presented,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-144a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:05:53.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">although they are educational traces,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-144a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:05:53.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">discussing their meaning and purpose,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-144a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:05:53.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in reality there is a heart of satire and censure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-145a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:05:53.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] *zhé zhī*, *zhí gé fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-152a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:16.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-152a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:16.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it only goes this far,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-152a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:16.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can it reach transformation</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-152a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:16.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is like one who takes his own mind as his teacher</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-153a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:16.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-153a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:16.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and one promulgates three articles to govern it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-180a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:45.474+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the King of Heaven sent Wáng Jìzǐ (王季子) as a diplomatic envoy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-181a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:45.474+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-181a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:45.474+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.14 Gōngsūn Guīfù (公孫歸父) led the army to attack Zhū (邾) and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-181a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:45.474+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">seized Yì (繹).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-182a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:45.474+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-182a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:10:45.474+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.10.15 Great floods.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:14.711+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Dà Duō Zhèng 大多政"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:17.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">大多政者，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:14.711+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is what Guō's 郭 commentary calls "when in accordance with principle, there is no duality, but to set forth three articles to govern."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:17.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">as Guō Zhù explains, believe there should be only one principle, but they publicize three articles to govern with.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:14.711+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Fǎ ér Bù Dié 法而不諜,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:14.711+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these four characters form a sentence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:17.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">法而不諜，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:17.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a phrase of four characters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:17.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Liè Yǔ Kòu* 列禦寇 chapter, "xíng dié chéng guāng 形諜成光,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:17.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the explanatory text says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">大多政者， Most rulers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Most rulers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō Zhù 郭注 describes it as "when principle is singular, yet one lays out three articles to govern with."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō Zhù 郭注 describes it as "when principle is singular, yet one lays out three articles to govern with."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">大多政者， Most of the methods of governance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō (郭) 注所謂當理無二而張三條以政之也。 As Guō (郭) Commentary says, means that in principle there is no divergence, yet three regulations are instituted to govern.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">法而不諜， "Law without *dié*,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">法而不諜， "Law without *dié*,"<seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:17.129+09:00">Four characters forming a phrase.</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Four characters forming a phrase.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Four characters forming a phrase.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Law but no dié,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Liè Yǔkòu 列禦寇 chapter: "Shape *dié* becomes light."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Liè Yǔkòu 列禦寇 chapter: "Shape *dié* becomes light."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a four-character phrase.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shìwén 釋文 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shìwén 釋文 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the Liè Yùkòu chapter, "Shape dié becomes light,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">諜,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">諜,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the explanation says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Dié* means convenient and biased.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Dié* means convenient and biased.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">諜， "Dié (諜),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The meaning of *dié* here is the same as that there,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "convenient and partial."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The meaning of *dié* here is the same as that there,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning having laws and measures, but without being convenient and biased.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning having laws and measures, but without being convenient and biased.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">此諜字義與彼同， The meaning of this "dié (諜)" character is the same as that one,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ Xùn 李訓 explaining it as "peace,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning there is a law but it is not convenient and impartial.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ Xùn 李訓 explaining it as "peace,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">Cuī 崔 explaining it as "espionage,"<seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:17.129+09:00">both miss the meaning.</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī 崔 explaining it as "espionage,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ Xùn (李訓) 安， Lǐ Xùn (李訓)'s interpretation of "ān" (安),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and Cuī explains it as "espionage,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">both miss the meaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">both miss the meaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-156a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Second article] [Commentary:] Although not yet vast and grand,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-155a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">並失其義。 Both miss the meaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-156a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Second article] [Commentary:] Although not yet vast and grand,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-156a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it will also not incur blame or reproach.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-156a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it will also not incur blame or reproach.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-156a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Annotation 2] Though not expansive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary:] Establishing these three articles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary:] Establishing these three articles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-156a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one still will not be blamed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:16:43.404+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Another explanation:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] If these three regulations are established,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">even if they are truly narrow and ignorant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:16:43.404+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one stops and does not act,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">even if they are truly narrow and ignorant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">since there is no traveling,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">even if they are foolish and shallow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:16:43.404+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in principle, it is right.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">since there is no traveling,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">既未行李， Since they have not yet had any effect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is also fortunate that there will be no blame or reproach.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:16:43.404+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If he goes to Wèi 衛,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is also fortunate that there will be no blame or reproach.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-157a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one is fortunately without blame.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:16:43.404+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he will certainly encounter danger himself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Third article] [Commentary:] Guilt there will be none,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Third article] [Commentary:] Guilt there will be none,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but transformation, that is not yet.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Annotation 3] There will be no crime,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-160a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:16:43.404+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Fourth article] [Commentary:] Holding these three methods to go to that place,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but transformation, that is not yet.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">化則未也。 But transformation will not have occurred.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary:] *Hú*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary:] *Hú*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">what does it mean?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elaboration】 "Hú,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what does it mean?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yán Huí 顏回 transforming Wèi 衛,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">何也。 What does it mean?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yán Huí 顏回 transforming Wèi 衛,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">only had this method;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yán Huí (顏回) 化衛， Yán Huí (顏回)'s transforming the state of Wèi (衛),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">only had this method;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">止有是法， Only had this method,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">only able to perfect himself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">only able to perfect himself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">纔可獨善， Sufficient only for cultivating oneself alone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">not yet able to benefit the times,<seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:11:17.129+09:00">therefore, how could it be said to reach transformation?</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not yet able to benefit the times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, how could it be said to reach transformation?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, how could it be said to reach transformation?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not reaching the point of helping the times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Another explanation:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故何可以及化也。 Therefore, how could it achieve transformation?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Another explanation:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If you stop and do not proceed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Another explanation:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If you stop and do not proceed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it would be in accordance with reason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">若止而勿行， If one stops and does not act,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it would be in accordance with reason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">As for his going to Wèi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:44.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">As for his going to Wèi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in principle, it is appropriate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he would inevitably bring danger upon himself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">如其適衛， If one goes to Wèi (衛),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he would inevitably bring danger upon himself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-160a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-160a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:27.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-159a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he will certainly bring danger upon himself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-160a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:14:47.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Four】【Commentary】 Taking these three arts to go there,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-165a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:29.972+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To have [intentions] and act,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-165a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:29.972+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is that easy?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-165a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:29.972+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who take it easy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-165a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:29.972+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are not fit for Tiān</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-166a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:29.972+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-166a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:29.972+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is truly not easy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-205a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:49.482+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Viscount of Chǔ [楚子],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-205a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:49.482+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Marquis of Chén [陳侯],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-165a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-205a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:49.482+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the Count of Zhèng [鄭伯] formed an alliance at Chénlíng [辰陵].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-165a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Having [a mind] (1) and doing it, is it easy?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-206a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:49.482+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-206a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:24:49.482+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.11.3 Gōngsūn Guīfù [公孫歸父] met with the people of Qí [齊] to attack Jǔ [莒].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-165a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He who makes it easy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-165a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">under the sky it is not appropriate</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-166a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-166a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">truly it is not easy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-167a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary:] Yán Huí 顏回 earnestly requested instruction,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-167a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Nífù 尼父 explained the fasting of the mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-167a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If you can only empty and forget,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-167a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I will then tell you.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-167a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If you must have that mind in order to act,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-167a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then it deviates from the subtlety of the fasting of the mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-167a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, seeking the profound Way with a mind set on it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-167a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is truly not easy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:26:17.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It speaks of its breath being pure and vast.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text:] In the "Yuē Qí" 曰齊 edition, it is also written as 齋,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the same,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:26:17.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He who takes having-doing as easy in practicing the Way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:26:17.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">under the sky,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pronounced cè jiē fǎn 側皆反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:26:17.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one does not see its appropriateness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo 盧文弨 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:26:17.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It says that it is not appropriate to fast the mind with having-doing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The current edition has 齋.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-171a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:26:17.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text:] "Qǐ tiān" 天, Xú 徐 reads hú lǎo fǎn 胡老反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Qí yì" 其易 is pronounced yǐ chì fǎn 以豉反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same hereafter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiàng Cuī 向崔 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-168a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Easy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-169a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-169a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one has not seen its appropriateness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary:] The Ěryǎ 爾雅 says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">summer is called hàotiān 皓天.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It speaks of its breath being vast and boundless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To practice the Way with a mind of intentional action (有為, yǒu wéi) thinking it is easy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It speaks of its qi being brightly white.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">under the sky (天, qǐ tiān),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To practice the Dao with a mind of intentional action,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">under all of Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is not seen as appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means it is inappropriate to practice fasting with a mind of intentional action (有為, yǒu wéi).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nothing seems appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-171a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Annotations and Explanations】《天》: Xú reads Hú lǎo fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-170a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It says that it is not appropriate to purify the mind with intentional action.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-171a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiàng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-171a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:25:01.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Annotations and Explanations】《Qǐ Tiān》: Xú reads Hú lǎo fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-171a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">天 (qǐ tiān),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-171a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is naturalness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-171a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-171a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the old version, "皞" (hào) follows "白" (bái),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-171a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now it follows the annotated version and follows "日" (rì).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-172a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Corrections】(1) The word "心" (xīn, mind) is supplemented based on the quotation from Zhāng Jūnfáng's version and the annotation in "Quēwù".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-172a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) Zhào's Commentary lacks the character "之" (zhī).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-173a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yán Huí said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-173a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"My family, Huí's (回) family, is poor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-173a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I have refrained from drinking wine and eating meat for several months.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-173a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In this state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-173a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">can I be considered to be fasting?" [一]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一】【Commentary】茹 (rú) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to eat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">葷 (hūn) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pungent vegetables.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">齋 (zhāi) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">purification,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning that both mind and actions are not tainted by worldly defilements.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yán Zǐ's (顏子) family is poor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">There is no wine to drink,<seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:26:17.225+09:00">no meat to eat.</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There is no wine to drink,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">historians know this in detail.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">no meat to eat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">no meat to eat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There is no wine to drink,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">With a bamboo basket, simple vegetables,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">With a bamboo basket, simple vegetables,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it has been like this for several months.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it has been like this for several months.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">no meat to eat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He asks if this can be considered as fasting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">With only a bamboo basket of vegetables,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He asks if this can be considered as fasting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it has been several months.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-175a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Annotations and Explanations】《不茹》: Xú reads Rǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-175a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:29:05.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Annotations and Explanations】《不茹》: Xú reads Rǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-174a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Can this be considered fasting?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-175a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:27:14.921+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】《Bù Rú (不茹)》: Xú's pronunciation is rǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:30:24.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The King sent someone to rebuke him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:30:24.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:30:24.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Xià Zhēngshū acted without principle</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:30:24.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and murdered his lord.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:30:24.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I, as a ruler, along with the other lords, punished and executed him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:30:24.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The lords and county officials all congratulated me,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:32:13.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">You summoned the lords under the pretense of punishing the guilty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:32:13.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but returned with greed as your motive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:32:13.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Isn't that improper?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:32:13.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The king said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:32:13.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Excellent!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-218a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:32:13.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I had not heard of this."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-222a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:34:15.112+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.12.2 The Viscount of Chǔ besieged Zhèng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-223a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:34:15.112+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-223a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:34:15.112+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A7.12.3 In summer, the sixth month, yǐ mǎo day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-223a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:34:15.112+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xún Línfǔ of Jìn led his army and fought with the Viscount of Chǔ at Bì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-223a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:34:15.112+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the army of Jìn suffered a great defeat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-224a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:34:15.112+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:35:07.946+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:35:07.946+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of the state made a great stand, and all those guarding the battlements wept.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:35:07.946+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:35:07.946+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Chǔ ruler withdrew his army.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:35:07.946+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of Zhèng repaired the city walls.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:35:07.946+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He advanced and besieged it again.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">placing us on equal footing with the nine counties,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">placing us on equal footing with the nine counties,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">that would be your kindness,<seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:35:07.946+09:00">my wish,</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">that would be your kindness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">my wish,<seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:35:07.946+09:00">something I would not dare to hope for.</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">my wish,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">something I would not dare to hope for.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">something I would not dare to hope for.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to lay bare my heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to lay bare my heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">may my lord truly consider it."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:04.951+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">may my lord truly consider it."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:29.429+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">To be treated the same as the nine counties</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:29.429+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">is your Highness's favor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:29.429+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but not something I dare to hope for.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:29.429+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to lay bare my heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-229a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:36:29.429+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">may your Highness truly consider it."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:07.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means that the function of the mind is limited to corresponding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:07.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, "do not listen with the mind."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:07.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The term "fú" 符 means to correspond,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:07.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning to correspond with external things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:07.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one corresponds with external things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:07.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then it is not the meaning of being empty and receptive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">言心之用止於符而已，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故無聽之以心也。 The function of the mind stops at "matching" (fú) only; therefore, one should not listen with the mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">符之言合也，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">言與物合也，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The function of speech and mind is limited to correspondence</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">與物合，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, therefore, one should not listen with the mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">則非虛而待物之謂矣。 The meaning of "matching" (fú) is "to correspond." To correspond is for words to correspond with things. If they correspond with things, then it is not a matter of being empty and waiting for things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Correspondence means agreement</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">氣也者虛而待物者也，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, speech agreeing with things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">乃申說氣字，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Agreeing with things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">明當聽之以氣也。 "Breath" (qì) is that which is empty and waits for things. Therefore, the text elaborates on the word "breath" (qì) to clarify that one should listen with the breath (qì).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means it is not emptiness awaiting things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">郭注曰遺耳目去心意等語，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Qì" refers to emptiness awaiting things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">誤以符氣二字連讀，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, thus explaining the character "qì"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不特失其義，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, clarifying that one should listen with "qì".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">且不成句矣。 Guō's commentary, saying "abandoning ears and eyes, removing intention of the mind," mistakenly reads the characters "matching" (fú) and "breath" (qì) together. This not only loses the meaning but also makes the sentence grammatically incorrect.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō's commentary says "abandoning ears and eyes, discarding mind and intention," etc.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-190a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【七】【注】虛其心則至道集於懷也。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">mistakenly reading the characters "fú" (符) and "qì" (氣) together</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】唯此真道，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, not only missing the meaning</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">集在虛心。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, but also making it an incomplete sentence</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故如虛心者，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-190a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">. 【7】【Commentary】Emptiness of the mind allows the ultimate Dao to gather in one's embrace</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">. 【Explanation】Only this true Dao</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">心齋妙道也。 [Explanation:] Only this true Dao gathers in the empty mind. Therefore, being like having an empty mind is the wonderful path of "fasting of the mind" (xīnzhāi).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gathers in an empty mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-192a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【校】（一）者乎二字依世德堂本刪。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, being like having an empty mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-192a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">（二）遺字依世德堂本及諸子平議改。 [Corrections:] (1) The characters "zhě hū" are deleted according to the Shìdétáng edition. (2) The character "yí" is corrected according to the Shìdétáng edition and *Zhūzǐ Píngyì*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">顏回曰：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the wonderful path of mind-fasting</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">「回之未始得使，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-192a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">. 【Corrections】(1) The characters "zhě" (者) and "hū" (乎) are deleted according to the Shìdétáng edition</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-192a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">. (2) The character "yí" (遺) is changed according to the Shìdétáng edition and *Zhūzǐ Píngyì*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">實自回也【一】；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">. Yán Huí said</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">得使之也，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">: "When I had not yet begun to be employed</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">未始有回也【二】；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">as a complete sentence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">可謂虛乎？」 Yán Huí said: "Before I began to be employed, I was in fact myself</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-194a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一】【注】未始使心齋，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">when I am employed</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-194a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故有其身。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, there has not yet been a Huí</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】未稟心齋之教，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">can this be called emptiness?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-194a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【1】【Commentary】Not yet having practiced mind-fasting</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Saying that the function of the heart/mind stops at "fú" (符, matching) only</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">猶懷封滯之心，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-194a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, therefore there is one's body</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">既不能隳體以忘身，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, therefore one should not listen with the heart/mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">尚謂顏回之實有也。 [Explanation:] Not yet having received the teaching of "fasting of the mind" (xīnzhāi), one still harbors a closed and obstructed mind. Since one is not yet able to discard the body and forget the self, it is still said that Yán Huí actually exists.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">. 【Explanation】Not yet having received the teaching of mind-fasting</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The meaning of "fú" (符, matching) is "to accord"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, one still harbors a closed mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】《未始得使》絕句。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, meaning that words accord with things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To accord with things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:30.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">崔讀至實字絕句。 [Textual Explanation:] "Before I began to be employed" is a complete sentence. Cuī reads up to the character "shí" (real) as a complete sentence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, unable to abandon the body to forget oneself</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, then it is not what is called being empty and waiting for things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, it is still considered that Yán Huí exists in reality</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">. 【Explanation of the Text】《Wèi Shǐ Dé Shǐ》</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Qì" (氣, spirit/vital energy) refers to being empty and waiting for things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:41:40.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">. Cuī reads up to the character *shí*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, thus it explains the word "qì" (氣, spirit/vital energy) further,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">clarifying that one should listen with "qì" (氣, spirit/vital energy).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō's (郭) commentary, saying "abandon ears and eyes, discard heart/mind intentions," etc.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, mistakenly reads the two characters "fú" (符, matching) and "qì" (氣, spirit/vital energy) consecutively</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, not only missing their meanings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-189a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, but also making the sentence incoherent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-190a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】【Commentary】 Emptying one's heart/mind allows the ultimate Dao to gather in one's bosom.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 Only this true Dao</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gathers in an empty heart/mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, resembling those with an empty heart/mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-191a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the wondrous Dao of "xīnzhāi" (心齋, mind-fasting).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-192a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Corrections】 (1) The characters "zhě hū" (者乎) are deleted according to the Shìdétáng (世德堂) edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:24.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] Before receiving the teaching of "xīnzhāi" (心齋, mind-fasting),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-192a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) The character "yí" (遺) is changed according to the Shìdétáng (世德堂) edition and Zhūzǐ Píngyì (諸子平議).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yánhuí (顏回) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:24.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he still harbored a closed and obstructed heart/mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Before I had begun to be employed</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:24.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, being unable to cast off his body to forget himself</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, it was truly Yánhuí (顏回) himself</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:24.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, he still considered Yánhuí (顏回) to have substantial existence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】Before receiving the teachings of the "heart-fasting,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:24.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of Text] "Wèi shǐ dé shǐ" (未始得使) is a complete sentence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">having been employed</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one still harbors a mind that is closed and stagnant.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:24.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) reads up to the character "shí" (實) as a complete sentence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since one cannot destroy the body to forget the self,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, there was never a Yánhuí (顏回)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-193a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">can this be called emptiness?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one still thinks that Yán Huí's 顏回 substance truly exists.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-194a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】“Wèi Shǐ Dé Shǐ” 未始得使 (Never Began to Obtain) is a concluding passage.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-194a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, he possessed his (physical) self.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Master Cuī 崔 stopped reading at the word "substance", concluding the passage.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-197a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Second [section]】【Note】Once one obtains the envoys of "heart-fasting,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】Before receiving the teachings of the "heart-fasting,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one still harbors a mind of obstruction and stagnation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-197a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then there is no self.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-198a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】Once one obtains the Master's teaching</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since one cannot disregard the body to forget the self,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-198a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:45:41.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and uses the empty fast (heart-fasting) on the person,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-195a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one still considers Yán Huí's 顏回 state to be something truly attainable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】《Wèi Shǐ Dé Shǐ》 is a verse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-196a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:43:52.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī interrupted his reading at the word "shí" 實.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-203a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:05.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and furthermore, when roaming near its borders,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-203a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:05.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you should also conceal your tracks and eliminate your voice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-203a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:05.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">You cannot use reputation and wisdom to affect things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-203a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:05.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Fán 樊</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-203a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:05.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means the borders (fān 蕃).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-204a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:05.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Third】【Note】It is like the gōng 宮 and shāng 商 musical notes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-208a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:51.737+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and do not act preemptively.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:51.737+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory notes】 《Wú dú》, as the character indicates,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:51.737+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to govern.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:51.737+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī's version has měi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:51.737+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:47:51.737+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means greedy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:48:46.654+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xǔ dǎo below says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:48:46.654+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To protect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:48:46.654+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also means high earth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:48:46.654+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">read as "dú."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:48:46.654+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This annotation is consistent with the meaning of self-settling.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-209a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:48:46.654+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhāng Xíngfú's Shuōwén Fāyí says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-211a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:18.756+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】"Zhái" (宅) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-211a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:18.756+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"residence."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-211a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:18.756+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Dwelling in the way of utmost unity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-211a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:18.756+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one cannot stop but respond to it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-211a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:18.756+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the merging of mechanism and inspiration,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-211a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:18.756+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not a pre-planned scheme."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-215a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:58.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what Yǔ (禹) and Shùn (舜) held together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-215a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:58.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what Fúxī (伏戲) and Jī Qú (几蘧) practiced to the end,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-215a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:58.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much more so those who are scattered! [Eight]!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-216a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:58.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【One】【Note】 Not walking is easy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-216a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:58.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but desiring to walk without touching the ground</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-216a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:50:58.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is impossible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-219a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:51:51.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus, those who lose little of their true nature</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-219a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:51:51.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will also lose little of their wholeness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-219a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:51:51.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who lose much of their true nature</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-219a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:51:51.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will also lose much of their wholeness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-219a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:51:51.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The recompense of loss and gain</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-219a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:51:51.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has never failed to be appropriate to its portion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-225a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:52:37.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Four] [Note] To see as if not seeing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-225a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:52:37.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a vacant room.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-225a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:52:37.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In a vacant room, purity and whiteness alone arise.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-226a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:52:37.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Zhān 瞻 (zhān)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-226a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:52:37.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to observe and illuminate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-226a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:52:37.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">That,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-228a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:21.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is utmost emptiness and stillness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:21.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Elucidation] "Jí (吉)" refers to</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:21.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">matters of good fortune and virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:21.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Xiáng (祥)" refers to</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:21.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">omens of joy and celebration.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:21.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zhǐ (止)" means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-228a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Utmost emptiness, utmost stillness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】"Jí" 吉</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to auspicious, good deeds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Xiáng" 祥</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to a sign of joyous celebration.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zhǐ" 止</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the wisdom of tranquility and stillness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It says that auspiciousness, goodness, and blessings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-228a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Utmost emptiness and utmost stillness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">reside in a tranquil and still mind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] "Jí" (吉),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to auspicious and good matters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and can also bring about auspicious and good responses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Yú Yuè 俞樾 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Xiáng" (祥),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The repetition of "zhǐ zhǐ" 止止</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to signs of joy and celebration.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zhǐ" (止),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is meaningless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Huáinánzǐ, Chùzhēn* 淮南子俶真 chapter says, "An empty room generates light,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the wisdom of tranquility and stillness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Saying that auspiciousness and goodness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">auspiciousness resides there,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I suspect that the "zhǐ" 止 character at the end of this sentence is a mistake for the character "yě" 也.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">resides in a tranquil and still heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and can also bring about an auspicious and good response.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">During the Táng 唐 Dynasty, Lú Chóngyuán 盧重元 annotated the *Lièzǐ, Tiānruì* 列子天瑞 chapter, saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:52.407+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one's spirit is racing about.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yú Yuè (俞樾) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"An empty room generates light,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:52.407+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One may be said to have one's body sitting still while one's mind is racing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The repeated "zhǐ zhǐ" (止止),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:52.407+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Seventh】 【Commentary】 If one causes the ears and eyes to be closed and naturally obtains something,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">auspiciousness resides there,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">makes no sense.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which can also prove the error of the repeated "zhǐ zhǐ."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:52.407+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the function of the mind's knowledge is external.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Huáinánzǐ Chùzhēn Piān* (淮南子俶真篇) says, "An empty room gives birth to light;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sixth】 【Commentary】 If one does not stop at what is appropriate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:52.407+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, one should let nature take its course directly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">auspiciousness resides there,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and does not understand the ultimate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:52.407+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and there will be nowhere one does not accord with it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:55:25.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And the spirit gallops about,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:55:25.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it cannot be said to be the form sitting still while the mind wanders.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is to exhaust oneself with endless pursuits on the very days one should be at rest.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">suspecting that the second "zhǐ" (止) in this text is a mistake for "yě" (也).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:55:25.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】【Commentary】 Now, if one closes the ears and eyes and naturally obtains something,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, before external enemies arrive, one is already exhausted internally;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Táng (唐) Lú Chóngyuán's (盧重元) commentary on the *Lièzǐ Tiānruì Piān* (列子天瑞篇) says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can one transform things?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"An empty room gives birth to light;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:55:25.899+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the use of the mind's knowledge is external.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">auspiciousness resides there,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 If one cannot make one's form like withered wood</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-229a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which can also prove the error of the repeated "zhǐ zhǐ" (止止).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and one's mind like dead ashes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then even though one's appearance is upright and composed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and does not understand the ultimate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And if the spirit gallops about,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one (cannot) [can] say that the body sits still while the mind races.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is akin to exhausting oneself by day through constant striving when one should be resting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus, before external enemies arrive, one is already internally exhausted;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】【Commentary】Now, if one closes the ears and eyes and naturally obtains understanding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-230a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can one transform things?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the function of the mind's knowledge is externalized.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] If one cannot make one's form like withered wood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, if one allows nature to flow directly through,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:53:43.015+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is nowhere one does not penetrate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and one's heart like dead ashes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then even if one's appearance is upright and respectful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one's spirit is still racing about.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It can be said that the form is sitting but the mind is racing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one's spirit is rushing about.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-231a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This can be said to be a form sitting while the heart rushes about.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to externalize the use of mental knowledge.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Seventh Paragraph] [Commentary] When one closes one's ears and eyes and obtains it naturally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, one should allow the nature to flow straight through,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the function of the mind's knowledge is externalized.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:54:05.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and there will be nowhere that one does not accord with.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, one will let nature take its course directly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and there will be nowhere one does not understand.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is no blame for being obscure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-232a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much more so for the burdens of the human world!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 *Xùn* means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to cause.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, if one can cause the root orifices to communicate internally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not relying on external things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the spirit is tranquil and still,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">forgetting external mind-knowledge,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then one dismisses the external form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">forgets internal wisdom,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and thus abandons the body, rejects cleverness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">empties the mind and entrusts oneself to things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">spirits and deities secretly attach themselves and abide;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-234a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:57:54.649+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">same as the commentary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is this not appropriate?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:57:54.649+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【8】【Commentary】 It speaks of things without noble or base,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Human relationships look up to and return to reliance;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:57:54.649+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there has never been anything that does not communicate through the mind-knowledge, ears, and eyes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is certainly fitting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:57:54.649+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, those whom the world calls knowledgeable,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-233a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the outer chapter says there is no blame from ghosts and no fault from people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:57:54.649+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could they desire to know and then know?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-234a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】 "Fú *xùn*," *cí* is pronounced *jùn*, reverse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:57:54.649+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who are said to see,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-234a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xú*, *cí* is pronounced *lún*, reverse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-234a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:22.476+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same as the commentary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-234a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-234a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To cause.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-234a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Xīnzhī*" is pronounced *zhì*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-234a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">As in the commentary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Eight] [Commentary]: It says that things have no inherent nobility or baseness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is nothing that does not come to understand itself through the mind and eyes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-234a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the commentary is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Eight】【Commentary】It says that things have no nobility or baseness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, those who are called "wise" in the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do they truly desire to know and then know?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there has never been a case where something does not use the knowledge of the mind, ears and eyes in order to communicate itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:56:53.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who are called "seeing,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, those in the world who are called knowledgeable,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do they desire to know in order to know?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who are called seeing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do they truly see because they (diligently) seek to see?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If knowledge and vision could be obtained by desire (and) effort,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then could one become virtuous by desiring virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">could one become a sage by striving to be a sage?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Surely not!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But the world does not understand that knowing comes from one's own inherent knowledge,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so they try to force knowledge in order to know;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they do not understand that seeing comes from one's own inherent vision,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so they try to force vision in order to see;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they do not understand that life arises from its own inherent vitality,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so they try to force life in order to create life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, looking at the eyes, they seek the clarity of Lí Zhū (離朱);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">looking at the ears, they demand the acute hearing of Shī Kuàng (師曠);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus, the mind and spirit race about internally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the ears and eyes are exhausted and depleted externally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">finding themselves uncomfortable and out of sync with the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:59:53.488+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">here referring to the methods of the *Xīnzhāi* (心齋) and others mentioned earlier,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:59:53.488+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which can create all things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one is out of sync,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can they possibly conform to the changes of the human world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:59:53.488+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and nurture the populace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and respond to the rhythms of successive ages?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:59:53.488+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Riding an ox, riding a horse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:59:53.488+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he was called Fúxī (伏羲),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-235a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It has never happened.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:59:53.488+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his surname was Fēng (風),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation]: "This"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a term of criticism,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This refers to the methods of *Xīn Zhāi* 心齋 and others of the past,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Here, it refers to methods such as the previous Xīnzhāi 心齋 (Fasting of the Heart),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which were able to create all things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which were able to create all things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and nurture all living beings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and nurture all living beings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Riding on an ox,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Riding on an ox,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he was called *Fú Xī* 伏戲,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he was called *Fú Xī* 伏戲,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his surname was *Fēng* 風,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T03:58:42.42+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his surname was *Fēng* 風,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he was also known as *Tài Hào* 太昊.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">As for *Jī Qú* 几蘧,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he was a ruler before the Three Emperors without written language.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Saying that this method of *Xīn Zhāi* 心齋</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">was considered by *Xià Yǔ* 夏禹 and *Yú Shùn* 虞舜 to be the guiding principle for responding to things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This refers to the methods of *xīnzhāi* 心齋 (fasting of the mind) and others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and *Fú Xī* 伏戲 and *Jī Qú* 几蘧 practiced it throughout their lives,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which can create and transform all things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and nurture all living beings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much more should ordinary, vulgar, and dissipated people in the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Riding an ox on a horse,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】"所紐 (suǒ niǔ)": *Xú* 徐 reads it as nǚ jiǔ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he was called Fúxī 伏戲,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Cuī* 崔 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To tie and carry out is called "紐 (niǔ)".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with the surname Fēng 風.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Jiǎn Wén* 簡文 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also known as *Tàihào* 太昊.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Jǐqú* 几蘧</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">紐 (niǔ)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means the root.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">were rulers without writing before the Three Sovereigns.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Saying that the *xīnzhāi* 心齋 path,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《伏戲 (Fú Xī)》: The original text also appears as 羲 (Xī),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xià Yǔ* 夏禹 and *Yú Shùn* 虞舜 considered it the guiding principle for responding to things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also written as 犧 (Xī),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they are the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Fúxī* 伏戲 and *Jǐqú* 几蘧 practiced it until the end of their lives,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Read as xǔ yí fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much more should ordinary, vulgar, and undisciplined people in the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">That is *Dà Hào* 大●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-236a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">follow this path and desire to transform things?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation] *Suǒ Niǔ* 所紐 (what is tied): *Xú* 徐 pronounces *nǚ jiǔ* 女酒反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the beginning of the Three Emperors.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Cuī* 崔 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《几蘧 (Jī Qú)》: Read as qí jū fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xiàng* 向 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to tie and practice it is called *niǔ* 紐.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">An ancient emperor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Jiǎnwén* 簡文 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Lǐ* 李 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Niǔ* 紐</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">An emperor of high antiquity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means root.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《散焉 (sàn yān)》: Read as xī dàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Fúxī* 伏戲: one version is also written as 羲,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also written as 犧,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Lǐ* 李 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:00:25.12+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To let go.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pronounced *Xǔ Yí* 許宜反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is *Dà* 大 (the same as 太 *Tài*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Jǐqú* 几蘧: Pronounced *qí jū* 其居反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xiàng* 向 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">ancient emperors and kings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Lǐ* 李 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">emperors and kings of high antiquity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Sàn Yān* 散焉: Pronounced *xī dàn* 悉旦反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Lǐ* 李 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:01:11.273+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to release.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:03:40.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He was an ancient emperor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:03:40.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ 李 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:03:40.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He was an ancient emperor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:03:40.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《散焉》(sàn yān): Pronounced xī dàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:03:40.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ 李 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-237a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:03:40.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To release.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:28.857+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then there will surely be the misfortune of yin and yang.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:28.857+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one can succeed or fail and still have no misfortune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:33.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then there must be the problem of yin and yang</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:33.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If it succeeds or fails and afterwards there are no problems,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:33.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">only a virtuous person can do so.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:33.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">My food is coarse and not delicious,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:33.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">my cooking lacks people who seek purity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:33.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now I receive my orders in the morning and drink ice water in the evening,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then there must be the affliction of *yīn* and *yáng*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one succeeds or fails and afterwards has no affliction,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">only one with virtue is capable of this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When I eat, I hold to coarse food and do not hoard it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and my cook has no desire for fine food.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, I receive my commission in the morning and drink ice in the evening,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">am I perhaps suffering from internal heat?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I have not yet reached the essence of the matter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and already I have the affliction of *yīn* and *yáng*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is a double bind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">a minister is not sufficient to undertake this task;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-239a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you must have something to tell me!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-240a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-240a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Elucidation] *Chǔ Zhuāng Wáng*'s great-grandson *Yǐn Chéngzǐ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">named *Zhū Liáng*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">styled *Zǐ Gāo*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">received *Yè* as his fief,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and presumptuously called himself a duke.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"King"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in the Spring and Autumn period was actually the Viscount of *Chǔ*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but he presumptuously called himself king.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Qí*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">was a descendant of the *Jiāng* clan, *Tàigōng*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">His ancestors were the Four Mountains of *Yǔ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:12.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">hence *Tàigōng* was called *Lǚ Wàng*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">some were enfeoffed in *Lǚ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:12.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">King *Wǔ* of *Zhōu* enfeoffed *Tàigōng* in *Yíngqiū*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:12.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which became the state of *Qí*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Tài Gōng was called Lǚ Wàng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">King Wǔ of Zhōu enfeoffed Tài Gōng at Yíngqiū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:12.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The two states of *Qí* and *Chǔ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which became the state of Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:12.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">forged ties and exchanged visits,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, therefore Tàigōng was called Lǚ Wàng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:12.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">using jade and silk as gifts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The two states of Qí and Chǔ</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">King Wǔ of Zhōu enfeoffed Tàigōng at Yíngqiū</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, which became the state of Qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">established friendly relations and exchanged envoys.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The two states of Qí and Chǔ</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:04:53.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jade and silk were used as gifts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, formed an alliance and interacted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">exchanging jade and silk as envoys,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with envoys succeeding one another without interruption.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sometimes they sought aid in times of urgency or difficulty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">or requested troops to punish transgressions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The circumstances were not trivial,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the matters entrusted were of great importance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Zhūliáng worried</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-241a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and inquired of Zhòngní.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-242a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文 (Shìwén: Explanations of the Characters)】 "Yègōng" pronunciation is shè.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-242a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zǐgāo" was a high official of Chǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-242a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">serving as the magistrate of Yè County.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-242a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He presumptuously called himself "Gōng".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-242a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">His surname was Shěn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-242a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his given name was Zhūliáng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-242a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his courtesy name was Zǐgāo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-242a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jiāng shǐ" pronunciation suǒ lì fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-242a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Note and below, "dài shǐ" is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-243a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【二】【Note】Fearing that he would merely report their respect superficially,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-243a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but would not be willing to respond urgently to their request.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏 (Shū: Commentary)】The ruler of Qí treated their visits insincerely,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with no true sincerity in his heart.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When receiving the envoy from Chǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he was extremely attentive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but the matters requested</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">were not agreed upon immediately.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Because the commission was significant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he had this worry beforehand.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-245a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【三】【疏 (Shū: Commentary)】Even the lowly ambitions of a commoner</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-245a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:06:32.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cannot be easily moved.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:08:47.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but the matters requested,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:08:47.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he did not readily agree to after understanding them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:08:47.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Because the orders received were important,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-244a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:08:47.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he had this worry in advance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-245a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:08:47.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Three] [Commentary] Even the base ambition of a commoner</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-245a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:08:47.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cannot be easily moved.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-249a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:09:36.901+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the current version of this book, "cháng" is often written as "cháng" (嘗).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-250a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:09:36.901+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Five][Commentary] If joy comes from success,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-250a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:09:36.901+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">failure will lead to anger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-250a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:09:36.901+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is something that even the King of Chǔ cannot avoid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-251a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:09:36.901+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] If emotions are contrary and obstructed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-251a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:09:36.901+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and matters do not succeed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-257a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:29.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-257a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:29.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">clarifies that the food prepared is simple and meager.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:29.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation]: 臧 (zāng) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:29.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">清 (qīng) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:29.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cool.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-257a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Eight] [Commentary] Facing the fire, one does not think of coolness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-257a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">making clear that the food prepared is simple and meager.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] Zāng (臧),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means good.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qīng (清),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means cool.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Accepting the command with great seriousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">harboring fear in his heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">using rough meals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">having no time for elaborate food.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since the food prepared is simple and meager,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the cook does not want to think of coolness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">burning not much fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-258a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is no heat to avoid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of Text] "Zhí (執)" all versions read rán (然).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jiǎn Wén (簡文) makes it rè (熱).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Cū (粗)" pronounced cū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also cái gǔ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Ér bù zāng (而不臧)" reads láng fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning good.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A broken phrase.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One pronunciation cái láng fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the phrase ends at the character "cuàn (爨)".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:12:00.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qìng (凊),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Cuàn (爨)" qī luàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:12:00.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means cool.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Wú yù qīng (無欲清)" qī xìng fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:12:00.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zhī rén (之人)" means the cook considers fire as food and does not think of coolness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:12:00.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indicating the fire is weak and the food should be simple and meager.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the character should follow the form .</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:12:00.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Suǒ zhuàn (所饌)" shì liàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a loan character.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-260a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:12:00.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Nine] [Commentary] The food prepared is simple and meager, but internally hot, one drinks ice,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">凊 (qìng): Cool, refreshing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">涼 (liáng) 也 (yě): Is coolness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《之人》(Zhī Rén) 言 (yán) 爨 (cuàn) 火 (huǒ) 為 (wéi) 食 (shí) 而 (ér) 不 (bù) 思 (sī) 清 (qīng) 涼 (liáng): The "Zhī Rén" says that cooking with fire for food, one does not think of coolness and refreshment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">明 (míng) 火 (huǒ) 微 (wēi) 而 (ér) 食 (shí) 宜 (yí) 儉 (jiǎn) 薄 (bó): Clearly, the fire is small, and the food should be frugal and simple.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-259a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《所 (suǒ) 饌 (zhuàn)》士 (shì) 戀 (liàn) 反 (fǎn): "Suǒ Zhuàn" – shì liàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-260a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:10:56.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【九】【注】所 (suǒ) 饌 (zhuàn) 儉 (jiǎn) 薄 (bó) 而 (ér) 內 (nèi) 熱 (rè) 飲 (yǐn) 冰 (bīng) 者 (zhě): [Note] Those who eat frugally and simply, yet feel internal heat and drink ice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-264a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:26.027+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">刑 (xíng) 網 (wǎng) 斯 (sī) 及 (jí): The net of punishment will reach him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-264a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:26.027+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">有 (yǒu) 此 (cǐ) 二 (èr) 患 (huàn): With these two problems.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-264a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:26.027+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">何 (hé) 處 (chù) 逃 (táo) 愆 (qiān)?: Where can one escape transgression?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-265a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:26.027+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】《則 (zé) 恐 (kǒng) 懼 (jù)》丘 (qiū) 勇 (yǒng) 反 (fǎn): [Textual Explanation] "Zé Kǒng Jù" - qiū yǒng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:26.027+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一一】【疏】忝 (tiǎn) 為 (wéi) 人 (rén) 臣 (chén): [Commentary] Unworthy as a minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:26.027+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">濫 (làn) 充 (chōng) 末 (mò) 使 (shǐ): Presumptuously filling the role of a minor official.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-264a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The net of punishment will reach them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-264a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Having these two troubles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-264a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">where can they escape their guilt?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-265a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】 *zé kǒngjù* qiū yǒng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一一】【疏】 Having disgracefully become a minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and presumptuously filled a minor post,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with high position but shallow virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I am not worthy to be entrusted with it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">You, Master, are a sage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with a heart that benefits all things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">You must have a way to deal with this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-266a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I hope you will come and tell me!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-267a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】 *yǐ rèn* ér lín fǎn, yī yīn ér zhèn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-267a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-268a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【校】 (1) Quēwù cites an old Jiangnan collection, where this sentence reads: 寡有不道以成歡.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhòngní said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"The world has two great constraints:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The first,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is destiny;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The second,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is righteousness. [一]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Your love for your parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is destiny,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which cannot be released from the heart [二];</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A minister's service to his ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:03.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what is called a great constraint [四].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is no place where he is not the ruler's,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what is called a great precept.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:03.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, those who serve their parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and nowhere to escape between heaven and earth [三].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what is called a great precept</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:03.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not choose the place where they feel at ease,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, when serving one's parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, serving one's parents</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:03.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the utmost filial piety [五];</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one does not choose the place but finds peace in it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:03.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">those who serve their ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not choosing the place to settle them comfortably,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the ultimate filial piety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When serving one's ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:03.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not choose the task where they feel at ease,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the utmost filial piety</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one does not choose the task but finds peace in it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:44.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is called the great prohibition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Serving one's ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:13:48.344+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not choosing the task to settle into it comfortably,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the height of loyalty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:44.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, one who serves his parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:44.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Does not choose the place to find peace in it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When governing one's own heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:44.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the height of filial piety;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">grief and joy are not easily displayed outwardly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Knowing that there is nothing one can do about it, one accepts it as destiny and finds peace;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what is called a great precept</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, serving one's parents</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the ultimate virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without choosing the place to settle them is</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who are ministers and sons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the utmost filial piety</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indeed have things they cannot avoid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pursuing the truth of the matter and forgetting oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One who serves his lord,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could they have time to be pleased with life and hate death!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:38.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what is called the great admonition</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Does not choose the task to find peace in it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the height of loyalty</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Fūzǐ (夫子)'s actions are acceptable!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:38.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, one who serves his parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Serving one's own heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:38.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">does not choose the place but finds peace in it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-270a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary 1] *Jiè* (戒) means law.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-270a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there are extremely many teachings and laws.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:38.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the utmost filial piety [五].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not easily swayed by sorrow or joy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">knowing that it cannot be helped and settling into it as if it were fate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-270a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Speaking of the most essential,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:38.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One who serves his ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:38.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">does not choose the task but finds peace in it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-270a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nothing surpasses these two matters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the perfection of virtue</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Being a minister or a son,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:38.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the epitome of loyalty [六].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-270a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The meaning and purpose of these two matters</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-270a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are fully listed below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one inevitably has things one cannot avoid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:38.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One who serves his own heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:38.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">does not easily let sorrow or joy affect him;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-270a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pursuing the reality of the matter and forgetting oneself</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-269a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:16:11.211+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could one have time to be pleased with life and hate death!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-271a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:15:08.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary 2] Naturally bonded together,</seg>
