                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-273a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the way of Heaven and humanity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-273a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the inevitable propriety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] The relationship between ruler and minister, superior and inferior,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is inherently and necessarily so.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, a loyal minister serves his ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">sacrificing his life to fulfill his principles.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is a matter of shared duty and righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not related to innate nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Though the universe is vast,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-275a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there has never been a country without a ruler.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If there is guilt or fault,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-275a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-276a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">where can one escape blame?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, upon receiving a command, one should act immediately,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-272a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This kind of inherent nature</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-272a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, originates from the natural order</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without hesitation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-275a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Fourth Note] If the ruler can be abandoned and the parents can be forsaken,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-272a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, following its principles from the center</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-272a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, thus it cannot be unraveled.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-275a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then there is nothing to admonish.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-276a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Before, it was concluded that loyalty to the ruler and filial piety to parents were the greatest duties.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-273a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Third Commentary】When a thousand people gather</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-273a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, if no single person is the leader</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Fifth Commentary] A filial son cares for his parents</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-278a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">striving to comply with their wishes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-273a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, it will disperse into chaos.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Seeking office and salary,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-278a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:19:59.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-273a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, having many capable people cannot be the same as having many rulers</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he does not discriminate between high and low positions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-273a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, but one cannot be without a ruler even if there are no capable people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being content with whatever he encounters;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-273a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the principle of Heaven and humanity</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:13.298+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">each has appropriate clothing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is true filial piety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-273a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, and the inevitable course of events.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:13.298+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The noble have constant honor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:13.298+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the lowly have graded authority,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-278a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Sixth Commentary] In serving one's parents and serving one's ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】The relationship between ruler and subject, superior and inferior</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:13.298+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">ritual is not violated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-278a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:20:25.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one's will should be to devote oneself to loyalty and faithfulness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, is fundamentally inevitable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, a loyal subject serves his ruler</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:52.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Seeking office and pursuing salary</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:13.298+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Virtue is established, punishments are carried out,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:52.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, one should not be particular about high or low positions</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, accomplishing his duty even unto death</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:13.298+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">government is accomplished, affairs are timely,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, this is a matter of shared responsibility and righteousness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:52.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, finding peace and contentment in whatever one encounters</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, and not related to inherent nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:52.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, this is what defines utmost filial piety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">However, even though the universe is vast</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-278a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:52.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】In treating one's parents with propriety and serving one's lord</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, there is no state without a ruler</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-278a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:23:52.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, one should dedicate oneself to utmost loyalty and integrity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, and if there is guilt or blame</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, where can one escape punishment!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, upon receiving an order, one should act immediately</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-274a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, without hesitation or reservation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-275a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Fourth Commentary】If a ruler could be evaded and familial ties could be broken</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-275a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, then there would be nothing to deter wrongdoing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-276a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】The formation of the preceding section establishes the profound significance of the great moral principles of ruler and parent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】The duty of a filial son in nurturing his parents</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, lies in striving for their comfort and contentment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Seeking office and emolument,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not being selective about high or low positions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being content with whatever one encounters,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-277a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the way to be known as supremely filial.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-278a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Sixth Commentator] To serve one's parents and ruler with propriety,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-278a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:22:09.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to devote one's will to utmost loyalty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:24.301+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they do not deviate from heavenly principles.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:24.301+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If not for the utmost person of profound virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:24.301+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">who could be like this!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:24.301+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Textual Explanation] "Āi Lè" (哀樂) is pronounced Luò (洛).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:24.301+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same applies in the commentary below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:24.301+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shī Hū" (施乎) is used as written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不乖天理. Does not violate the principles of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">自非至人玄德， If not a supremely virtuous person like Xuán Dé,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">孰能如茲也！ who could be like this!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】《哀樂》音洛。 [Explanation of Characters] "Āi Lè" (grief and joy) is pronounced luò.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不乖天理. Not contrary to the principles of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">自非至人玄德， If not for the supremely virtuous Xuán Dé,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">注、下同。 Note: the same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">孰能如茲也！ who could be like this?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《施乎》如字。 "Shī hū" (to apply) is pronounced as written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">崔以豉反， Cuī [Shí] uses the pronunciation of "chǐ" 反 (fǎn, meaning to reverse or reflect).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】《哀樂》音洛。 [Explanation of pronunciation] "Āi Lè" is pronounced luò.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">注、下同。 Same in the commentary below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">云： Says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">移也。 It means "to move" or "to change" (yí).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《施乎》如字。 "Shī hū" is pronounced as written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">崔以豉反， Cuī pronounces it fǎn (反切 method),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎慶藩案施讀為移， ◎Qìngfān notes: "Shī" should be read as "yí,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">云： saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不易施， "bù yì shī",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">猶言不移易也。 is like saying "bù yí yì yě", it cannot be changed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">移也。 It means "to move."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不乖天理. Not violating the principles of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎慶藩案施讀為移， ◎Qìngfān argues that "shī" should be read as "yí,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">晏子春秋外篇君臣易施， In the "Outer Chapters" of the *Yàn Zǐ Chūn Qiū*, "君臣易施" (jūn chén yì shī, rulers and ministers easily shift positions),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">荀子儒效篇哀虛之相施易之， In the "Rú Xiào" chapter of the *Xún Zǐ*, "哀虛之相施易之" (āi xū zhī xiāng shī yì zhī, grief and emptiness exchange with each other),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">自非至人玄德， If not a supremely virtuous person with profound virtue (Zhìrén Xuándé),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不易施， "bù yì shī"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-280a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">孰能如茲也！ who could be like this!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">漢書衛綰傳人之所施易， In the biography of Wèi Wǎn in the *Hàn Shū*, "人之所施易" (rén zhī suǒ shī yì, what people shift and change),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">猶言不移易也。 is similar to saying "bù yí yì yě" (not changeable).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">晏子春秋外篇君臣易施， In the Outer Chapters of the *Yàn Zǐ Chūn Qiū*, "the ruler and ministers easily change,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">施並讀為移。 "shī" in all of these are read as "yí."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】《哀樂》音洛. [Explanation of Terms] "Āi Lè" (sorrow and joy) is pronounced "luò."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">正言之則為易施， Speaking directly, it is "yì shī,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">注、下同. Note: the same applies below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">荀子儒效篇哀虛之相施易之， In the *Xún Zǐ* "Rú Xiào" chapter, "mourning and emptiness mutually change,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">倒言之則為施易也。 and inverting it, it is "shī yì."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">漢書衛綰傳人之所施易， In the *Hàn Shū*, "Biography of Wèi Wǎn," "where people shift and change,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《施乎》如字. "Shī hū" (bestow?) is read as the character itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">施並讀為移。 "shī" is read as "yí" throughout.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">（本王氏讀書雜志。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">崔以豉反， Cuī read it as "chǐ fǎn,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">正言之則為易施， To say it directly, it is "yì shī" (easy to implement),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">） (From "Wáng Shì's Reading Notes".)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">云： saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">移也. It means "to move" or "to change."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">倒言之則為施易也。 and to say it in reverse, it is "shī yì" (implement change).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【八】【注】事有必至，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">（本王氏讀書雜志。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎慶藩案施讀為移， ◎Qìngfān notes that "shī" is read as "yí,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">理固常通， and principles are always understood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故任之則事濟， Therefore, if one entrusts oneself to them, the affair will be accomplished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">） (From *Wáng Shì Dú Shū Zá Zhì* [Miscellaneous Notes on Reading by Mr. Wáng].)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不易施， "bù yì shī,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【八】【注】事有必至，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">事濟而身不存者， That the affair is accomplished but one's person does not survive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">猶言不移易也. is like saying "not to change" or "not to move."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">未之有也， has never happened.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">理固常通， and principles invariably hold true,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">晏子春秋外篇君臣易施， In the "Outer Chapters" of the *Yàn Zǐ Chūnqiū* (The Annals of Master Yàn) it says "君臣易施" (jūncén yì shī) "ruler and minister easily change positions,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">又何用心於其身哉！ So why worry about oneself?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">荀子儒效篇哀虛之相施易之， In the "Rú Xiào" chapter of the *Xúnzǐ* it says "哀虛之相施易之" (āi xū zhī xiāng shī yì zhī) "sorrow and emptiness mutually affect and change them,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故任之則事濟， therefore, if you entrust yourself to them, things will succeed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】夫臣子事於君父， [Explanation] As for ministers and sons serving their lords and fathers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">事濟而身不存者， For one who succeeds in his tasks but loses his life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">漢書衛綰傳人之所施易， In the *Biography of Wèi Wǎn* in the *Hàn Shū* it says "人之所施易" (rén zhī suǒ shī yì) "what people are subject to change,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">必須致命盡情， they must dedicate their lives and exhaust their feelings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">施並讀為移. "Shī" is read as "yí" in all cases.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">未之有也， it has never happened.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">有事即行， acting immediately when there is a matter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">正言之則為易施， Speaking directly, it would be "yì shī" (easy to change),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">又何用心於其身哉！ So why be concerned about oneself?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】夫臣子事於君父， [Subcommentary] As subjects and sons serve their ruler and father,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">無容簡擇， without allowing for selection or hesitation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">倒言之則為施易也. Reversing the order, it becomes "shī yì" (change or move).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">忘身整務， forgetting oneself to attend to affairs diligently,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">（本王氏讀書雜志。） (Based on *Wang's Miscellany of Reading*.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">必須致命盡情， they must dedicate their lives and exhaust their feelings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">固是其宜。 is certainly what is appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">有事即行， acting immediately when there is something to be done,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-281a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">無容簡擇， allowing no room for selection,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【八】【注】事有必至， [Chapter 8] [Commentary] Affairs have their inevitable course,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">苟不得止， If one cannot stop (from doing something),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:26:54.188+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">應須任命也。 one should then accept their fate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">忘身整務， forgetting oneself and focusing on the task,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">理固常通， principles are inherently always accessible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">固是其宜。 is certainly what is appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故任之則事濟， Therefore, if one entrusts oneself to it, affairs will be accomplished,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">苟不得止， If it is impossible to stop,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">事濟而身不存者， But for affairs to be accomplished and oneself to not exist,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">未之有也， has never happened.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:04.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">應須任命也。 one must accept the mandate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-282a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">又何用心於其身哉！ So why worry about oneself!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】夫臣子事於君父， [Subcommentary] As for ministers and sons serving their rulers and fathers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">必須致命盡情， they must dedicate their lives and exhaust their emotions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">有事即行， when there is a matter, immediately act,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">無容簡擇， without allowing for selection or choice,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">忘身整務， forgetting oneself and managing affairs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">固是其宜. is indeed what is appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">苟不得止， If one cannot stop it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:27:49.804+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">應須任命也. one should accept one's fate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:36:34.082+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When there is a matter, one should act immediately,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:36:34.082+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without allowing for selection or choice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:36:34.082+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Forgetting oneself and attending to the task at hand</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:36:34.082+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is certainly what is appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:36:34.082+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one cannot stop,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-283a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:36:34.082+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one must accept one's fate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:25.098+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if belief is diminished, then the one who transmits the words will suffer calamity 【Seven】.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:25.098+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the saying of the law states:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:25.098+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Transmit the common situation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:25.098+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not transmit excessive words;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:25.098+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then you will almost be safe 【Eight】."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:25.098+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Mò zé zhuànyán zhě yāng 【qī】. [If] one does not, then the one who spreads rumors will suffer calamity</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Gù fǎ yán yuē: [Therefore,] the legalists said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">'Zhuàn qí chángqíng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">wú zhuàn qí yìyán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zé jīhū quán 【bā】.' [Spread] that which is the constant state [of affairs], do not spread excessive words, then it is close to completeness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-287a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-288a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Yī】【zhù】 Jìn zhě dé jiē,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-288a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gù yǐ qí xìn yàn qīn xiāng mífú yě. therefore, with their reliable proof, close relationships mutually lead to submission.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-289a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shìwén】《Fù yǐ》 fú yòu fǎn. [Glossary:] 《Fù yǐ》 pronounced fú, then fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-289a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xià zhù tóng. The following notes are the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-290a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Èr】【zhù】 Yáo yǐ yán chuán yì yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-291a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shū】 Fán jiāoyóu línjìn, [Commentary:] In general, for social interactions and those nearby,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:28.683+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shìwén】《Liǎng nù》 rú zì. [Glossary:] 《Liǎng nù》 as the character shows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:28.683+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhù tóng. The note is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-291a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zé yǐ xìnqíng mífùn; then they use trustworthy feelings to bring about submission;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-291a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">xiāng qù yáoyuǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:28.683+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Běn yòu zuò yuàn. [Another] version also reads yuàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-291a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zé yǐ yán biǎo zhōngchéng. if they are far away from each other, then they use words to express loyalty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:28.683+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xià tóng. The following is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shì Wén】 "Liǎng Nù": as the character appears.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:28.683+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shìwén】《Wèi yì》 yǐ chì fǎn. [Glossary:] 《Wèi yì》 pronounced yǐ chì fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Commentary: Same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-291a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cǐ Zhòngní yǐ jǐ suǒ wén quànjiè zhū Liáng yě. This is Zhòngní using what he has heard to advise the various Liáng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:28.683+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xià wén, zhù jiē tóng. The following text and notes are all the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-292a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shìwén】《Chuányì》 zhàng zhuān fǎn. [Glossary:] 《Chuányì》 pronounced zhàng zhuān fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is also written as "yuàn."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-292a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xià wén bìng zhù tóng. The following text and notes are the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:01.519+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shìwén】《Liǎng Nù》: As the character appears.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Wèi Yì": read "yǐ chì fǎn."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:01.519+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Commentary: Same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-293a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sān】【zhù】 Fū xǐnù zhī yán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:01.519+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This also appears as "yuàn" (怨, resentment).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The text and commentary below are all the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-293a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">ruò guò qí shíjì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sì】【Zhù】 Yì:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:01.519+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-293a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zhuàn zhī zhě yí shǐ liǎng bù shī zhōng, if they exceed the reality, those who transmit them should ensure that neither side loses its balance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:01.519+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Wèi Yì》: "Yì" is pronounced as "chǐ" (豉) with a falling tone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">exceeding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:34.563+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】《Liǎng Nù》: as the character shows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-293a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gù wèi yì yě. therefore it is not easy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-294a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shū】 Yǐ yán biǎo yì, [Commentary:] Using words to express meaning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:01.519+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The following text and commentary are the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:34.563+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The commentary is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Words of joy and anger often exceed what is appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-294a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">huò shǐ rén zhuàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shū】 Yì:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:34.563+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This version also writes it as 怨 (yuàn, resentment).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:01.519+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【4】【Commentary】 "Yì" (溢):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:03.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Shìwén] "Liǎng Nù" as the character.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-294a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">bǐcǐ xiāng tóu, perhaps using someone to transmit [the message], with each side responding to the other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:34.563+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">exceeding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-294a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zhà xiāng xǐnù. suddenly exhibiting joy and anger to each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:34.563+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Wèi Yì》: pronounced "chì" with a reversed tone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:03.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Note is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Between two people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shìwén】 "Liǎng nù" as written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">mutually experiencing joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-294a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Wèi cǐ shǐ hū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:39:34.563+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The following text and commentary are all the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:03.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This version also written as "yuàn" (怨).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Note is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if it conforms to their feelings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:03.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-294a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">rénjiān wèi yì. To be a messenger in this situation, it is not easy in the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】《Liǎng Nù》: As it is written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then words of praise and blame will necessarily be excessive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This version also reads "yuàn."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:03.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Wèi Yì," "yǐ chì fǎn" (以豉反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-298a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Wǔ】【Zhù】 Doubts that these are his words;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Note: Same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of Text] "*Liǎng nù*" is as the character.</seg>
