                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-298a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it seems that the transmitter made them up rashly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The commentary is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shū】 Lèi:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The following text and notes are the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The text also reads *yuàn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:03.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To exceed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Wèi Yì》: 反 (fǎn) is pronounced as 豉 (chǐ).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Four】 【Note】 "Yì"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The following is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">resembling.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:03.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Words of joy and anger often exceed what is appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Wèi yì*" pronunciation is *yǐ chì fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:37:52.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same in the text and commentary below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:03.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 "Yì" (溢):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to exceed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These words that exceed appropriateness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-295a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The following text and commentary are all the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are not genuinely real.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Words of joy and anger often exceed what is appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【四】【注】溢 (yì):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 "Yì"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The listener is already suspicious,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:03.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">causing unsure and doubtful thoughts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To exceed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:03.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Qī】【Zhù】 To rely on excessive words transmitted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">seeming to cause people to fabricate recklessly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Excessive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:13.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Do not readily doubt it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:03.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is similar to being wildly untrue (one).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-296a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Words of joy and anger often exceed what is appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-300a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Liù】【Zhù】 Unsure and doubtful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If two people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:13.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Seven】【Commentary】 To relay a statement that goes too far,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:03.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the receiver has doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shū】 Mò:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">express joy or anger at each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:13.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it seems like absurdity (1).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】溢 (yì):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:13.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the recipient has doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and if it follows their emotions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the appearance of causing doubt.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Excessive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:03.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the transmitter will be arbitrarily blamed for being too frivolous or too serious.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Do not readily doubt it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:03.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shū】 If the receiver has doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Between two people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】【Note】To relay exaggerated words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then their words of praise or blame will necessarily exceed what is appropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since it seems that the transmitter fabricated it rashly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:13.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the one relaying the statement will be arbitrarily punished with guilt based on the severity of the statement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Do not doubt it easily.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-298a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【5】【Commentary】 "Xián fēi bǐ yán" (嫌非彼言): Suspect it is not their words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Seven】【Commentary】 To convey exaggerated words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">mutually experiencing joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then a heart of disbelief arises,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is similar to being absurd and preposterous (1).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-298a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">as if the transmitter is making it up wildly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is similar to being absurd and extravagant (1).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Do not readily doubt it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 "Lèi" (類):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the receiver has doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if it conforms to their feelings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the relayers of the words will be randomly blamed with varying degrees of severity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Seven】【Note】Regarding transmitted statements that are exaggerations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-297a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then words of praise and blame must necessarily be excessive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the receiver has doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To resemble.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the conveyor of the words will be arbitrarily punished for the severity of the situation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-298a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【五】【注】嫌非彼言:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】 The recipient has doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Words that exceed what is appropriate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they seem to border on absurdity (1).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">harboring disbelief in their heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 If the receiver harbors doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-298a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Suspect that it is not their words; it seems the transmitter fabricated it rashly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the recipient has doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are not truly based in reality.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if they relay the message,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">calamity will extend to them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and has disbelief in their heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the transmitter of the statement will be arbitrarily blamed for the gravity of the offense.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】類 (lèi):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The listener is doubtful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-304a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Eight】【Commentary】 Even if one hears a careless remark made in the moment, do not relay it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:38:40.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 The recipient harbors doubt,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">as if making people wildly fabricate things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the word is conveyed by a messenger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-304a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">be sure to report their usual disposition and insist on their sincerity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Similar.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-304a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then one will be close to preserving oneself completely.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-300a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【6】【Commentary】 "Mò rán yí zhī yě" (莫然疑之也): In silence, doubting it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Words that exceed what is appropriate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">misfortune will extend to them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-304a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Eight】【Commentary】 Even if you hear temporary excessive words, do not convey them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">whose substance is not genuine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 "Mò" (莫):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】 Indeed, navigating among people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">acting as an envoy is truly difficult,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:23.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The appearance of causing doubt.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-304a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you must speak of their usual disposition and seek their sincerity and devotion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cause listeners to doubt,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-299a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">seemingly making people construct falsehoods recklessly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-304a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then you will be close to being complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one must investigate the usual disposition, and be sure to bring the host and guest to a compromise;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-300a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【六】【注】莫然疑之也:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 When interacting with people in the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:42:47.381+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one must not relay momentary joy or anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To suspect it vaguely.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be an envoy is truly difficult,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is necessary to investigate their usual disposition, and ensure that both the host and guest compromise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】莫 (mò):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since it seems like the transmitter is making it up wildly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one must not convey temporary joy or anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">a heart of disbelief arises,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">leading to difficulties in discerning both parties.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One who can do this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-301a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">silently doubting it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">comes close to preserving their life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】【Commentary】 Regarding transmitting excessive words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Master quoted the wise sayings of previous sages,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it seems like fabrication (1).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the receiver has doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-305a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be the guiding principles for the future.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-306a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Gloss】 《ér yào》, "yào" is pronounced as "yáo" (反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-302a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the transmitter is arbitrarily accused of a crime, whether light or severe.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-306a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《zé jìn》, "jìn" as in "fùjìn" (附近).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-303a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:40:56.634+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 If the receiver has doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-307a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Correction】 (1) Zhào Jiànyì's version reads "wàngdàn" (妄誕, absurd).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, those who skillfully compete in strength,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">begin with the overt【One】,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and invariably end in the covert【Two】;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">when (greatness)〔excess〕(1) is reached, there are many tricks【Three】;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">those who drink wine with propriety,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">begin with order【Four】,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and invariably end in chaos【Five】;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">when (greatness)〔excess〕 is reached, there is much extravagant pleasure【Six】.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">All matters are like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:43:10.95+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They begin with trust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:22.457+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">those who drink wine with propriety,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:22.457+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">begin with order 【4】,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:28.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zhì Zǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:22.457+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and often end with chaos 【5】,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:28.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"That's not acceptable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:22.457+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Great) [Excess] reaching excess results in much strange merriment 【6】.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:28.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The reason why Jìn achieved hegemony</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:22.457+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Everything is like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:28.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">was that the army was martial and the ministers were powerful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-308a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:22.457+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Begin with trust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:28.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Now, we have lost the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-230a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:54:28.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">so we cannot say we are powerful;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:12.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù (家世父) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:12.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">All that is clearly visible is called yáng (陽),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:12.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and what is hidden is called yīn (陰).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:12.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who compete in skill must have many hidden schemes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:12.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">exhausting the use of their minds in seeking to overcome each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-313a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:12.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">All that is obvious is called "yáng" (陽),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and all that is hidden is called "yīn" (陰).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who contend with skill will surely have many hidden schemes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-312a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">exhausting the use of their minds to seek to overcome each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-313a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【三】【Note】No longer following principles.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-314a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】When anger reaches its peak,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-314a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the desire to win is extreme,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-314a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then emotions become full of strange and cunning devices,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-314a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with all sorts of clever tricks.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-315a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】《Dà Zhì》 (大至) is pronounced tài,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-315a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the original also made it tài (泰).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-315a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú: chì zuǒ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-315a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-315a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-315a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In today's book, it's written as tài (泰).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-315a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Qíqiǎo》 (奇巧) as written,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:29.283+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is no longer distinction between honored and humble.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-315a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also kǔ xiào fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:29.283+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What starts orderly ends in chaos;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:29.283+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">all things are like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-316a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【四】【Note】There is distinction between the honored and the humble,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-316a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the toasts during a communal feast have order.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:29.283+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is taking drinking wine as an analogy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-317a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】《Hū Zhì》 (乎治) zhí lì fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There is no longer any distinction between high and low,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:29.283+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】《Zhàn》 (湛) zhí lín fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:29.283+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also dá nán fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">at first orderly, in the end chaotic,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-317a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Yǒu Bié》 (有別) bǐ liè fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">all things are like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-318a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【五】【Note】To soak and drown in excessive drinking.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Consider drinking wine as an analogy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】Zhì (治) means order.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhì (治) also means principle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanatory Notes] 湛 (zhàn): 反切 is zhí lín,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and also dá nán. 湎 (miǎn): 反切 is miàn shàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In a feast between host and guest, the offerings of toasts have their own proper order,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and there are natural ethical principles.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">淫液 (yín yì): 反切 is yǐ zhī.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">After "(dǎo biàn) [cè biàn] (三)"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There is no more distinction between the honorable and the base.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-321a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Sixth Passage][Commentary] licentiousness and wildness are unrestrained (in all directions),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Initially orderly, finally chaotic.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-321a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">reaching everywhere.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] When banquets and rewards have been given,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Things are all like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is no longer any distinction between superiors and inferiors;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">licentiousness and wildness then become extreme,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Let us take drinking wine as an analogy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the beginning is orderly, but the end is chaotic.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory Notes】《湛》zhí lín fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one ought to sing and dance repeatedly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">All things are like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Taking drinking as an example.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T04:59:37.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also dá nán fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with no regard for ritual propriety,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Textual Explanation】《Zhàn 湛》 is pronounced zhí lín 反,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There is no longer any distinction between high and low;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in all kinds of strange ways,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">at first there is order, but in the end, chaos;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the joy is without limit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and also dá nán 反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">all things are like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《湎》miàn shàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-323a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Seventh Passage][Commentary] Indeed, complexity arises from simplicity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-323a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">affairs originate from the minuscule;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-319a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Let's take drinking alcohol as an analogy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《淫液》yǐ zhī fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-321a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【6】【Commentary】Excessive dissipation (four) runs rampant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】《湛》 pronunciation zhí lín fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-323a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is a certain and inevitable trend.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-321a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">reaching every extreme.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] All human feelings and common affairs</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also dá nán fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are also like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《湎》 pronunciation miàn shàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sub-commentary】Once banquets and rewards have been requited,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Nothing does not begin with sincerity and trustworthiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">debauchery and dissipation become even more excessive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-320a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《淫液》 pronunciation yǐ zhī fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There is constant singing and repeated dancing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-321a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【6】【Commentary】Excessive indulgence (in the four vices) becomes unrestrained,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and end with baseness and wickedness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:03:29.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Yú Yuè says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with no regard for ritualistic decorum.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-321a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">reaching every extreme.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">at the beginning, it is simple and small,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】Once the feasts and rewards have been given,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:03:29.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Liàng" and "bǐ"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">later, it must be huge.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In countless strange and extravagant ways,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the pleasure has no limit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:03:29.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are not well matched in the text.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">dissoluteness becomes exceedingly great.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, complexity arises from simplicity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-323a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】【Commentary】Indeed, complexity arises from simplicity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They sing and dance repeatedly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:03:29.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The preceding text says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">affairs originate from the minuscule.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without any rules or restraints anymore.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-323a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and events originate from the minute.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is a fitting analogy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:03:29.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"It begins in the positive, often ending in the negative,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-323a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the inevitable course of things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:03:29.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it begins in order, often ending in chaos,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using diverse and strange methods,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yú Yuè 俞樾 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:04:33.386+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Yú Yuè said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sub-commentary】Ordinary human emotions and common affairs</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-322a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">their joy reaches its limit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Liàng" 諒 and "bǐ" 鄙,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-323a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】【Commentary】Indeed, complexity arises from simplicity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are not corresponding words in the text.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are also like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-323a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and events originate from the insignificant;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The preceding text says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">None do not begin with sincerity and trustworthiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and end with baseness and wickedness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-323a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is an inevitable trend.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"(Shǐ)" (使) [should be] "shǐ" 始, "beginnings are always in the sun, ending in the shade,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】Ordinary human emotions and everyday affairs</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Initially things are simple and few,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:00:49.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"beginnings are always in order, ending in chaos,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are also like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">later they must become huge.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">None do not begin with sincerity and trustworthiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, complexity arises from simplicity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-231a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:05:31.052+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and opposing them is bad.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but end with baseness and wickedness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and events originate from the minute.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-231a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:05:31.052+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The dispersal of the troops indicates weakness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-231a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:05:31.052+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the damming of the river turns it into a swamp.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is a fitting analogy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">initially, they start simply and small,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-231a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:05:31.052+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Having rules is like having oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but later they inevitably become huge.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yú Yuè 俞樾 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-231a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:05:31.052+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">therefore it is called discipline. If it is bad,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-231a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:05:31.052+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then the discipline is exhausted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, complexity arises from simplicity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Liàng" (sincerity) and "bǐ" (baseness),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and events originate from the insignificant.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the words do not correspond well.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The text above says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This completes the analogy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Yú Yuè said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yú Yuè 俞樾 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"It begins with Yang and always ends with Yin;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Liàng (trustworthiness) and bǐ (baseness),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:01:50.07+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it begins with order and always ends with chaos."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the text does not correspond properly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Liàng" 諒 and "bǐ" 鄙</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are not semantically parallel.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The preceding text says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The preceding text says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"(Makes) [Begins] with yang, invariably ends with yin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"(Shǐ)" (使) [should be] "shǐ" 始, "begins in flourishing, ends in decline" (乎陽常卒乎陰),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">begins with order, invariably ends with chaos..."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:02:18.34+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"begins in order, ends in chaos" (始乎治常卒乎亂),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"shade and sun, order and chaos, are corresponding concepts,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but "liàng" 諒 and "bǐ" 鄙 are not corresponding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Liàng" 諒 is probably a mistaken character.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:24.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Fú) (夫) (1) "Words [of counsel]"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zhū" 諸 should be read as "dū" 都.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Speaking is like</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:24.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are like "wind and waves";</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the "Explanation of Lands" section of the *Erya*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:24.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"actions"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">waves stirred by the wind;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sòng 宋 had Méngzhū 孟諸. The *Records of the Grand Historian*, in the "Basic Annals of the Xia," makes it Míngdū 明都;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">action results in</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:24.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are like "real loss."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is an example.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:24.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Fú] (夫) "Wind and waves are easily stirred,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">actual loss [一].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Beginnings are always in Dū 都, ending in Bǐ 鄙,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:24.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"real loss is easily endangered."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Waves stirred by the wind are easily set in motion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and actual loss easily leads to danger [二].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"dū" 都 and "bǐ" 鄙 are precisely corresponding concepts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Because the character "dū" 都 was commonly written as "zhū" 諸,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, anger arises without cause,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and clever words and biased arguments emerge [三].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then mistakenly written as "liàng" 諒,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus the meaning was lost.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When an animal is dying, it doesn't choose its cries;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The "Quán Yán" 詮言 chapter of the *Huainanzi* says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its breath comes in gasps and pants,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Therefore, that which begins in Dū 都 is always greater than that which is Bǐ 鄙,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and sharp and bitter feelings arise together [四].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When pressure and demands become excessive (二),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is based on the *Zhuangzi*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and can be used as a basis for correction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there will inevitably be a base and unworthy reaction,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In that passage, the character "dà" 大 (great) is a mistake for the character "zú" 卒 (end),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without realizing why [五].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one truly doesn't know why it happens,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-324a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the explanation can be found in Wáng Niàn-sūn's 王念孫 *Reading Notes*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-325a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【校】(Correction) (1) The character "tài" 泰 is changed according to the Shìdétáng 世德堂 edition and the Lú 校 edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">who can know where it will end!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-325a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) The Shìdétáng 世德堂 edition omits the two characters "zhě yě" 者也.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[六] Therefore, a legal saying states:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-325a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(3) "Cèbiàn" 側弁 is changed according to the amended edition of Liú Wéndiǎn 劉文典.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Do not change orders [七],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-325a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:06:25.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(4) The Shìdétáng 世德堂 edition has "liú" 流 instead of "huāng" 荒.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:07:32.64+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not urge completion [八];</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Oh,) (One) Words are</seg>
