                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">beautiful completion comes with time</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When a beast dies, it does not choose its sounds;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:22.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without knowing why.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-231a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:12:05.466+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">is that not better?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its breath is frantic.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:22.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one truly doesn't know why,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:12:05.466+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The army then crossed [the river].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">evil completion cannot be changed in time</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:22.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">who knows where it will end!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, a ruthless state of mind arises.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:12:05.466+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The *Chǔ Zǐ* 楚子's northern army encamped at *Yín* 郔.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">shouldn't one be careful</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Furthermore, riding on things to wander the mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When strict demands (Èr) arrive in full force,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">entrusting oneself to necessity to nourish the center,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there will inevitably be a worthless heart to respond to them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without one realizing it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the ultimate</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one truly does not realize it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Why act in return</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the 法言 (Fǎ Yán) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Do not change orders,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is better to submit to fate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">who knows where it will end!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not urge completion;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the teachings of the law say:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what is difficult</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">excess is harmful."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Do not change orders</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Changing orders and urging completion endangers matters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, do not urge completion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">fēngbō yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gù xíng zhī zé shí sàng yǐ."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Excess is harmful."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Beautiful accomplishments take time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Evil done, there is no time to correct.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:09:30.125+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] "Water causes waves by the wind,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It's better to entrust oneself to fate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Changing orders and urging completion are dangerous matters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Should one not be cautious?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Excellence is achieved over time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the difficult part."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, to ride along with things and roam the mind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Evil, once formed, is beyond correction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Note 1] Speaking is like</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Ought one not to be cautious?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">entrusting oneself to the inevitable to nourish the inner self,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">wind and waves;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">that is the ultimate!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, to ride along with things in order to free the mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, acting upon it results in actual loss.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Why seek reward?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and to entrust oneself to the unavoidable in order to nurture the center (zhōng),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Wind stirs the water to create waves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Nothing is better than entrusting it to fate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">that is the ultimate!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the difficult part</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Why act to seek requital?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is better to entrust oneself to fate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is better to entrust oneself to fate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">wind and waves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what is difficult."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what is difficult."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:10:46.079+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation:] Just as water produces waves due to the wind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, therefore acting upon them results in a real loss.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, therefore acting upon them results in a real loss.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so acting on it will surely result in the loss of reality.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so acting on it will surely result in the loss of reality.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Commentary: Water rises into waves because of the wind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:11:07.077+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Commentary: Water rises into waves because of the wind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is analogous to the mind experiencing joy and anger because of speech.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, those who act on joy and anger based on such wind-and-wave-like speech,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will lose touch with the true principles of reality.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìng Fān notes that 波 (bō, wave) should be read as 播 (bō, scatter).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhèng Xuán's commentary on the Yǔ Gòng (Tribute of Yu) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">播 (bō),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to scatter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Mò ruò wèi zhìmìng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">波 (bō, wave) and 播 (bō, scatter),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-1b.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the difficult path."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">were interchangeable characters in ancient times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Yī】【Note】Speaking is like wind and waves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indicating that wind scattering things is easy to move them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">fēngbō yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The phrase "wind scattering" is antithetical to "loss of reality,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-326a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, acting upon it results in the loss of substance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so it cannot be interpreted as "wave."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】Wind causes the water to rise as waves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Sīmǎ Bōchén's commentary in the "External Things" chapter says that "波蕩之臣 (bō dàng zhī chén)" means "scattering minister,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is comparable to the heart becoming joyful or angry because of speech.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"波蕩 (bō dàng)" is the same as "播蕩 (bō dàng).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, those who act joyfully or angrily based on speech that is like wind and waves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">) In the twenty-third year of Duke Xī, the Zuǒ Zhuàn (Zuo Commentary) says that the disturbances "波及 Jìn guó (bō jí Jìn guó, wave reached the state of Jin),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will lose real principle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">波 (bō, wave) should also be interpreted as 播 (bō, scatter),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìng Fān notes that "bō" should be read as "bō".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhèng's commentary on the Yǔ Gòng says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning that the disturbances were scattered and reached the state of Jìn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:18:38.925+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Pronunciation Guide] "Shí sàng" is pronounced xī làng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Bō"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(This is from Wáng Yǐnzhī's Jīngyì Shùwén.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to scatter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:18:38.925+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same in the commentary and below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Yǔ Gòng (Tribute of Yu) says "Xíng bō jì zhū,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:18:38.925+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Bō" and "bō,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Mǎ Róng's, Zhèng Xuán's, and Wáng Sù's versions all read (熒) [滎] 播 (Xíng bō),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:18:38.925+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shí sàng,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are ancient characters that can be interchanged,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and Suǒ Yǐn explains that it means "overflowing."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】《Shí Sàng》: xī is a rising tone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:18:38.925+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like saying "gains and losses."</seg>
                    <seg>-␀"yQh␀t+␀␀␀!$␀2␀"yQh@n#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.2"␀2␀"yQh␀⁐␀␀xmlen#␀2␀"yQh7#gemini-2.0-flashH)␀7␀"yQh⸄2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00K␀7␀"yQh䗆#gemini-2.0-flashM ␀7␀"yQh昆KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d%␀␀2␀"yQi@Note: The same below.,␀2␀␀␀-␀"yQp␀t+␀␀␀-$␀2␀"yQp@n#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.3.␀2␀"yQp␀⁐␀␀xmlen/␀2␀"yQp7#gemini-2.0-flash0)␀2␀"yQq␀x2025-08-30T05:18:38.925+09:001␀␀2␀"yQq@◎Jiā Shìfù said::␀2␀␀␀-␀"yQx␀t+␀␀␀;$␀2␀"yQx@n#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.4&lt;␀2␀"yQx␀⁐␀␀xmlen=␀2␀"yQx7#gemini-2.0-flash&gt;)␀2␀"yQy␀x2025-08-30T05:18:38.925+09:00?␀␀2␀"yQy@"Shí sàng,"债␀␀␀-␀"yQ␀␀t+␀␀␀䀂2␀"yQ␀@n#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.5倒2␀"yQ␀␀⁐␀␀xmlen²␀"yQ␀7#gemini-2.0-flashG)␀7␀"yQ␀⸄2025-08-30T05:18:38.925+09:00I␀7␀"yQ␀䗆#gemini-2.0-flashL ␀7␀"yQ␀昆KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d~,␀␀2␀"yQ@is like saying "gains and losses."␀2␀␀␀-␀"yQ␀t+␀␀␀␀$␀2␀"yQ@n#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.6␀2␀"yQ␀⁐␀␀xmlen␀2␀"yQ7#gemini-2.0-flash)␀2␀"yQ	␀x2025-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00#␀␀2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...reality)" means...␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...␀␀2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...5-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00#␀␀2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...ans...	@"Shí (reality)" means..."yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...␀␀2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...7#gemini-2.0-flash)␀2␀"yQ	␀x2025-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00#␀␀2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...␀␀2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means..."yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...␀␀2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...x2025-08-30T05:15:23.661+09:00#␀␀2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means...61+09:00#␀␀2␀"yQ	@"Shí (reality)" means..."yQ	@"Shí (rea</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These are all evidences.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indicating that wind causes dispersal and therefore easy movement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎Jiā Shìfù said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】《Shí Sàng》, "shí" pronounced xī, "sàng" is read as làng, in the fanqie method.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Wind causing dispersal" contrasts with "loss of substance,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:18:38.925+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shí (reality)" means...</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shí sàng,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Commentaries, the same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it cannot be explained as waves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(In the "External Things" chapter, Sīmǎ Bōchén's commentary says "waves of a minister,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like saying gains and losses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"waves" means "dispersal".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shí" means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shí sàng,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like saying gains and losses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">) In the twenty-third year of Duke Xī, the Zuǒ Zhuàn says "dispersed to the state of Jìn,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">having and preserving it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"bō" should also be "bō,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:20:05.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Wǔ Cān said to the king:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:16:35.795+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shí" means,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"sàng" means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:20:05.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The administrators of Jìn are new,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning that it was dispersed to the state of Jìn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">suddenly forgetting it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:20:05.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and not yet able to enforce orders.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Gaining and losing unpredictably</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(According to Wáng Yǐnzhī's Explanation of the Meaning of the Classics).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:20:05.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Their adjutant, Xiān Hú, is stubborn, self-willed and unkind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the Yǔ Gòng, "the waters of the Xíng bō were already drained,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a great calamity in conduct,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:20:05.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and unwilling to obey orders.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:20:05.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Their three commanders...</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the versions of Mǎ, Zhèng, and Wáng all write "(yíng) [Xíng] bō,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is called dangerous.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Wǔ Cān advised the king, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō Xiàng's commentary:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Suǒyǐn says this refers to the meaning of flooding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The officials of Jìn are new</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-327a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These are all evidences.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one acts on it, one's substance will be lost;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and unable to implement orders effectively.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if one leaves behind the wind and waves and does not act on it, then one's substance will not be lost,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Gloss】 "Shí sàng": xī làng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Their assistant Xiān Hú is obstinate and unkind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">unwilling to follow commands.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I am afraid this is a mistake.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same applies to the commentary below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Their three commanders</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-329a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Two】【Note】Therefore, if one leaves behind the wind and waves and does not act on it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">act independently without success.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-329a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then one's substance will not be lost.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shí sàng,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">They listen without a superior,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:31.133+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】The instigation of anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is similar to saying "gain and loss."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-329a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When things obtain their substance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">so whom should the troops follow?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:31.133+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has no other source,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-329a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">danger can be made secure and turbulence can be calmed (three).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-328a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:17:39.885+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shí" (substance/reality) means...</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:31.133+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is always due to shallow falsehoods, cunning words, biased speech, and flattery.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">In this campaign,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-330a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】The wind drums up water waves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 The establishment of anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-330a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">easily causing turbulence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Jìn army will certainly be defeated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:31.133+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】《Piān Cí》: pronounced piān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has no other cause,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but is always due to superficial falsehoods,巧言偏辭 (qiǎo yán piān cí) clever and biased words, and flattery and insincerity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-330a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is a metaphor for losing the substance of principle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Moreover, if the ruler abandons his subjects,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:31.133+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Cuī edition makes it 諞,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">what will become of the state?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:31.133+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pronounced biàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-330a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and danger is not difficult to encounter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory Text】 *Piān cí* is pronounced "piān."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-331a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Three】【Note】The rise of anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Cuī version has 諞 (piǎn),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The king was troubled by this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] The establishment of anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pronounced "biàn."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-331a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has no other cause,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He told the Prime Minister (Lìng Yǐn) to change chariots</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has no other origin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Four】 【Note】 It is like a wild beast</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-232a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and go north,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-331a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is always caused by cunning words exceeding reality,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is always due to superficial falsehood, clever words, biased language, flattery, and sycophancy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] *Piān cí* (偏辭 - biased language): pronounced piān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-331a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and biased words being inappropriate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">driven to a dead end.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">stopping at Guǎn to await them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Jìn army was between Ào and Hào.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Cuī (崔) version makes it *piǎn* (諞),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] The establishment of anger</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When the sound becomes urgent and feelings exhausted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zhèng's Huáng Xū was sent as an envoy to the Jìn army,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">arises from no other source</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pronounced biàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">harmonious sounds cannot be produced, and breathing becomes disordered.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-332a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">than from superficial falsehoods, artful words, biased arguments, flattery, and insincerity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Suddenly bursting into anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Zhèng followed Chǔ</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] *Piān cí* (偏辭) is pronounced piān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">driven into a corner,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:22:59.922+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">both sides generate flaws to confront each other with.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">for the sake of the state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Cuī (崔) version has *piǎn* (諞),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its voice urgent and its feelings exhausted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-333a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:19:01.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pronounced biàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and has not had a divided heart.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Chǔ army is suddenly victorious and arrogant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then harmonious sounds are not produced and its breath is not regulated,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">their army is old</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it suddenly bursts into anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and unprepared.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-334a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and both develop flaws to confront each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-335a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 When a wild beast is困窘 (kùn jiǒng) distressed</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">If you attack them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the Zhèng army will assist you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-335a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and迫 (pò) forced to a dead end,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-335a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and its life is about to end,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the Chǔ army will surely be defeated."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-335a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it cries out without choosing its sounds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zhì Zǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-335a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its breath becomes repressed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Defeating Chǔ and subjugating Zhèng, lies in this!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-335a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and its heart generates flaws and diseases.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">We must agree to this!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-335a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Suddenly it bursts into anger</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Luán Wǔzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:21:09.597+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Since Chǔ overcame Yōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-335a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and attacks people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-335a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the beginning of the analogy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:27:53.865+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Cuī version has ●●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory Text】 *Qì xī* are both read as they are written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:27:53.865+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiàng originally wrote ●器 (qì),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:27:53.865+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Panting and breathing are out of sync.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:27:53.865+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is also written as 蓽 (bì).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:27:53.865+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎Qìngfān notes that one version of the explanatory text has *qì* written as *qì*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Mǎ wrote 息 (xī).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:27:53.865+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">氣 (qì) and 器 (qì) were commonly used interchangeably in ancient times.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">器 (qì)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means 氣 (qì).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī Běn's work</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Chuǎn xī (喘息), panting, is when the breathing is not regulated."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is also written as the character bì (蓽).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìng Fán notes: The Shì Wén (釋文) says that qì yī (氣一) is also written as qì (器).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-336a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:24:00.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qì (氣) and qì (器) were commonly used interchangeably in ancient times.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-337a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:29:28.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It should be read the same as yá zì (睚眥).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-338a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:29:28.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【5】【Note】A man who is generous and tolerant can embrace all things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-338a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:29:28.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and all things will naturally return to him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-338a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:29:28.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one is overly critical and meticulous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-338a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:29:28.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">a mean and stingy heart will arise without one realizing it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-338a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:29:28.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the great man is magnanimous and allows things to develop naturally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:30:22.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the Chǔ army will surely be defeated."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:30:22.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Zhì Zǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:30:22.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Defeating Chǔ and subjugating Zhèng depends on this!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:30:22.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">We must agree to it!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:30:22.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Luán Wǔzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-233a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:30:22.497+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Since Chǔ's victory over Yōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-343a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:09.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Who knows where the misfortune will end? (Five).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-344a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:09.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-345a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:09.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] Receive the ruler's commands,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-345a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:09.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and transmit them with the truth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-345a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:09.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One must not, based on temporary joy or anger, arbitrarily change or alter them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-346a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:09.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-353a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:56.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Beauty is achieved after long adherence to its path,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-353a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:56.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what is achieved in a single day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-353a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:56.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is not to be relied upon,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-353a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:56.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">while evil, once established, cannot be changed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-353a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:56.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The distinction between beauty and evil is subtle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-353a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:31:56.762+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and difficulty and ease take shape from it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-359a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:33:52.887+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and use an empty heart to conform to the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-359a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:33:52.887+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then what danger could there be?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-360a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:33:52.887+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一五】【Commentary】 To entrust oneself to the inevitability of principle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-360a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:33:52.887+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the Mean is completely in accordance;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-360a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:33:52.887+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the utmost way of engaging with things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-361a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T05:33:52.887+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】 Those who cannot do otherwise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-367a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:56:58.462+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Corrections】(1) The character 夫 (*fū*) is moved down according to the Shìdétáng edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-367a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:56:58.462+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) 大 (*dà*) in the Shìdétáng edition is 作 (*zuò*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-367a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:56:58.462+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(3) The character 也 (*yě*) is supplemented according to the Shìdétáng edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-367a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:56:58.462+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(4) The character 迫 (*pò*) is changed to "逼迫太甚 (*bīpò tàishèn*)" according to the commentary below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-367a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:56:58.462+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(5) Originally a mistake under the commentary text,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-367a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:56:58.462+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now corrected.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-370a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:57:42.321+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A wise recluse of Lǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-370a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:57:42.321+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-370a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:57:42.321+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The current edition has 盍 (hé) instead of 廅 (è).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-370a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:57:42.321+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Wèi Línggōng》, the Zuǒ Zhuàn says his name was Yuán.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-370a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:57:42.321+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Dà Zǐ》, pronounced tài.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-370a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T16:57:42.321+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-374a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:00:09.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Endowed with a wicked and obstinate nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-374a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:00:09.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they do not practice benevolence and righteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-374a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:00:09.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If you give them methods,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-374a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:00:09.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and regulate them with laws, they will resent you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-374a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:00:09.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus endangering yourself;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-374a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:00:09.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indulge them without restraint,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Excellent is the question!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Warn of it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">be cautious of it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">rectify yourself (one)!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In form, nothing is better than compliance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in heart, nothing is better than harmony.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Excellent question!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Be warned,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">be cautious,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and rectify your person, o woman</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In form, nothing is better than compliance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in heart, nothing is better than harmony</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">However,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these two have their dangers</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Compliance should not lead to submission</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:24.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One's own person should not be self-willed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and harmony should not lead to outward expression</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:24.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Be vigilant and cautious towards the crown prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:24.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not lightly offend him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If form complies to the point of submission,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One must not act according to one's own whims.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:24.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">conduct yourself on the correct path,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it will lead to derangement and ruin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Be wary and cautious of the Crown Prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:24.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and follow the appropriate opportunities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to collapse and failure</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the heart harmonizes to the point of outward expression,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:24.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Earlier, there was praise for the ability to ask.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not lightly offend or provoke him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">conduct yourself on the correct path,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it will lead to clamor and notoriety,</seg>
                    <seg>to abnormality and wickedness<seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00">If he acts like an infant,</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00">then you should also act like an infant;</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00">if he acts without boundaries,</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00">then you should also act without boundaries;</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00">if he acts without limits,</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:29.873+09:00">then you should also act without limits.</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to abnormality and wickedness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The previous section praised their ability to ask,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If he acts like an infant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and this section shows the method.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then you should also act like an infant;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-383a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 "Zhèng nǚ" is pronounced rǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if he acts without boundaries,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then you should also act without boundaries;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-383a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if he acts without limits,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-383a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Fǎnfù" is pronounced fāng fú fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then you should also act without limits.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-384a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Two】【Commentary】 The form is not contradictory,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Understand this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-384a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">harmonious but not the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-380a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and you will enter into flawlessness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-385a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 One's physical behavior is compliant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-385a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not violating the etiquette between ruler and subject.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-381a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-385a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One's wisdom is harmonious and yielding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-381a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">jù suǒyǐ wèi zhèng shēn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Elucidation] "Jiè" (戒) [be warned] means encourage (勗, xù).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-385a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">appearing mixed in, but the matter is accomplished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">xù yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-386a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Three】【Explanation】 The preceding two items,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-386a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">briefly outline methods.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One must not act wilfully.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-386a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since they are not yet perfect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Exercise caution in guarding the crown prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-386a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is still potential for trouble.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Do not lightly offend or provoke him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Conduct yourself in a righteous manner,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-387a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Four】【Commentary】 Compliance means conforming in form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-387a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">joining in means ultimately being the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Conform to the exigencies of the situation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-382a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:10:57.152+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">First, it praises his ability to inquire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-388a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 Guō's commentary says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-388a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">compliance means conforming in form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:14:31.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">using convenient means to guide and lead,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-388a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">joining in means ultimately being the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:14:31.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">attributing merit to the Crown Prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:14:31.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not displaying one's own abilities,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-389a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Five】【Commentary】 Harmony means assisting with righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:14:31.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus, one does not "come forth."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-389a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">coming forth means displaying one's own achievements (two).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:14:31.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Six】【Commentary】 If one ultimately becomes the same,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 One's wisdom is harmonious and yielding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using expedient means to guide and receive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">promoting the merits of the crown prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:14:31.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then it is like seeing danger and not supporting,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To conveniently receive and guide,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to push the merit to the Crown Prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not displaying one's own abilities,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is not acting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not showing one's own abilities,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is not to go forth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then it is like not offering support when (the situation) is overturned and endangered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and perishing together with them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:11:39.873+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then it is like seeing something collapsing and not supporting it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, one should pattern oneself after the standards of Heaven and Earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using convenient methods to guide,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but not establish petty differences.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Ascribe merit to the crown prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Elucidation] "Diān" 顛,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to overturn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Do not show off your own ability,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Miè" 滅,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-390a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what it means to not "chū (出)".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Six】【Commentary】 If you ultimately agree with him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to extinguish.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Bēng" 崩,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then it is like not supporting someone in danger and crisis,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to collapse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and perishing together with them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jué" 蹶,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, one should model themselves (mó) according to the standards of Heaven and Earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-391a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but not establish small differences only.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to fail.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation] Diān (顛)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(If one) describes (oneself) as conforming and complying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">entering into their evil together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to overturn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Miè (滅)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then it is like not offering support when (the situation) is overturned and endangered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus leading to overturning, extinguishing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to extinguish.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">collapsing, failing, and becoming corrupt,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Bēng (崩)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-234a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:17:44.805+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">'Do not avoid the enemy!'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and perishing together with them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to collapse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] "Wéi jué" 為蹶, Xú is pronounced qí yuè fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jué (蹶)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:17:44.805+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">His ministers have nowhere to escape his command."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:18:09.998+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The current edition writes "mō" 摸 using the wood radical, making it "mó" 模.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-08-30T17:18:10+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="KR5c0386-en-2018df50">or appearing either beneicial</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō's pronunciation is jué.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to fail.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:17:44.805+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The lord of Chǔ again sent envoys to seek peace with Jìn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-08-30T17:18:28.478+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="KR5c0386-en-2018df50">Therefore, he should behave stupidlyas if he were utterly in the dark,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:18:09.998+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one conforms in appearance and complies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:17:44.805+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of Jìn agreed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ's pronunciation is jǔ wèi fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:18:09.998+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you will inevitably invite accusations of tolerating their faults;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Mō gé" 摸格, mò hú fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:17:44.805+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and a date was set for the alliance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and enters into their wickedness together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:17:44.805+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Chǔ official Xǔ Bó was the charioteer for Yuè Bó,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:18:09.998+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if you enhance their reputation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo 盧文弨 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then it is like seeing something collapsing and not supporting it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus leading to overturning and extinction,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:18:09.998+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they will resent your surpassing them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">今本摸從木作模. [Now the character "mō" in the current version is written with the "wood" radical to form "mó."]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">collapsing and failing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:18:09.998+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and recklessly create calamities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary to Passage Seven] To overtly display harmony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-392a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and perishing together with them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">carries a reputation for concealing dirt;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the reputation of benefiting others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] Jué (蹶), Xú reads qí yuè fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The current version uses the character 模 (mó) with the wood radical.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will cause them to resent your surpassing them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō's pronunciation is jué.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-234a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"[Wú Pìdí!]"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:15:06.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and lead to groundless, monstrous actions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one will also acquire a reputation for enduring disgrace;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">今本摸從木作模. In the current version of the text, the character "mó" (摸) is written with the "wood" radical, making it "mó" (模).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ reads jǔ wèi fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【七】【注】自顯和之， [Annotation to Chapter 7] To display one's own harmony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The assembled officials had nowhere to escape for their lives."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Mó gé (摸格), mò hú fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if one accomplishes their fame,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Chǔ ruler again sent someone to seek peace with Jìn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">且有含垢之聲； and to have a reputation for tolerating filth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they will resent that one surpasses them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and recklessly create monstrous calamities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">濟彼之名， and to have a reputation for aiding others;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The current version uses 木 (mù, wood) to make 模 (mó, model) from 摸 (mō, touch).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-234a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The current version uses 木 (mù, wood) to make 模 (mó, model) from 摸 (mō, touch).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of Jìn agreed to it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, one should be silent and obscure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">【7】 [Commentary] When one conspicuously harmonizes with others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">彼將惡其勝己， others will resent being surpassed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and a date was set for the alliance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】 [Commentary] When one conspicuously harmonizes with others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">profoundly identifying with light and dust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and possesses a sound of embracing filth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Chǔ sent Xǔ Bó to drive the chariot, Yuè Bó to be the warrior on the left,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">妄生妖孽。 and will rashly create misfortune.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so that one cannot be approached intimately,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and possesses a sound of embracing filth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and Shè Shū to be on the right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故當悶然若晦， Therefore, one should be silent and obscure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">having a reputation of assisting them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nor alienated,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">having a reputation of assisting them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">玄同光塵， profoundly united with light and dust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">they will resent your superiority,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">to lead the Jìn army.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nor profited from,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and recklessly create misfortune.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they will resent your superiority,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">然後不可得而親， then one cannot be approached with familiarity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xǔ Bó said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nor harmed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:16:08.913+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and recklessly create misfortune.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Therefore, one should be silently obscure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I have heard that those who lead an army surrender</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不可得而疏， nor alienated,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] Transforming things into monsters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不可得而利， nor exploited,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">lower the banner, skirt the walls,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">mysteriously alike with light and dust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Niè* (孽),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不可得而害。 nor harmed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means calamity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then one cannot be approached intimately,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and then return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Even though one harmonizes with the light and identifies with the dust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Yuè Bó said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">cannot be distanced,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】變物為妖。 [Commentary] To transform things into monsters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">cannot be benefited,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">孽， "Niè" (孽)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I have heard that those who lead an army surrender</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if one displays one's own intelligence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">災也。 means calamity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">shoot arrows with barbed heads to the left,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and cannot conceal one's brilliance and hide one's tracks,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">cannot be harmed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">雖復和光同塵， Even if one harmonizes with the light and becomes one with the dust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one will gain a reputation for benefiting others.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">take the reins as the driver,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">[Annotation] Transforming things into monsters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">而自顯出己智， but displays one's own intelligence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Kuǎi Guì (蒯瞶) resented his surpassing him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Misfortune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">不能韜光晦跡， and cannot conceal one's brilliance and hide one's tracks,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-393a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the current version, mō (摸) is written as mó (模) with the wood radical.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">alight from the chariot,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and considered it to cause groundless, monstrous actions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">control both horses, wave the reins, and then return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【七】【Note】If one openly harmonizes with them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">is calamity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故有濟彼之名。 and thus has a reputation for aiding others.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and therefore harmed him through his actions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Shè Shū said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one will have a reputation for enduring humiliation;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Even if one harmonizes with light and dust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Kuǎi Guì 蒯瞶惡其勝己， Kuǎi Guì resented being surpassed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù (家世父) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I have heard that those who lead an army surrender</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then it is no longer harmony.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">yet conspicuously reveals one's own wisdom,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-234a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"[Wú Pìdí]! (There is no avoiding the enemy!)"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if one helps them achieve fame,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">謂其妄生妖孽， and said that he rashly created misfortune.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they will resent one for surpassing them</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">故以事而害之。 Therefore, he harmed him with deeds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Harmony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and cannot conceal one's brilliance and hide one's tracks,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The assembled ministers had nowhere to escape for their lives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Gauge their joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">enter the camp from the right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">cut off heads, capture prisoners, and then return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎家世父曰： ◎ Jiā Shìfù 家世父 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Chǔ ruler again sent envoys to seek peace with Jìn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then one has a reputation of assisting them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and recklessly create disasters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">initially involves the mutual balancing of the five flavors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">respond to their slowness and urgency,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then it is not harmony.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Each acted according to what they had heard and then returned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">using both sweetness and spiciness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Gauge its joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Kuǎi Guì resented his superiority,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of Jìn agreed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in order to regulate their mechanisms,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">和， Harmony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, one should be silently obscure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Jìn people chased them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">blending them into an amorphous state.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">respond to its urgency and leisure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">accusing him of recklessly creating misfortune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">mysteriously alike with light and dust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and a date was set for the alliance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without engaging in welcome or resistance with them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">attacking them from the left and right.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">始五味之相濟， begins with the mutual accommodation of the five flavors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one reveals them outwardly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in order to regulate and subdue its disposition,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">therefore harming him with affairs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Chǔ assigned Xǔ Bó to lead Yuè Bó,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and not engage in welcoming or rejecting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then one cannot be approached intimately,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">◎ Jiā Shìfù said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If there is welcome or resistance, then there is giving and taking,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then it is not harmony.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Yuè Bó shot a horse to the left,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">with Shè Shū as his right-hand man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">甘辛並用， using both sweet and spicy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If there is welcoming and rejecting, then there is ingress and egress.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Harmony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cannot be distanced,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">to welcome the Jìn army.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and shot a man to the right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Observe the timing of their joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">混合無形。 mixing them formlessly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Harmony does not desire to exit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cannot be benefited,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">begins with the mutual assistance of the five flavors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xǔ Bó said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">so the attack could not advance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">adapt to their pace and urgency,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">若表而出之， If one expresses it outwardly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">using sweet and spicy together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-394a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cannot be harmed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">because there is no rejection.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in order to regulate and subdue their disposition,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He had only one arrow left.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I have heard that those who welcome an army</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Annotation] Transforming things into monsters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">mixing and blending without form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">時其喜怒， Observe his likes and dislikes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】 《孽》niè, yàn liè fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A deer appeared in front,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">lower their flags, rub the ramparts</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and do not engage in welcoming or resisting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Misfortune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">If one expresses and displays it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">因其緩急， follow his slow and urgent moments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">he shot the deer, hitting the soft underbelly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《将恶》jiāng è, wū lù fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and then return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:01.016+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If there is welcoming and resisting, then there is coming and going.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then it is not harmony.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is calamity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Jìn's Bào Guǐ was behind them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">以調伏其機， in order to regulate and subdue his intentions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《闷然》mèn rán, pronounced mén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Yuè Bó said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Gauge their joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Even if one harmonizes with light and dust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I have heard that those who welcome an army</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">而不與為迎拒。 and not engage in welcoming or rejecting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He ordered Shè Shū to present the deer, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 町,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">yet conspicuously reveals one's own wisdom,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">adapt to their slowness and urgency,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">shoot arrows to the left with blunt arrowheads,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a boundary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:20:23.376+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">有迎拒斯有出入， With welcoming and rejecting, there is coming and going,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and cannot conceal one's brilliance and hide one's tracks,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">to subdue their impulses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">畦,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">take over the reins as a substitute driver,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">dismount the driver,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then one has a reputation of assisting them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and do not meet them with welcoming or rejecting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a raised plot.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Kuǎi Guì resented his superiority,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">与,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">shake the reins of both horses, and then return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:21:24.01+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Having welcoming and rejecting means having entry and exit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Shè Shū said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">accusing him of recklessly creating misfortune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to share.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">入,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore harming him with affairs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I have heard that those who welcome an army</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">enter the ramparts from the right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to meet.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Truly, dealing with the world and interacting with things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Harmony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">break off heads, capture prisoners, and then return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its way is truly difficult.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">begins with the mutual assistance of the five flavors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Each performed what they had heard and returned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of Jìn pursued them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One cannot just be in complete agreement,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">using sweet and spicy together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">attacking them from the left and right.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nor can one suddenly create antagonism.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">mixing and blending without form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Some are as foolish and base as infants,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one expresses and displays it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Yuè Bó shot a horse to the left,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and shot a man to the right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">則非和矣。 then it is not harmony.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and are utterly without knowledge;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">others are like fields without raised plots,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Gauge their joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">so the attackers could not advance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He only had one arrow left.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">lacking any boundaries at all;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">adapt to their slowness and urgency,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to subdue their impulses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A deer appeared in front,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indulging in extravagant greed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">engaging in fierce and cruel slaughter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and do not meet them with welcoming or rejecting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">he shot the deer, and it hit a turtle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Jìn's Bào Guǐ was behind them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:26:16.214+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Having welcoming and rejecting means having entry and exit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then, guide them with virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and he ordered Shè Shū to present the deer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">regulate them with propriety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:27:20.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who understand this principle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T17:28:31.787+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will then grasp the way of unburdenedness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">則非和矣。 then it is not harmony.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">時其喜怒， Observe their joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">因其緩急， respond to their slowness and urgency,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">以調伏其機， in order to regulate and subdue their intentions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">而不與為迎拒。 and not engage in welcoming or resisting them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">有迎拒斯有出入， With welcoming and resisting, there will be involvement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Harmony does not desire to go out;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is being without resistance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shìwén】《Niè》yàn liè fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Jiāng è》wū lù fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Mèn rán》yīn mén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-397a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Eight】【Commentary】 Do not take a petty, uncompromising stance, opposing them head-on.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 *Dīng*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means boundary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Qí*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means mound.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Yǔ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means together.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Rù*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to meet.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Dealing with the world and interacting with people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its way is truly difficult.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One cannot simply be harmonious with them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nor can one abruptly give rise to disagreement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Some resemble the foolishness and ignorance of infants,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and moreover, are without knowledge;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">others are like fields without plots,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">lacking any boundaries whatsoever;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they indulge in extravagant and greedy demands,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and commit ruthless and fierce killings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then guide them with virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and regulate them with propriety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who understand this principle</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:34:28.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will then understand the way of being without encumbrance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Otherwise, it is not harmony.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Observe the timing of their joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">respond according to their slowness and urgency,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in order to regulate and subdue their inclinations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without engaging in acceptance or resistance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If there is acceptance and resistance, then there is coming and going.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Harmony does not desire to go out,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">because there is no resistance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】"Niè" (孽) is pronounced yàn liè fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jiāng wù" (將惡) is pronounced wū lù fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Mèn rán" (悶然) is pronounced mén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-397a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【八】【Note】Do not stand stiffly with sharp corners to oppose their scales (sensibilities).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】Tǐng (町) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">border.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qí (畦) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">mound.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yǔ (與) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">together.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Rù (入) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meeting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Indeed, dealing with the world and interacting with people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its way is truly difficult.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One cannot simply be in harmony with them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nor should one abruptly generate discord.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Some are like the foolish and ignorant infants,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">furthermore, without knowledge;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">some are like fields without boundaries,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with almost no dividing lines;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indulging in extravagant greed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">engaging in fierce and brutal killings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then, guide them with virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">regulate them with ritual.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who understand this approach</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:36:54.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will then understand the way of unburdenedness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then it is not harmony.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Gauge their joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">respond to their slowness and urgency,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in order to regulate and subdue their impulses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without engaging in welcome or resistance with them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If there is welcome or resistance, then there is departure and entry.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Harmony does not desire to depart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-395a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">because there is no resistance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of Terms] 《Niè》: Yàn, liè, fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Jiāng è》: Wū, lù, fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-396a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Mèn rán》: Pronounced mén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-397a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Eight] [Commentary] Do not make small, sharp points to go against their scales (sensibilities).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Elucidation] Dǐng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means boundary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:56.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indulging in extravagant and greedy desires,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:56.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">engaging in ferocious and violent killings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means mound.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:56.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Afterwards, guide them with virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:56.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and regulate them with ritual propriety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:56.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who understand this principle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to share.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Rù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:56.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will then understand the way of unburdenedness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to meet.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Indeed, dealing with the world and interacting with things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the way is truly difficult.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One cannot simply be in harmony and agreement with them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nor can one abruptly create discord and opposition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Some are like the foolish and ignorant of infants,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and moreover, are without knowledge;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">some are like fields without boundaries (qí),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with virtually no borders;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Indulging in extravagant and greedy pursuits,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">engaging in fierce and violent slaughter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Only after that, guide them with virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">regulate them with propriety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who understand this principle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-398a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:39:15.977+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will then comprehend the path of non-accumulation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-402a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:48:18.807+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It angrily raises its arms to block the chariot wheel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-402a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:48:18.807+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not knowing that it cannot possibly succeed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-402a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:48:18.807+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is its beautiful talent</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-402a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:48:18.807+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Be warned,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-402a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:48:18.807+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">be cautious!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-402a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:48:18.807+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who accumulate victories and are praised will be attacked because of it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-406a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:05.023+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is a dangerous path.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:05.023+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation] Jī means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:05.023+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to accumulate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:05.023+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Ér</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:05.023+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means you.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:05.023+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-406a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Way of Danger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 *Jī* 積,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means accumulation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Ér* 而,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to you.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Jǐ* 幾,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means danger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now that you have been appointed as the heir apparent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you should be cautious.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, you are accumulating talent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-406a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Way of Peril.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">boasting of your own excellence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Jī 積 means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and offending authority,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to accumulate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Ér 而 means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which will inevitably lead to destruction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Do you not know about those who raise tigers?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"you."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jī 幾 means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They dare not give them live prey,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">peril.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">for fear of the anger of them killing it [一];</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they dare not give them whole prey,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since you have already been appointed as the heir apparent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">for fear of the anger of them tearing it apart [二];</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you should be cautious and careful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they regulate their hunger and satiety,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, you are accumulating talent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and understand their angry disposition [三].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being self-satisfied with your beauty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and offending those in power.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The tiger, though of a different species from humans, flatters and is raised by them</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This will certainly lead to your demise.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">because it is compliant.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Don't you know about those who raise tigers?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, those it kills</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are those who are defiant [四].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They do not dare to give them live creatures to eat,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-409a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一】【Annotation】 They fear that it will develop a murderous intent and consequently become angry.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">because they fear the anger of the tiger killing them [One];</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 Do you know anything about the methods of raising tigers?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they do not dare to give them whole carcasses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Animals like pigs and sheep</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">because they fear the anger of the tiger tearing them apart [Two];</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cannot be given alive to fierce beasts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they time its hunger and satiation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">for fear that they will develop anger through killing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and understand its angry feelings [Three].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The reason why the tiger, being of a different species than humans, flatters and supports its keeper</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù 家世父 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is because it is being obedient;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"How close!",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, those it kills</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he speaks of his angrily glaring at the mantis,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are those who are rebellious [Four].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and being close to danger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-409a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[One] [Note] This means being afraid that the tiger may have a murderous intent and thus become angry.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:49:31.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This refers to those who do not measure their own abilities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Do you know at all about the methods of raising tigers?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Creatures like pigs and sheep</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">should not be given to ferocious beasts alive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">for fear that they will generate anger through killing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù 家世父 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-406a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Way of Peril.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jī 幾,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary:] Jī 積 means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he speaks of the mantis glaring,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to accumulate and store.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is close to peril."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Ér 而 means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:50:10.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is someone who does not measure their own abilities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"you."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jī 幾 means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">danger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since you have already been appointed the heir apparent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you should be cautious and vigilant.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But now you accumulate talents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">boast of your beauty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and offend against authority and power.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-407a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This will certainly lead to destruction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Don't you know about those who raise tigers?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They do not dare to give them live animals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">for fear that they will be angered by the act of killing</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they do not dare to give them whole animals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">for fear that they will be angered by the act of tearing them apart</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they regulate their hunger and satiety,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and understand their angry feelings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The reason why tigers, who are different from humans, flatter and nourish themselves is</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">obedience.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, when they kill, it is</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-408a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">resistance</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-409a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Note 1:] [Explanation:] Fearing that they might have a killing intent and then become angry.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:54:30.521+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">for fear that they will become angry due to killing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary:] Do you know the methods of raising tigers?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:54:30.521+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù 家世父 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pigs and sheep</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:54:30.521+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jī 幾 (danger)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">should not be given to fierce beasts alive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:54:30.521+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the tiger's angry gaze towards a mantis,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I fear that killing it would give rise to anger and resentment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:54:30.521+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being close to it."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù 家世父 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:54:30.521+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This refers to those who do not measure their own abilities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is close;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He speaks of the mantis glaring angrily,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is very close to this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:52:50.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is not measuring one's own abilities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-234a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"No avoiding the enemy!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The assembled ministers had nowhere to escape with their lives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The ruler of Chǔ again sent someone to seek peace with Jìn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The people of Jìn agreed to it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and a date was set for the alliance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xǔ Bó and Yuè Bó of Chǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">with Shè Shū as the right-hand driver,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">were sent to escort the Jìn army.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Xǔ Bó said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I have heard that those who escort an army</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">lower their banners, brush against the ramparts</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and then return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Yuè Bó said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I have heard that those who escort an army</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">shoot arrows to the left with grass-tipped shafts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">for fear that they will become angry from killing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">take turns holding the reins,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">control the horses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jǐ yǐ"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">speaks of how it glares at a praying mantis,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">guide both horses, and then return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Shè Shū said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">almost touching it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"I have heard that those who escort an army</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This speaks of those who overestimate their talents.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The tiger's anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">enter the ramparts from the right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">cut off heads, capture prisoners, and then return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">can be made to be tamed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">They all acted according to what they had heard and returned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The horse's goodness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">The Jìn people pursued them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">attacking them from the left and right.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">can be made to break the bit, ruin the head, and shatter the chest in anger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Yuè Bó shot a horse to the left,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There is nothing else to it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and shot a man to the right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">simply do not provoke it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Fearing that killing would cause anger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the attack could not advance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The mantis provoking the chariot wheel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Jiā Shìfù said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what benefit is there in doing it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Close!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He only had one arrow left.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A deer appeared in front of them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Speaking of his angry glare at the mantis,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-411a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】《為其》于偽反. (Shìwén: "Wèi qí," pronounced yú wěi fǎn.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-411a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">下同. (The same below.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It was very close indeed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">he shot the deer and it pierced the tortoise.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is someone who does not measure their own abilities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-417a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:58:54.192+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【四】【注】順理則異類生愛，(Zhù: Complying with reason then different species will give rise to love,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-412a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【二】【注】方使虎自齧分之，(Zhù: If one makes the tiger bite and tear at it itself,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Jìn's Bào Guǐ was behind them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-412a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">則因用力而怒矣。(then it will become angry due to the exertion.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-417a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:58:54.192+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">逆節則至親交兵。(violating principles then even close relatives will engage in warfare.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and he had Shè Shū present the deer as an offering,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">As for a tiger's anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:55:26.61+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-413a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】汝頗知假令以死物投獸，(Shū: You should well know that even if one throws dead things to beasts,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:58:54.192+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】夫順則悅媚，(Shū: Now, if one complies, then there is joy and flattery,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It can be made docile.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">As for a horse's goodness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:58:54.192+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">虎狼可以馴狎；(tigers and wolves can be tamed and become docile;)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-413a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">猶須先為分決，(it is still necessary to first divide and separate them.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-413a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">若使虎自齧分，(If one makes the tiger bite and tear at it itself,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-417a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:59:56.978+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary:] When following principles, even different species can develop affection;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To make it break its bit, ruin its head, and shatter its chest in anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-417a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:59:56.978+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">when violating principles, even the closest relatives will engage in conflict.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There is no other reason,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-413a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">恐因用力而怒之也。(I fear that it will become angry due to the exertion.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:59:56.978+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation:] Indeed, when one is compliant, one pleases and charms,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-414a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】《分之》如字. (Shìwén: "Fēn zhī," as written.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Than not avoiding provoking it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:59:56.978+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and even tigers and wolves can be tamed and made docile;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">As for a mantis confronting a chariot wheel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-415a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【三】【注】知其所以怒而順之。(Zhù: Knowing the reason for its anger and complying with it.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:59:56.978+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">逆則殺害，(if one violates, then there is killing and harm,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-410a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What benefit is there in doing that!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-416a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】知飢飽之時，(Shū: Knowing the times of hunger and satiation,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-411a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】《為其》(wèi qí): yú wěi fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:59:56.978+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">至親所以交兵。(this is why even close relatives will engage in warfare.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-416a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">達喜怒之節，(understanding the limits of joy and anger,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-411a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-416a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">通於物理，(being versed in the principles of things,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-412a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【2】【Commentary】If you make a tiger bite and tear something apart itself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-416a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">豈復危亡！(how could one be in danger of death!)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-412a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then it will become angry from exerting force.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-413a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】Do you know that even if you throw a dead object to a beast,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-417a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary:] Following natural principles leads to love even between different species;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-413a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">You still need to first divide it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-417a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">violating natural order leads to even the closest relatives engaging in warfare.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation:] When one is compliant, they are pleasing and charming;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-413a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If you make a tiger bite and tear it apart itself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-413a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">You fear that it will become angry from exerting force.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">tigers and wolves can be tamed and domesticated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-414a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】《分之》(fēn zhī): As written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When one is defiant, it leads to killing and harm;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:56:08.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">even the closest relatives will engage in warfare.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-415a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【3】【Commentary】Knowing the reason for its anger and going along with it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-416a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】Knowing the times of hunger and fullness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-416a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Understanding the patterns of joy and anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-416a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Being versed in the principles of things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-416a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How could you face danger and death!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-417a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【4】【Commentary】Following the proper principles, even different species can develop affection;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-417a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Going against the proper order, even the closest relatives will fight.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】Indeed, if one complies, they are pleased and flattered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And even tigers and wolves can be tamed and be intimate;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one goes against, there will be killing and harm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-418a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T18:57:48.673+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And even the closest relatives will turn against each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-420a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:02:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">showing the utmost love for the horse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-421a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:02:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation:] Shèn (蜄)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-421a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:02:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a large clam.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-421a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:02:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Loving a horse's feces</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-421a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:02:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">shows the intention of valuing it greatly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-421a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:02:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Feces and urine are extremely vile,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-425a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:05:11.117+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">云： saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-425a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:05:11.117+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">僕御。 "Pú yù" (charioteer).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-425a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:05:11.117+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎王念孫曰： ◎ Wáng Niànsūn says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-425a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:05:11.117+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">案向崔二說皆非也。 Examining the two explanations of Xiàng and Cuī, both are incorrect.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-425a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:05:11.117+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">僕之言附也， The meaning of "pú" is "to attach,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-425a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:05:11.117+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">言虻附緣於馬體也。 meaning that wén and méng attach themselves to the horse's body.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-429a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:04.555+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【4】【Note】Covering its unpreparedness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-429a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:04.555+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is startled to this extent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:04.555+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 *Pū* means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:04.555+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to gather.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:04.555+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Fǔ* means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:04.555+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to pat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-429a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Four] [Commentary] To cover its unpreparedness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-429a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">hence the startlement that led to this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] *Pú* 樸 means,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to gather.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Fǔ* 拊 means,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to pat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xián* 銜 means,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to bridle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It happened that there were gadflies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gathering around and clinging to the horse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The master, being fond of it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">suddenly patted at them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his intention being to remove the harm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Not setting a time or occasion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he covered the horse unexpectedly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and it suddenly became terrified.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thereupon the horse broke its bridle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">tore apart the reins,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and people were trampled by its hooves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-430a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">resulting in those with crushed heads and broken chests.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-431a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Five] [Commentary] The intention was to remove the harm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-431a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but patting at it rashly</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-431a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">led to destruction and breakage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:08:03.666+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the same as to lose.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:08:03.666+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The intention (*zhì*) [至] (一) was,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-431a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">losing the very thing he loved.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:08:03.666+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to love the horse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-431a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, when dealing with things in the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:08:03.666+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but since it was destroyed and damaged,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-431a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">whether in times of adversity or prosperity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:08:03.666+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one lost that which was loved.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-431a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one must be cautious.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:08:03.666+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When humans interact with things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] *Wáng* 亡 means,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It's like losing something.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When the intention is focused</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">on loving a horse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and it is then injured or damaged,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one immediately loses what they loved.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-432a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:06:34.176+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When humans interact with things in the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-678a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:09:34.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Physics is a change.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-679a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:09:34.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of Text] 《Kě Lè》 (可樂) is pronounced luò.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_006-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:09:34.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Inner Chapters, Yang Sheng Zhu (養生主) Third</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_006-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:09:34.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_006-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:09:34.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, nurturing life is the ultimate principle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_006-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:09:34.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one nurtures beyond the limit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_006-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T19:10:14.314+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">Inner Chapters, Yang Sheng Zhu (養生主) Third</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-433a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:10:25.91+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Some versions have "卒 (zú)"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-433a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:10:25.91+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pronunciation: qī hū fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-434a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:10:25.91+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【校 Jiào】 (一) The character "至 (zhì)" is corrected according to the main text and Guō's commentary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-435a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:10:25.91+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The artisan Shí traveled to Qí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-435a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:10:25.91+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and arrived at Qū Yuán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-435a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:10:25.91+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">where he saw the Lì Shè tree [一].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-676a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:11:03.353+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Nor is it without a dividing line.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-677a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:11:03.353+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Six] [Commentary] Time does not pause for even a moment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-677a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:11:03.353+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the present does not continue to exist.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-677a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:11:03.353+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the dream of yesterday</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-677a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:11:03.353+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has transformed into what it is now.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-677a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:11:03.353+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The changes of life and death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-677a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T19:14:15.292+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">and the present does not continue to exist.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-671a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:53:03.388+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is not necessarily not a dream.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-672a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:53:03.388+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】《然覺》Pronounced "gǔ xiào fǎn."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-672a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:53:03.388+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《蘧蘧》Xú's pronunciation is qú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-672a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:53:03.388+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also pronounced qí lǜ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-672a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:53:03.388+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-672a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:53:03.388+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">has a form and appearance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-672a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T19:54:15.744+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">《蘧蘧》Xú's pronunciation is qú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-667a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:55:06.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Ah!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-668a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:55:06.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Second Commentary] When he was dreaming of being a butterfly and did not know Zhōu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-668a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:55:06.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then it is no different from a different death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-668a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:55:06.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">However, there is no place where he is not contented,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-668a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:55:06.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then those who cling to life when they should live,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-668a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:55:06.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will certainly be attached to death when they should die.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-668a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T19:55:48.287+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">then it is no different from a different death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-666a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:56:20.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xīn chàng describes a joyful appearance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-666a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:56:20.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yù means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-666a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:56:20.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to understand.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-666a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:56:20.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The interchange of birth and death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-666a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:56:20.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the succession of cold and heat,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-666a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:56:20.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are indeed the constant nature of Heaven and Earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-666a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T19:57:33.661+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">to understand.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:58:19.236+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When the one in mourning is inside</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:58:19.236+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, love is still directed towards the living.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:58:19.236+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Even if one wants to extend and equalize it</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:58:19.236+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, that which is valued is already fixed in the mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:58:19.236+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, how can there be any hope of equality?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-661a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T19:58:19.236+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Whether one waits or does not wait,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T19:59:40.794+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">Even if one wants to extend and equalize it</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:00:23.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the correctness of Heaven and Earth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:00:23.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, "that" and "I" are mutually dependent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:00:23.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">form and shadow arise together.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:00:23.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Although they are mysteriously united,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:00:23.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they are not dependent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:00:23.493+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Understanding this principle</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-660a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:01:17.094+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">form and shadow arise together.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-658a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:02:11.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This understanding of the relationship between form and shadow</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-658a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:02:11.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is no different from that of a snake's shed skin (fù jiǎ).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-659a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:02:11.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of Text] "Shé fù" (蛇蚹) is pronounced fù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-659a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:02:11.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xu also pronounces it fū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-659a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:02:11.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ (司馬) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-659a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:02:11.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It refers to the serrated scales on a snake's belly that allow it to move.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-659a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:03:21.558+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">[Explanation of Text] "Shé fù" (蛇蚹) is pronounced fù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-658a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:04:11.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They all say that "shé fù" (蛇蚹) refers to the rough scales on the snake's belly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-658a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:04:11.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Tiáo yì" (蜩翼) means cicada wings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-658a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:04:11.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They say that snakes rely on their "fù" to move,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-658a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:04:11.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cicadas rely on their wings to fly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-658a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:04:11.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and shadows rely on forms to exist.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-658a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:04:11.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But is this really the case?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-658a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:06:01.878+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">They say that snakes rely on their "fù" to move,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-653a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:06:41.607+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sitting and rising require no dependence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-653a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:06:41.607+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who attain something uniquely, without dependence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-653a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:06:41.607+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">who knows the reason for it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-653a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:06:41.607+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and who can fault the means by which they do so?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-654a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:06:41.607+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] The forms and qualities of things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-654a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:06:41.607+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">all receive from nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-653a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:07:34.293+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">who knows the reason for it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-651a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:08:33.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Wǎng làng 罔浪:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-651a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:08:33.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Beyond the shadow is layered darkness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-651a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:08:33.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The commentary explains that Cuī's 崔 version has "wǎng làng 罔浪,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-651a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:08:33.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">saying it describes the state of having or not having,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-651a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:08:33.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">differing in meaning from Sīmǎ's 司馬 interpretation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-651a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:08:33.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Jǐng》景 is pronounced yǒng 永 with a rising tone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-651a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:09:32.507+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">The commentary explains that Cuī's 崔 version has "wǎng làng 罔浪,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-649a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:10:25.291+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The faint shadow outside the main shadow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-649a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:10:25.291+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Nǎng (曩):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-649a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:10:25.291+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">formerly, in the past.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-649a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:10:25.291+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Tè (特): especially, particularly, directed towards.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-649a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:10:25.291+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Tè (特)]:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-650a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:10:25.291+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">alone, solitary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-649a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:11:08.112+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">formerly, in the past.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-644a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:11:38.199+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To decide based on right and wrong,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-644a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:11:38.199+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">once unified in right and wrong,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-644a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:11:38.199+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is how one forgets righteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-644a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:11:38.199+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is to dismiss the endless meaning of prior knowledge of right and wrong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-644a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:11:38.199+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Once life and death, right and wrong, are swept away and become one,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-644a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:11:38.199+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one can then freely understand profound principles</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-644a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:13:05.886+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">is how one forgets righteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-641a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:13:36.43+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, there is neither right nor wrong;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-641a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:13:36.43+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one allows its limitless transformations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-641a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:13:36.43+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus one is able to neither stagnate nor cling.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-641a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:13:36.43+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Having done this, one dwells in accordance with circumstances and finds peace in the times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-641a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:13:36.43+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus fulfilling the lifespan allotted by Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-642a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:13:36.43+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Annotations】《Màn》 (曼): Xú reads it as "wàn";</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-641a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:14:15.998+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">thus one is able to neither stagnate nor cling.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-639a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:15:17.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the theory of changing sounds</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-639a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:15:17.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">relies on having these designations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-639a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:15:17.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since the designations are not real,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-639a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:15:17.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the reliance becomes a false reliance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-639a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:15:17.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Reliance is then not reliance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-639a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:15:17.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore we know that they are not mutually dependent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-639a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:15:57.052+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">Since the designations are not real,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-637a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:16:26.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, right and wrong, so and not so,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-637a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:16:26.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">originate from deluded emotions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-637a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:16:26.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one investigates them with reason,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-637a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:16:26.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the whole body is illusory.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-637a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:16:26.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What is considered right is then not right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-637a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:16:26.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what is considered so is then not so.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-637a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:17:11.285+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">If one investigates them with reason,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-634a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:17:42.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Presented in the following text.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-635a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:17:42.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】《Hé Zhī》 (和之) is read as it is.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-635a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:17:42.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī Hú (崔胡) is read as wò (臥) fǎn (反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-635a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:17:42.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Tiān Ní》 (天倪): Lǐ (李) pronounces it yá (崖).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-635a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:17:42.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú (徐) pronounces it yì (詣).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-635a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:17:42.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō (郭) pronounces it wǔ (五) dǐ (底) fǎn (反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-635a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:18:33.195+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">Cuī Hú (崔胡) is read as wò (臥) fǎn (反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-632a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:19:03.856+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Rán bù rán.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-632a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:19:03.856+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If 'it is' is really 'it is,'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-632a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:19:03.856+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the difference between 'it is' and 'it is not' would also be indistinguishable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-632a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:19:03.856+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If 'it is so' is really 'it is so,'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-632a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:19:03.856+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the difference between 'it is so' and 'it is not so' would also be indistinguishable (1)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-632a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:19:03.856+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The mutual dependence of transforming sounds</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-632a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:19:54.024+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">then the difference between 'it is' and 'it is not' would also be indistinguishable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-628a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:21:53.385+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-628a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:21:53.385+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, right and wrong</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-628a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:21:53.385+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">arise from a fondness for debate and cease in the Heavenly Equilibrium.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-628a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:21:53.385+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Entrust it to acting separately and rest in self-correction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-629a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:21:53.385+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Each side yielding to their own bias,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-629a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:21:53.385+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">right and wrong both following their own course,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-628a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:22:32.372+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">arise from a fondness for debate and cease in the Heavenly Equilibrium.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-621a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:23:06.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ Yún:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-621a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:23:06.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">黮闇 (dàn àn),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-621a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:23:06.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">describes obscurity and lack of clarity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-622a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:23:06.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【六】【疏】Since you are going to see things the same way as me,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-622a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:23:06.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then you are no different from me.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-622a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:23:06.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If you are no different from me,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-621a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:23:54.044+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">describes obscurity and lack of clarity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-618a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:25:16.494+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Arising from deluded emotions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-619a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:25:16.494+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【5】【Commentary】 To speculate after not knowing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-619a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:25:16.494+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to debate after not seeing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-619a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:25:16.494+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to debate without being able to convince oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-619a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:25:16.494+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is because one is in opposition to things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-619a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:25:16.494+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Debating in opposition all day long is dim and obscure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-619a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:26:03.027+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">to debate after not seeing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:26:44.035+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The whole body is not genuine;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:26:44.035+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you are an inverted fool,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:26:44.035+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">rashly making judgments of right and wrong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:26:44.035+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Suppose I were to argue with you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:26:44.035+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you win and I lose.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:26:44.035+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is your victory definitely right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And is the result truly wrong?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is it perhaps right?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is it perhaps wrong?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:34.365+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">rashly making judgments of right and wrong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is it entirely right?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is it entirely wrong?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If I and you cannot understand each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:52.975+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">In that case, neither I nor you nor anyone else can understand each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then people are certainly subject to its darkness and obscurity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:28:06.226+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">Since they already agree with both me and you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Who should I get to correct it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:28:06.226+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">[Commentary] Ruò 若 and Ěr 而 both mean "you" (汝).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Should I get someone who agrees with you to correct it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since they already agree with you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can they correct it!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Should I get someone who agrees with me to correct it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since they already agree with me,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can they correct it!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Should I get someone who disagrees with both me and you to correct it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since they already disagree with both me and you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can they correct it!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Should I get someone who agrees with both me and you to correct it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since they already agree with both me and you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can they correct it!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In that case, neither I nor you nor anyone else can understand each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and must we wait for that other person?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Ruò 若 and Ěr 而 both mean "you" (汝).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Ruò bù shèng rǔ yě yé 若不勝汝也耶" means, "you do not overcome you?" It is a rhetorical question.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These rights and wrongs, this and that,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the whole body is untrue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These inverted followers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">arbitrarily make judgements.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Supposing I and you are arguing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">you win and I don't win,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-614a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:27:17.906+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">your winning is definitely right.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:29:00.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And is it really not right?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:29:00.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is it perhaps right?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:29:00.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is it perhaps not right?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:29:00.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is it entirely right?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:29:00.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is it entirely not right?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:29:00.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If I and you cannot understand each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-613a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:31:47.238+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">Is it perhaps wrong?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-609a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:32:18.181+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo 盧文弨 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-609a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:32:18.181+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The old version omitted the character "又" (yòu),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-609a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:32:18.181+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now supplemented.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-609a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:32:18.181+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"詭" (guǐ) is pronounced jiǔ wěi fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-609a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:32:18.181+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning different.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-610a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:32:18.181+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一０】【Note】 It says that those who can shed attachments and attain profound unity, transcending life and death, are extremely rare.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-609a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:33:22.719+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">now supplemented.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-605a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:34:09.158+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">夫自以為夢，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-605a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:34:09.158+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one is still not awakened.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-605a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:34:09.158+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How much more so if one secretly thinks oneself to be awake!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-606a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:34:09.158+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】夫迷情無覺，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-606a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:34:09.158+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">discussing dreams is still within a dream.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-606a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:34:09.158+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Explanations via sounds are not genuine;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-605a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:35:11.664+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">How much more so if one secretly thinks oneself to be awake!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-600a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:36:47.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Being muddled in a dream,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-600a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:36:47.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one takes oneself to be awake,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-600a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:36:47.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and secretly discusses what one alone knows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-600a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:36:47.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those whom one's affections favor are made rulers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-600a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:36:47.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">those whom one's affections dislike are equated with herdsmen and grooms.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-600a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:36:47.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Taking this as one's emotional disposition</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-600a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:38:02.506+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">and secretly discusses what one alone knows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-594a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:39:10.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">何為方生而憂死哉！ What is the reason for worrying about death while still being alive?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-595a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:39:10.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【疏】夫人在睡夢之中， [Commentary:] When people are in a sleeping dream,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-595a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:39:10.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">謂是真實， they consider it to be real,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-595a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:39:10.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">亦復占候夢想， and they even divine and dream,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-595a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:39:10.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">思度吉凶， thinking about good and bad omens.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-595a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:39:10.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">既覺以後， After awakening,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-595a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:40:07.007+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">謂是真實， they consider it to be real,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-588a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:40:45.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, if one rejoices in life while alive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-588a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:40:45.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then one will rejoice in death when dying.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-588a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:40:45.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Although life and death are different,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-588a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:40:45.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they are the same in that each attains what one desires.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-588a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:40:45.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">So what is there to worry about!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-589a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:40:45.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] The transformation of death and life</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-588a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:43:45.482+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">Although life and death are different,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-586a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:44:35.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(II) Zhào 本無 (Zhào Běnwú) had no *zì* (style name).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-587a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:44:35.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He who dreams of drinking wine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-587a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:44:35.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">weeps in the morning;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-587a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:44:35.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he who dreams of weeping,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-587a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:44:35.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">goes hunting in the morning</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-587a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:44:35.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">While he is dreaming,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:04.772+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is called *shè*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:04.772+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Jiàng* is a general term for craftsmen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:04.772+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and Shí is the personal name of a skilled one.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:04.772+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This person went from Lǔ to Qí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, it is called "shè" (社, community shrine).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:04.772+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">passing through a winding road,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jiàng" (匠) is a general term for artisans,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-587a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:39.852+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">weeps in the morning;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:04.772+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and saw this extraordinary tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">while "Shí" (石) is the personal name of a particularly skilled one.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This person went from Lǔ (魯) to Qí (齊),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore it is called the Shè (社, local god shrine tree).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">traveling a winding road.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jiàng" (匠, artisan) is a general term for workers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">while "Shí" (石, Stone) is the private name of a skilled one.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He saw this unusual tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gnarled, swollen, and useless as timber.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This man went from Lǔ (魯) to Qí (齊),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">traveling a winding path,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The intention is to make clear that navigating human affairs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one must employ uselessness as usefulness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and saw this strange tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【释文】《Qū Yuán》 (曲辕) is pronounced Yuán (袁).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, it is called the Shè (社) [Altar of the Soil].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">bulky and useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ (司馬) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jiàng (匠) is a general term for artisans,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is desired to illustrate that navigating human affairs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one must use uselessness as a utility.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">while Shí (石) is the personal name of a skilled one.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Qū Yuán" (曲辕)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This man went from Lǔ (魯) to Qí (齊).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means a winding road.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Annotations】《Qū Yuán》 (曲轅) pronounced Yuán.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ (司馬) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">On the way, he passed a winding road,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and saw this strange tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Qū Yuán" (曲轅)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It's the name of a road.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gnarled and useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means a winding path.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Lì》 (櫟) is pronounced lì dí fǎn (力狄反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It wants to make clear that navigating human affairs</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ (李) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It's the name of a road.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It's the name of a tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-436a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">must be done by using the useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-579a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The poem "Shǎo Ér" reverses the illumination.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Lì》 (櫟) pronounced lì dí fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Another account says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Annotations】《Qū Yuán》 (曲轅): Pronounced Yuán (袁).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:47.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">was exceptionally tall compared to ordinary trees.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-579a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The "Yān Zhī" reverses at yú Qián.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It's a qiú (梂) tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A particularly tall and sturdy tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ (司馬) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-579a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:47.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Its branches and leaves provided shade,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It's the name of a tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:47.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">sheltering several thousand cattle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Another version says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qū Yuán (曲轅)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎Lú Wénchāo (盧文弨) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its branches and leaves providing a dense shade,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Three】【Commentary】Within a lifetime,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is a qiú (梂) fruit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:47.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When bound with rope,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a winding road.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:47.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its circumference was a hundred feet.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character qiú (梂),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo (盧文弨) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">capable of sheltering thousands of oxen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">emotions change like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:47.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Jiangnan (江南) edition often states that its great size shaded cattle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:56.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He had only one arrow left.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in most versions is written as cǎi (采),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"qiú" (梂),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using ropes to bind it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is an error.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is the name of a road.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">On this day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:56.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A deer appeared in front of them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in many editions is written as "cǎi" (采),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Only one arrow was used.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Lì》 (櫟): Pronounced lì dí fǎn (力狄反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, I correct it according to the Sòng (宋) version.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its circumference is roughly a hundred *chǐ* (尺).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:56.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">he shot the deer, hitting a turtle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is an error.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one does not know the other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A mí (麋, elk) appeared in front.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:47:05.892+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, the difference between life and death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【二】【疏】 "Xié" (絜) means to bind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Many farmsteads south of the Yangtze River often say that its great size can shelter oxen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:56.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Jìn's Bào Guǐ was behind them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now I correct it based on the Song edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He shot the mí (麋, elk), and it pierced the tortoise shell.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much more so the changes of death and life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It also means to restrain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:47:05.892+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can one know it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:56.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He ordered Shè Shū to present the deer, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but do not use the expression "thousands."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is the name of a tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bào Guǐ (鮑癸) of Jìn (晉) was behind him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【2】 【Commentary】 "xié" (絜) means to restrain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can they know each other?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This lì (櫟) tree at the community shrine</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This version must be a mistake.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it means to restrain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:56.514+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:47:05.892+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhuāngzǐ uses allegory,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He had Shè Shū (攝叔) present the mí (麋, elk), saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】In the past, Qín Mù Gōng and Jìn Xiàn Gōng together attacked the state of Lì Róng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">That is roughly what its appearance was like.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, the trees of Shāngqiū (商丘),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Lì (櫟) tree at the Shè (社) shrine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:47:05.892+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore he calls Xiàn Gōng a king.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is a qiú (梂) [oak].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:53:32.735+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">feelings change like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Because it is not the right season,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:53:32.73+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">At that particular time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:53:32.735+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">[Three] [Note:] Within a single lifetime,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:53:32.734+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">one does not know the other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-579a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:53:32.734+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">The following is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">obtaining one beautiful woman,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zhī yè fù yīn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">have previously formed a thousand four-horse chariots when joined together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">was especially tall compared to ordinary trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-582a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:47:05.892+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory Notes】 Cūi says about "Zhi Yu Wang Suǒ":</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the game is not yet abundant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo (盧文弨) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:54:28.123+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">how can they know each other?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:54:36.613+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">【Subcommentary】In the past, Qín Mù Gōng and Jìn Xiàn Gōng together attacked the state of Lì Róng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">bì shù qiān niú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and two jade rings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#jrwilliams" modified="2025-08-30T20:54:41.602+09:00" resp-del="#jrwilliams" src-id="KR5c0386-en-ea80fa73">obtaining one beautiful woman,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qiú (梂),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could they only shelter one ox?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">covering several thousand cattle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to offer it to nourish the attendants."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-582a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:47:05.892+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">During the time of the Six Kingdoms, the feudal lords presumptuously called themselves kings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qín took the rings, and Jìn took the woman,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yǐ shéng shù zhī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and when measured with a rope,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bào Guǐ (鮑癸) stopped him, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">most versions write it as cǎi (采),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">According to this standard of measurement,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">wéi cū bǎi chǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">who was the daughter of a border guard from the territory of Ài in the state of Lì Róng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:25.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jiāngnán zhuāng běn duō yán qí dà bì niú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"thousands" is the correct version.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its circumference was a hundred feet thick.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The one on the left is good at archery,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">an error.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Kuāng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the one on the right is eloquent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-437a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now corrected according to the Sòng (宋) edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory Notes】*Bì niú* (蔽牛): *bì shì fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:45:59.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Jiāngnán (江南) edition mostly mentions that its size provided shade for cattle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When first leaving Lì Róng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He is a junzi (君子, gentleman)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【2】【Commentary】 Xié (絜) means to bind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He was then released.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">separating from relatives,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Wèi Qí (魏錡) of Jìn (晉) sought to be recognized as a member of the ducal clan,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">An ox could live beside it and not be seen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It also means to restrain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">longing for her homeland,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but was unsuccessful and became angry,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The tree at the Shè (社) altar,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xié* (絜): According to Xiàng Xú (向徐), *hù jié fǎn*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, tears wet her clothes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú (徐) also *hǔ jié fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">was extraordinarily tall compared to ordinary trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">desiring to ruin the Jìn (晉) army.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Later, arriving at the state of Jìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To bind and restrain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He requested to withdraw the army,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">favored and honored greatly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its branches and leaves providing shade,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but was not permitted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìngfān's (慶藩) annotation: The commentary to Jiǎ Chángshā's (賈長沙) "Guò Qín Lùn" (過秦論) in the *Wen Xuan* (文選) cites Sīmǎ (司馬) saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">sheltering several thousand cattle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">sharing the same square bed with Xiàn Gōng and resting together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He requested to be sent as an envoy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xié* (絜),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When bound with a rope,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">which was permitted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means circumference.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its circumference was a hundred chi (尺) [feet].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">offering abundant meals to fill the kitchen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Thereupon he went and requested battle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:46:53.11+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Jiāngnán (江南) edition often states that its great size shelters cattle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The explanatory note is missing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">her feelings having already changed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">then returned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Pān Dǎng (潘黨) of Chǔ (楚) pursued him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Bǎi wéi* (百圍): Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, she regretted her earlier weeping.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">reaching Yíngzé (熒澤).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A *chǐ* (尺) in diameter is one *wéi* (圍),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Within a lifetime,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He saw six mí (麋, elk),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is roughly ten *zhàng* (丈).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">shot one mí (麋, elk), and turned to offer it, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】Seven *chǐ* (尺) is called a *rèn* (仞).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">emotions change like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This tree stands straight and tall, craggy and steep for more than seventy *chǐ* (尺),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How much more so the difference between death and life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"You have military affairs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I fear the hunters may not be able to sufficiently supply fresh meat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then extends forth its branches and trunk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can one know?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:50:44.166+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to offer it to the attendants."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">shading the sun and brushing the clouds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhuāngzǐ is speaking allegorically,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-581a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, he calls Xiàn Gōng a king.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">whose size number in the dozens.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:49:04.676+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Such is its appearance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-582a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】《Zhì yú wáng suǒ》, Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-582a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:48:28.928+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">During the time of the Six Kingdoms, the feudal lords presumptuously called themselves kings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-579a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:57:43.512+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Shǎo ér" (《少而》) poem: zhào fǎn (照反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-579a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:57:43.512+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Yān zhī" (《焉知》): yú qián fǎn (於虔反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-579a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:57:43.512+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The following is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:57:43.512+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Three] [Note:] Within a single lifetime,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:57:43.512+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">feelings change like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_005-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T20:57:43.512+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">At that particular time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">was especially tall among common trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with branches and leaves covering,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">sheltering several thousand oxen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When bound with rope,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it measured a hundred feet in circumference.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Jiāngnán (江南) version often speaks of its size sheltering oxen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">wú shù qiān zì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cǐ běn yìng cuò.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qiě Shāngqiū zhī mù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">jì jié sì qiān shèng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The trees for the crooked yoke,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">qǐ bì yī niú?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yǐ cǐ gé liàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Only one arrow was used.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">shù qiān zhī běn shì yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A *mí* deer appeared in front.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shìwén】 *Bì niú*, bì shì fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He shot the *mí* deer and hit the mark.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ yún:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bào Guǐ of Jìn was behind him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He had Shè Shū present the *mí* deer, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Niú zhù qí páng ér bù jiàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xié*, xiàng Xú hù jié fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú yòu hǔ jié fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Because it is not the proper season,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yuē shù yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìngfān àn Wénxuǎn Jiǎ Chángshā Guò Qín lùn zhù yǐn Sīmǎ yún:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the bird has not yet arrived,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I venture to provide it as food for the followers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xié*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zā yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bào Guǐ stopped him, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A particularly tall and old tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with branches and leaves covering and shading,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shìwén quē.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The one on the left shoots well,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">could shelter thousands of oxen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Bǎi wéi*, Lǐ yún:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the one on the right is eloquent;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jìng chǐ wèi wéi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It was bound with ropes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">he is a *jūnzǐ*."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gài shí zhàng yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its circumference roughly a hundred *chǐ* (尺).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Thus, he was excused.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Jīangnán editions of Zhuāngzǐ mostly say its largeness was enough to shelter oxen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sān】【Shū】 Qī chǐ yuē rèn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without the wording "thousands."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cǐ shù zhí sǒng yín cén qīshí yú chǐ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Wèi Qí of Jìn sought to join the ducal clan</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This edition [saying thousands] must be correct.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but was not accepted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">ránhòu tǐng shēng zhī gàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and he became angry,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Furthermore, the trees of Shāngqīu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">bì rì shāo yún.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">could already support a thousand four-horse carriages.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">wanting to ruin the Jìn army.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Kān wèi chuán zhě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Could the trees of Qūyuán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He requested to withdraw the army,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but was not allowed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">only shelter one ox?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">páng yǒu shù shí mù zhī dà.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He requested to be sent as an envoy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">According to this standard,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:35:33.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Gài qí zhuàng rú shì yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and this was granted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"thousands" must be the correct reading.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】 *Bì Níu* (蔽牛): *bì shì fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Thereupon he went,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">requested battle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ Yún said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and returned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The oxen could stay by its side and not be seen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Pān Dǎng of Chǔ pursued him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xié* (絜): Xiàng Xú: *hù jié fǎn*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú also: *hǔ jié fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">reaching Yíngzé.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He saw six *mí* deer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To bind and restrain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">shot one, and, turning around, presented it, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìngfān's note: The commentary in the *Wénxuǎn* on Jiǎ Chángshā's *Guò Qín Lùn* quotes Sīmǎ, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"You have military affairs;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xié*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">will the hunters perhaps not adequately supply fresh meat?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to encircle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The explanation of terms is missing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:36:25.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I venture to present it to the followers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Bǎi Wéi* (百圍): Lǐ Yún said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A diameter of one *chǐ* is called a *wéi*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">thus it's about ten *zhàng* (丈).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 Seven *chǐ* are called a *rèn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This tree stood straight and tall, craggy and towering, over seventy *chǐ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then its branches and trunk grew out,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">shading the sun and brushing the clouds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Beside it were several trees large enough</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be used as boats.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T21:37:53.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">That was the general appearance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A particularly tall and old tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its branches and leaves covering and shading,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">sheltering thousands of cattle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To bind it with ropes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its circumference is a hundred *chǐ* (尺).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Jiangnán edition often says that its size shelters cattle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without using the words "thousands."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This edition must be a mistake.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, the trees of Shāngqiū (商丘),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">already strong enough to form a team of four horses and a thousand chariots,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the trees of Qūyuán (曲轅),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could they only shelter one ox?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using this as a standard of measurement,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-438a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the edition with "thousands" is correct.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】 *Bì niú* (蔽牛): *bì shì fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cattle can live beside it and not be seen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xié* (絜): Formerly, Xú (徐) pronounced it *hù jié fǎn*;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú (徐) also pronounces it *hǔ jié fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means "to bind and restrain."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìngfān's (慶藩) note: The commentary to Jiǎ Chángshā's (賈長沙) *Guò Qín Lùn* (過秦論) in the *Wén Xuǎn* (文選) quotes Sīmǎ (司馬) saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xié* (絜),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "to encircle."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Shì Wén* (釋文) lacks this explanation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Bǎi wéi* (百圍): Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"One *chǐ* (尺) in diameter is called a *wéi* (圍),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-439a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is approximately ten *zhàng* (丈)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 Seven *chǐ* (尺) is called a *rèn* (仞).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This tree stands straight and tall, craggy and steep, more than seventy *chǐ* (尺) high,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then its branches and trunk grow out,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">shading the sun and brushing the clouds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There are dozens of trees nearby</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">large enough to be used for boats.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T22:31:02.254+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is roughly what it looks like.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:10:21.24+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This tree stands straight, towering more than seventy *chǐ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:10:21.24+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then its branches and trunk extend outwards,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:10:21.24+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">blocking the sun and touching the clouds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:10:21.24+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Suitable for making boats,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:10:21.24+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with the size of dozens of trees nearby.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-440a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:10:21.24+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Its appearance is probably like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-441a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:28:39.713+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Zhèng Jiān* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-441a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:28:39.713+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Fāng* (方),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-441a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:28:39.713+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "furthermore."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-441a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:28:39.713+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Those that can be made into boats, there are moreover a dozen,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-441a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:28:39.713+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "those that can be made into boats, there are furthermore a dozen."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-441a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:28:39.713+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The explanatory notes cite *Cuī* saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-443a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:38:14.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Bù Chuò》 "Chuò" (輟) is pronounced dīng lvè (丁劣).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-444a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:38:14.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Correction】 (One) The Shìdétáng edition omits the characters "shù qiān" (數千),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-444a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:38:14.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is the same as the Shìwén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-444a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:38:14.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Quēwù cites the Southern Táng dynasty version of Lǐ and Zhāng Jūnfáng's version as having them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-445a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:38:14.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The disciple became bored of watching,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-445a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:38:14.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and ran after the carpenter Shí (石),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:05.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if made into a door, it will ooze sap;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:05.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if made into a pillar, it will be eaten by worms.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:05.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is timber without use,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:05.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">good for nothing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:05.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it can have such longevity."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-449a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:05.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Annotation 1] "Yǐ,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"If used as a door, it will ooze sap;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if used as a pillar, it will be eaten by worms</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"This is useless timber,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">good for nothing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-448a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it can live to such an old age</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-449a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-449a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jiàng Shí knew that the large tree was useless,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-449a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not suitable for worldly uses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-449a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Suspecting that his disciples were wasting words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-449a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he rebuked them, telling them to stop and say no more.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-449a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-450a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and if used for boats, they will sink;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-450a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">near the soil, it rots easily,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-450a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and if used for coffins, it will break quickly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-450a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">A sparse, scattered tree</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:40:29.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since Lì wood is sparse and brittle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-450a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">lives out its natural lifespan,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:40:29.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what doubt is there that it would be destroyed early?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-450a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and is also useless timber,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-450a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it achieves leisure and freedom.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:40:29.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-450a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Textual Explanation:] "Sàn mù" (散木): Xī dàn fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:40:29.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Dù" (蠹) means...</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-451a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú xī dàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-451a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-451a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zé sù" (則速): As the character reads.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-451a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiàng Cuī wrote "shù" (數) here.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-451a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiàng suǒ lù fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-451a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-451a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Fǔ" (腐): Fú fǔ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The value lies in being firm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-451a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the oak is sparse and brittle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">value durability.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what doubt is there that it will be destroyed early?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The value lies in solidity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] "Shū": "Mán"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the oozing of sap.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the lì oak is sparse and brittle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-452a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">why doubt that it will be destroyed early?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Dù"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary 4] "Mán"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to insects inside the wood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the oozing of resinous fluids.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If used for doors, the sap will ooze out;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if used for beams and pillars, it will be infested with insects and not be strong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-453a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:39:33.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Dù"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] 《液》 (yè) is pronounced "yì."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《樠》 (mán) is pronounced "wáng yán fǎn."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xianglǐ Mògān fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō Wǔ bàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"液" (yè)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means fluid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"樠" (mán)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the oozing of sap in a mánmán manner.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is the oozing of black fluid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lǐ Zhēn said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the "Guǎng Yùn," twenty-second "yuán" rhyme:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"樠" (mán)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:43:10.778+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Duàn Zhù says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the heartwood of the pine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and is also the name of a tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The "Shuōwén" says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"樠" (mán)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the heartwood of the pine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Duàn Zhù (段注) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is suspected that there is an omission or error.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It should be "pine heartwood,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and it is also said to be the name of a tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:43:45.499+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Duàn's annotation says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What Lù relied on was the ancient version of the "Shuōwén."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:43:45.499+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Suspect there is missing text or error,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:41:22.467+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">According to pine heartwood has fat,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:43:45.499+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">should be "pine heartwood,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:43:45.499+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">alternatively, it is the name of a tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:43:45.499+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What Lù relies on is the ancient version of *Shuōwén*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-454a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:43:45.499+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pine heartwood has resin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:44:44.782+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Large branches are broken,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:44:44.782+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and small branches are snapped.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:44:44.782+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is because their ability makes their lives bitter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:44:44.782+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and so they do not live out their natural lifespan but die halfway,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:44:44.782+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">because they bring destruction upon themselves in the eyes of the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:44:44.782+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Everything is like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Big branches break,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">small branches are lopped off.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is because they are able to make their lives bitter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore they do not complete their natural lifespan and die prematurely,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">self-inflicted by the attacks of the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Things are all like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【三】Moreover, I have been seeking uselessness for a long time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">almost to the point of death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and only now have I obtained it【四】,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">making it greatly useful to me【五】.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If I were useful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could I have attained this greatness【六】?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Furthermore, both I and this thing are things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can they distinguish between things【七】?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And how could a wandering person, nearing death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-457a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">know about useless trees【八】!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-458a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一】【Note】All usable wood is called patterned wood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】È hū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "where?" or "in what way?".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:26.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Will you consider me as an un-timbered, useless tree?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Ruò,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "you".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:26.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Or will you compare me to a useful and patterned tree?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:26.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Textual Explanation】 *Jiàn mèng* (見夢), read as Hú jiàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:26.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Nǚ jiāng* (女將), pronounced as Rǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "I".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:26.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*È hū* (惡乎), pronounced as Wū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Usable wood is called patterned wood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Should I be treated as useless, scattered wood?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:26.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Or should I be compared to trees with wood suitable for useful structures?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jiàng Shí returned to sleep,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Annotation] "Jiàn Mèng" is pronounced hú jiàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the lì (栎) tree of the local shrine felt affected by a dream,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">asking Jiàng Shí:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Nǚ Jiāng" is pronounced rǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"È hū" is pronounced wū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"With what will you compare me?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same applies below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Should you treat me as useless, scattered timber?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-459a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Or should you compare me to wood useful for making writing materials?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-461a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Two] [Commentary] What is on a tree is called a fruit (guǒ),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-461a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">such as crabapples (zhā) and pears (lí);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】 "Jiàn Mèng" (見夢), pronunciation: hú jiàn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Nǚ Jiāng" (女將), pronunciation: yīn rǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-461a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what is on the ground is called a melon (luǒ),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Èhū" (惡乎), pronunciation: yīn wū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-461a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">like gourds (guā) and pumpkins (hù).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-460a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:45:12.418+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same applies below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-461a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Are you comparing me to such things?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-462a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Annotation] "Zhā" is pronounced cè jiā fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-462a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jú" is pronounced jūn bì fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-462a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Yòu" is pronounced yóu jiù fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-462a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú is pronounced yǐ jiù fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-462a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Guǒ luǒ" Xú is pronounced lì guǒ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-463a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Three] [Note] Things are all harmed by their usefulness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Fruits and melons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">their taste is edible,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and when the seeds and fruits are ripe,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they are subjected to peeling and falling off,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then large branches are broken and damaged,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:48:54.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to live out one's natural lifespan;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and small branches are released.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:48:54.606+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be struck midway</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is this not because their flavor is delicious</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">that they use it to embitter their lives!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Words of destruction and disgrace,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are just what they mean.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, to be born in spring and fall in autumn</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and thus reach their natural lifespan;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">those who are struck down midway</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is called premature death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But those with knowledge and without feelings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">worldly people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:46:52.942+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">all use usefulness to harm and prematurely end their lives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:50:53.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is to fulfill one's natural lifespan;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:50:53.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be struck down midway</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:50:53.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is called premature death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:50:53.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And knowledgeable but unfeeling,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:50:53.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the common people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:50:53.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">all use usefulness to harm and prematurely end their lives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and thus complete their natural lifespan;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be struck down midway</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is called premature death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But those who are knowledgeable and devoid of emotion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the worldly figures,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">all suffer premature death because of their usefulness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, concluding with these words is indeed fitting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Póu*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to strike.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They then exhaust their natural lifespan;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory Notes】 "Xiè" is pronounced with the reverse tone by Xú Sīliè.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but those who are struck down midway</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are called untimely deaths.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xiè*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who have knowledge but lack sentiment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the same as 洩.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">all consider being useful leads to a shortened life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Yú Yuè said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, this conclusion is perhaps not wrong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The meaning of the character *xiè*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Póu</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is not applicable here.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-464a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to strike.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is probably incorrect.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】《Xiè》 Xu thinks the pronunciation is liè.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Xiè* should be read as *yè*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Xúnzǐ* "Against Physiognomy" chapter, "If one is receiving people, then one should use *yè*",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:53:07.443+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It also says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiè</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the same as Xiè.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yáng comments:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Yè*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Yú Yuè says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to pull and lead.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The meaning of the character Xiè</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Small branches *yè*,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is not applicable here,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so it is probably wrong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to be seen being pulled and led.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Book of Odes*, "Seventh Month" poem,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiè should be read as yè.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the Xúnzǐ's "Against Physiognomy" chapter, "When receiving people, one uses Yè,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Take up the axes and hatchets,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to fell the trees that spread afar,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yáng's commentary:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yè</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is what is meant by the big branches breaking.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is also said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to pull and guide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Cling to that young mulberry tree,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Small branches Yè"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:54:36.265+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Also, it says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means seeing something being pulled and guided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is what is meant by the small branches being pulled.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:54:36.265+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Leaning on those young mulberry trees,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the "Seventh Month" poem in the Book of Odes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhèng's commentary says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:54:36.265+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is what is meant by "small branches Yè."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Take up that axe and hatchet</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Nǚ sāng*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:54:36.265+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhèng's commentary says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:54:36.265+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Nǚ sāng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:17.594+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are young branches.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to cut down those far-reaching branches,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is what is meant by "large branches break."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:54:36.265+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means young branches.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is also said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Ah! her young mulberry,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which refers to what is said here as small branches being pulled along.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhèng’s commentary says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Young mulberry,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-465a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-30T23:51:52.165+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Young branches."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-469a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:08:22.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its coming has been long.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-469a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:08:22.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But mediocre and clumsy artisans,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-469a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:08:22.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">suspect it is fine timber,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-469a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:08:22.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">frequently go back and look around,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-469a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:08:22.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">wanting to see it executed and trimmed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-469a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:08:22.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">fearing premature death by axe and adze,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:09:22.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Flaunting talent and ability in the mundane world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:09:22.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore nearing premature death;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:09:22.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I, because of my roughness and uselessness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:09:22.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore gain complete life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:09:22.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">You are a scattered person nearing death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:09:22.903+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can you know that I am useless wood?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To flaunt talent and ability in worldly customs</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">leads to premature death;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I, with my uncultivated and useless nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">can thus preserve my life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">You are a person of no use nearing death;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can you know that I am a useless tree?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">I entrusted myself to a dream</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-474a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to jest at Jiàng Shí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-475a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】The phrase "approaching death"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-475a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the same as before.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-475a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One reading connects "person of no use" as a phrase,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-475a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">as does Cuī.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-476a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Notes】(One) The character "jiǔ" is changed according to the Shìdétáng edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-477a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jiàng Shí awoke and divined his dream [one].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-477a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The disciple said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-477a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Since it takes what is useless,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-477a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then why is it a shrine [two]?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-478a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【One】 【Commentary】 Zhěn means to divine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-478a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zhàn yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-478a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jiàng Shí, having awoken,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-478a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pondered his sleep,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-478a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">divined his dream,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-478a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and explained it to his disciple.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】《Jué》 is pronounced gǔ xiào fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Ér zhěn》 is pronounced Xú zhí xìn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ Xiàng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhěn means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to divine dreams.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Wáng Niànsūn said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiàng Xiù and Sīmǎ Biāo both said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhěn means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:12:19.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Wáng Niànsūn said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:12:19.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Both Xiàng Xiù and Sīmǎ Biāo said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to divine dreams.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:12:19.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zhěn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But the following text is all about Jiàng Shí discussing the oak shrine with his disciple,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:12:19.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means dream divination.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:10:04.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there is nothing about divining dreams.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:12:19.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">However, the following text all concerns Jiàng Shí discussing the affairs of the oak shrine with his disciple,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-479a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:12:19.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without any mention of dream divination.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:14:37.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【二】If it didn't become a shrine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:14:37.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how close would it be to being cut down [三]!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:14:37.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Furthermore, that which it protects is different from the crowd [四],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:14:37.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and to analogize it based on righteousness (reputation) [喻] (yù) [一],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:14:37.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">isn't that far off [五]!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-483a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:14:37.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【一】【Commentary】The shrine is just lodging there,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【2】"If it were not for its being a shrine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">would it not almost be cut down</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">! 【3】Moreover, its preservation is different from that of others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">yet you try to explain it using righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-482a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is that not far from the truth</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-483a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【1】[Commentary] The shrine came to lodge here of its own accord;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-483a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it's not that this tree sought to be a shrine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-484a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】"Ruò"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-484a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "you."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-484a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Bǐ"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-484a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the shrine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-484a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">You should be cautious and discreet,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:16:00.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú pronounces it gòu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-484a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and not speak lightly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:16:00.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Lì": as in the text.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:16:00.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-484a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">That spirit of the shrine</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:16:00.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Gòu" means "to disgrace."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-484a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">came to lodge here of its own accord;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-484a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it has nothing to do with this tree (lì) being a shrine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:16:00.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Lì" means...</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-485a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【2】[Commentary] This tree considers being a shrine as being disgraced and troubled by someone who doesn't understand it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-485a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could it consider it an honor!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-486a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 Gòu means "to disgrace."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-486a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Think of this shrine spirit as not understanding me, using uselessness as usefulness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-486a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">valuing survival,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-486a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and yet intruding to lodge here,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-486a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">deeply seeing it as disgrace and trouble,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-486a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">turning it into shame;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-486a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could it consider it an honor!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】"Gòu":</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ says: pronounced hūdòu fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú Yīn Gòu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú Yīn Gòu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Lì" is pronounced as the character itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Lì" is pronounced as written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Gòu"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to be insulted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Gòu" means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Lì"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"disgrace."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:15:13.197+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Lì" means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-487a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means illness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-488a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【三】【Note】(Tree) [Original] (Two) Regarding uselessness as useful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-488a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then even if it is not made into a shrine tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-488a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it will ultimately not be close to the harm of pruning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-489a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】Originally, because it was sparse and without useful wood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-489a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it was able to preserve its life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:18:41.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Bù jìn" means the jìn of "fùjìn".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-489a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If it were not made into a shrine tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:18:41.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same applies below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-489a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could it be close to the harm of pruning?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-491a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:18:41.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【四】【Note】It takes no protection as protection,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】"Qiě Jī" pronounced jī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Bù Jìn" (Not Near) refers to being near to the nearby.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-491a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:18:41.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">while the multitude takes having protection as protection.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">or pronounced qí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The following is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:18:41.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】The sparse tree</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Jiǎn hū" ziǎn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-491a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Four] [Commentary:] It takes having nothing to rely on as its reliance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:18:41.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">preserves its life by being useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī's version is "qián yú."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-491a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">while the multitude takes having something to rely on as its reliance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Elucidation:] A sparsely branched tree</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎Qìng Fān notes that "hū"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in Cuī's version is "yú,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">preserves its life by being useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those with patterned wood</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and "yú" is the same as "hū."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the Lúnyǔ, "Wèi Zhèng" chapter, the book says "Xiào hū wéi xiào"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are broken and stunted because of their talent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Huáng Kǎn's version and the Hàn stone classics all write "yú."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is why they are different.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the Lǚshì Chūnqiū, "Shěn Yìng" chapter, "Ránzé xiānwáng shèng yú,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-493a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Five] [Commentary:] Benefiting people, promoting growth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Gāo notes:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-493a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and preventing people from doing wrong is the meaning of the earth god (shè 社).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:20:44.792+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Bù Jìn》: Nearness is the nearness of vicinity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-493a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the meaning of the altar.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Yú,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-493a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, the useless one</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:20:44.792+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same applies below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "hū."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These are all examples.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-493a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is placidly inactive, yet the crowd of talents put themselves to use.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-491a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:20:44.792+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Four] [Commentary]: They take having no protection as protection,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Bù Jìn》: Nearness in proximity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-493a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who put themselves to use each obtain their place in order and are not involved,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-491a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:20:44.792+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">while the masses take having protection as protection.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:20:44.792+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary]: A sparse tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-490a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same applies below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-493a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is why being useless is the way to preserve life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-493a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">You praise it with the reputation of the earth god,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:20:44.792+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">uses its uselessness to preserve its life;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-491a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Four] [Commentary]: They take not having protection as protection,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:21:53.867+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-493a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could it be considered near!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-491a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">while the masses take having protection as protection.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-494a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Elucidation:] Now, the useless tree lacks timber.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:21:53.867+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the current book, *yù* (譽) is written as *yù* (喻).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Elucidation]: Scattered, sparse trees</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-494a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is endowed by the Creator,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-492a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:17:29.09+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">preserve their lives by being useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:21:53.867+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Cháng Wù》 (*zhǎng wù*) has the fanqie pronunciation *dīng liǎng fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:21:53.867+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Bó Rán》 (*pō rán*) has the fanqie pronunciation *bù gè fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-494a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and relies on its uselessness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-494a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so it preserves its life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:22:39.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:21:53.867+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Bù Yǔ》The pronunciation of *yǔ* (與) is *yú*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-496a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:21:53.867+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Corrections:] (1) The character *yù* (喻) is changed according to the Shìdétáng edition and Lú's collation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-494a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yet the earth god, to whom things are entrusted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:22:39.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the current edition, 譽 (yù) "praise" is written as 喻 (yù) "metaphor."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-494a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">becomes a cause for abuse and suffering.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:22:39.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《長物》(Chángwù) is pronounced dīng liǎng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:22:39.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《泊然》(Bórán) is pronounced bù gè fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-494a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Praising it with the meaning of the earth god</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:22:39.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《不與》(Bù yǔ) is pronounced yú.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-494a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">misses the mark even further.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-496a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:22:39.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Corrections】(1) The character 喻 (yù) has been changed to 譽 (yù) according to the Shìdétáng edition and Lú's collation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text:] 《Yì Yù》The pronunciation of *yù* (譽) is *yú*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The commentary is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the current book, "譽" (yù) is written as "喻" (yù).<seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:22:39.758+09:00">《長物》 (Cháng Wù) is pronounced dīng liǎng fǎn.</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In today's edition of the book, "誉" (yù) is written as "喻" (yù).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:23:43.654+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《長物》 (Cháng Wù) is pronounced dīng liǎng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:23:43.654+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《長物》 (Cháng Wù) is pronounced dīng liǎng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《泊然》 (Bó Rán) is pronounced bù gè fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《泊然》 (Bó Rán) is pronounced bù gè fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《不與》 (Bù Yǔ) is pronounced yú.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-495a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《不與》 (Bù Yǔ) is pronounced yú.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-496a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:19:01.798+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Corrections】(1) The character "喻" (yù) is changed to "譽" (yù) according to the Shì Dé Táng edition and Lú's collation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-499a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:25:04.342+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">worthy of being an elder to things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-499a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:25:04.342+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-499a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:25:04.342+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he is called 伯 (bó), that is, Nánguō Zǐqí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-499a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:25:04.342+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shāng Hill</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-499a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:25:04.342+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a place name.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-499a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:25:04.342+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:14.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it means being hurt by the heat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:14.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Jiāng bì* (將芘): This book also writes it as bì (庇).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:14.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú (徐) reads fǔ zhì fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:14.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also bēi wèi fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:14.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔)'s version writes it as bǐ (比),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:14.729+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is harmed by heat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The "Jiāng Bì" (將芘) in the original text is also written as "Bì" (庇).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú Fǔzhì (徐甫至) read it as fǎn (反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Also read as bēi wèi (悲位) fǎn (反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) 's version has it as "bǐ" (比),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is a "bì" (芘).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Suǒ Lài" (所藾) is pronounced lài (賴).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) 's version has it as "lài" (賴).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiàng (向) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It provides shade,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">capable of shading a thousand chariots.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ Tóng (李同).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-500a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Suǒ Yīn" (所陰) is pronounced yú zhèn (於鴆) fǎn (反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-501a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Two] [Commentary] Zǐ Qí (子綦), having seen this tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-501a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">did not recognize its name,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-501a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and suspected it had extraordinary abilities,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-501a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">hence its immense size.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Three] [Commentary] "Zhóu jiě" (軸解) refers to the turning of a cart axle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">like the turning of a cart axle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">referring to the wood that turns at the center.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using the whole body as a coffin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"guān" (棺),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Surrounding the coffin with an outer coffin is called "guǒ" (槨).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Beams and pillars must be straight,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being bent and curved makes them unsuitable;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:28:53.38+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being loose and scattered makes them insecure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">coffins and outer coffins rely on being sturdy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-502a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Dispersal is the reason for its lack of solidity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:28:53.38+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of Text] "Yì cái fū" (異材夫) is pronounced fú (符).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation] "Yì Cái Fū" (異材夫), pronounced fú.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:28:53.38+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Yǎng ér" (仰而): Xiàng (向) and Cuī (崔)'s version has "cóng ér" (從而).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Yǎng Ér" (仰而), Xiàng Cuī's (向崔) version makes it "cóng ér" (從而).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:28:53.38+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zé quán" (則拳): the original text also has "juǎn" (卷),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zé Quán" (則拳), some versions also make it "juǎn" (卷),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:28:53.38+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pronounced quán (權).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:28:53.38+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zhóu" (軸) is pronounced zhí zhú (直竹) fǎn (反).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pronounced quán.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-503a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:26:47.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zhóu" (軸), pronounced zhí zhú fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zǐ Qí (子綦) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zǐ Qí said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:30.229+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"This is truly an unusable tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:30.229+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"This is truly an unusable tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and has grown so large because of this</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and has grown so large because of this</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Alas, spirit-like man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Alas, spirit-like man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">uses this un-usability</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">uses this un-usability</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-508a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:30.229+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-508a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:30.229+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-508a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, it can avoid being felled by axes and provide shade for thousands of chariots.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so the officials attend to their affairs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:31:26.149+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zǐqí said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The wise ones see for him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:31:26.149+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"This is indeed a useless tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:31:26.149+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and it has grown to such a great size as this [一].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the perceptive ones listen for him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the knowledgeable ones advise him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:31:26.149+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Ah, divine person,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the brave ones defend him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-507a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:31:26.149+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">using this uselessness [二]!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-508a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:31:26.149+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What does he do?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He remains silent and reclusive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And when all talents do not lose their proper place,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then uselessness is what talent relies on.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the world gladly supports him without tiring,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-509a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">riding on the myriad things without harming them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] The ultimate person is divine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the Yin and Yang cannot fathom him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">He mingles among people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">harmonizing his light so that it does not shine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, he can deeply root and firmly establish himself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">live long and see far,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">boats and all sorts of things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">providing shade for the black-haired people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Like that oak tree of the shrine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and this extraordinary tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, he sighs in admiration of the divine person's use,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:30:29.383+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">of uselessness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:41:38.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">boats and ships, and all kinds of things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:41:38.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">sheltering the black-haired people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:41:38.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Like that oak tree in the shrine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:41:38.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">compared to this extraordinary tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:41:38.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, I sigh in admiration of the divine person's use;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-510a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:41:38.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being useless,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:43:34.453+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the state of Sòng, there was a place called Jīng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:43:34.453+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">suitable for these three trees: catalpa, cypress, and mulberry.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:43:34.453+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">All of them are straight and upright,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:43:34.453+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">suitable for use as timber.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:43:34.453+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This briefly mentions how patterned wood with talent is cut short,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:43:34.453+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in contrast to how useless wood is able to preserve its life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the state of Sòng (宋), there was the territory of Jīng Shì (荊氏).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It was suitable for these three types of trees: qiū (楸, catalpa), bǎi (柏, cypress), and sāng (桑, mulberry).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They were all straight and upright,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and suitable for use as timber.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This briefly mentions that patterned wood possessing useful qualities is therefore prone to premature death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-514a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is in contrast to the uselessness of the previously discussed scattered wood, which is why it is able to live out its full life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Annotations】Regarding "Jīng Shì (荊氏)," Sīmǎ (司馬) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is a place name.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Another interpretation says it is a village name.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Regarding "suitable for qiū (楸), bǎi (柏), and sāng (桑)," Cuī (崔) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The territory of Jīng Shì (荊氏)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is suitable for these three types of trees.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These three types of trees</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are patterned wood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo (盧文弨) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-515a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the current edition of this book, "qiū (秋)" is written as "qiū (楸)".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Two】【Commentary】Two hands' span is called "gǒng (拱),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one hand's grasp is called "bǎ (把)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jū hóu (狙猴)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:45:48.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Annotations】"Gǒng (拱)" is pronounced gōng yǒng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means xiǎn hóu (獮猴, macaque).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:45:48.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Bǎ (把)" is pronounced bǎi yǎ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yì (杙)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means jué (橛, stake),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:45:48.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú (徐) pronounces it fǔ yǎ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:45:48.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ (司馬) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and also gān (杆, pole).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:45:48.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Two hands' span is called "gǒng (拱),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Wood of a "gǒng (拱)" or "bǎ (把)" in circumference</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is not of great size in terms of timber.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:46:37.177+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory Notes】《gǒng》: gōng, yǒng, fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is suitable to be chopped into poles and stakes</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:46:37.177+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《bǎ》: bǎi, yǎ, fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-516a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to strike and fend off macaques.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:46:37.177+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú: fǔ, yǎ, fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:46:37.177+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory Notes】 《Gǒng》 pronounced gōng yǒng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Bǎ》 pronounced bǎi yǎ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:46:37.177+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Using both hands is called gǒng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:46:37.177+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one hand's grasp is called "bǎ (把)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú pronounced fǔ yǎ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Using both hands is called gǒng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-517a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:44:07.774+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">using one hand is called bǎ."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-518a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:48:33.733+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">readily take it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-519a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:48:33.733+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanatory Notes】 《Sān wéi》 Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-519a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:48:33.733+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"A circumference of eight chi is one wéi."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-519a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:48:33.733+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Zhī lì》 as written,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-519a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:48:33.733+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also pronounced lǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-519a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:48:33.733+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-521a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:49:57.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The old version of *shàn* uses the "altar" radical,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-521a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:49:57.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is wrong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-521a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:49:57.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The commentary is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-521a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:49:57.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now corrected.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-521a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:49:57.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Bàng*" is pronounced *báo gāng fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-521a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:49:57.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-525a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d" modified="2025-08-31T00:50:59.226+09:00">They must be carefully selected and of pure color,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-525a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:50:58.577+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">One must select offerings that are refined and of pure color,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-525a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:50:58.577+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">choosing the best ones,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-525a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:50:58.577+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">choosing the best ones,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-525a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:50:59.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">demonstrating sincerity and reverence as if they were present,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-525a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:50:59.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in the hope of spiritually moving the gods.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-525a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:50:59.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But now there are pigs with high noses and broken foreheads,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-525a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:50:59.226+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and calves with white foreheads that are not red.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-526a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:52:04.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">: Hidden wound.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-526a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:52:04.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo says</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-526a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:52:04.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">: Previously, the word "yún" was missing</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-526a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:52:04.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">, now added.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-526a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:52:04.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Shì Hé》: Sīmǎ says</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-526a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:52:04.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">: Refers to drowning people in the river as a sacrifice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:53:38.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">However, divine and sage-like people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:53:38.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">knowing as well as the Creator,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:53:38.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">know that those without talent are useless,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:53:38.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and therefore they are able to preserve their lives entirely.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:53:38.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus, the sayings about white foreheads and upturned noses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:53:38.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the talk of hemorrhoids being inauspicious,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">However, the sagely man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">whose wisdom matches that of Creation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">knows that useless wood is without use,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and thus is able to preserve his life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus we know that the words about a white forehead and upturned nose,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the talk of hemorrhoids as inauspicious,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are precisely the petty sentiments of a minor sorcerer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could they be called the suitable wisdom of a great man!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, incomplete talent</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-530a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is what divine men consider to be auspicious and greatly virtuous.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【校】(Note 1) The characters "zhī" and "yǐ" in "zhī yǐ" are interchanged according to the Shìdétáng edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Note 2) "Yì" (杙) is pronounced the same as "qiě yáng".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is suspected that the characters "zuò qiāng" (作戕) are missing after Guō (郭).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Guǎngyùn*, under the entry for "qiāng" in the eleventh "táng" rhyme, says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also written "Zāngkē,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is pronounced "zé láng qiē".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Hàn Shū Geography*, commentary on Zāngkē Commandery, says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zāngqiāng"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to mooring stakes for boats.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus Guō's version "qiāng" is the "qiāng" of "Qiāngkē,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is similar in shape and meaning to "yì" but different in pronunciation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Its pronunciation is "qiě yáng fǎn,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-531a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so it is clear that it is "qiāng" and not "yì".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhīlí Shū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his chin was hidden by his navel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his shoulders higher than his head</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:56:16.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his five viscera were on top,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">his neck gathered pointing to the sky,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:56:16.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and his two thighs were ribs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The five tubes are on top,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:56:16.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">By patching needles and mending clothes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the two thighs are for gathering.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:56:16.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he was able to provide for himself</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Leveling a needle and treating wounds</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:56:16.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">By managing the winnowing basket and broadcasting seeds</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is enough to support his mouth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:56:16.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he was able to feed ten people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Operating the counting sticks and scattering the essence</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-532a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:54:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is enough to feed ten people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-534a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:57:42.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Originally written as *xiàng*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-534a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:57:42.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it's also as written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-534a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:57:42.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-534a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:57:42.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means the spine is curved and the neck is shortened.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-534a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:57:42.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Huáinánzǐ says the spinal column is higher than the head.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-535a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:57:42.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary 2] "Gathering,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:58:37.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the hairstyle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:58:37.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In ancient times, the hairstyle was in the middle of the neck,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:58:37.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with the spine bent and the head low,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:58:37.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore the hairstyle pointed to the sky.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:58:37.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiàng (向) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:58:37.511+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Both shoulders are raised upwards,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Hairdressing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In ancient times, the bun was at the back of the neck.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The spine was curved and the head was lowered.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the bun pointed to the sky.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xiàng (向) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The two shoulders are shrugged upwards.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is a *huì cuō rán* (會撮然).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lǐ Zhēn (李楨) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Huì cuō* (會撮)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the *xiàng zhuī* (項椎), the cervical vertebra.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is correct.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:11.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in the forty-fifth difficulty of the *Nán Jīng* (難經),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(From the "Dà Zōng Shī" 大宗師 chapter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:11.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"The bone meeting point is *Dà Zhù* (大杼),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:11.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhāng's (張) commentary:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the phrase "*jù zhuì zhǐ tiān*" 句贅指天</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:11.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Dà Zhù* (大杼)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Jù zhuì* (句贅)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:11.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the name of an acupuncture point,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:11.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">located on the first vertebra behind the neck."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Nán Jīng* (Classic of Difficulties), Difficulty 45:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the *xiàng zhuī* (項椎), the cervical vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The bone meeting point is Dàzhù (大杼).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">its shape is like a protuberance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhāng's commentary:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This proves Cuī's (崔) explanation is correct.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Sù Wèn Cì Rè Piān* (素問刺熱篇),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Nán Jīng* Forty-fifth Difficulty:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Dàzhù (大杼),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The bone meeting point is Dàzhù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"The depression in the middle of the three cervical vertebrae on the back of the neck."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the name of an acupuncture point,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhāng's commentary:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Wáng's (王) commentary:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">located behind the neck at the first vertebra.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Dàzhù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"This enumerates the important methods concerning the spinal vertebrae."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The various bones on both sides</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">from here support and branch downwards.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shěn Shì Tóng (沈氏彤) in his *Shì Gǔ* (釋骨)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the name of an acupuncture point,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the bones meet at Dàzhù (大杼).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">states, "From the *xiàng dà zhuī* (項大椎) downwards, there are twenty-one vertebrae,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">located behind the neck at the first vertebra.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">According to this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">collectively called *jǐ gǔ* (脊骨), the spine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The various bones on both sides</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">we know that the meaning of "meeting and gathering" is taken from the meeting of bones,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">support and branch downwards from here.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">also called *jǐ zhuī* (脊椎), the vertebrae."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī (崔) knew that *huì cuō* (會撮) referred to this because</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and it is also between the great vertebrae,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, bones meet at Dàzhù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Based on this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is called the neck vertebra.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Difficulty 45 of the *Classic of Difficulties*:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Gathering" (撮),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">we know that "meeting and gathering" (會撮 *huìcuō*) is named based on the meaning of "bone meeting point" (骨會 *gǔhuì*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The bones meet at Dàzhù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhāng's commentary:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">in the Tang Dynasty *Chú Xué Jì* (初學記, Records of Elementary Learning) Volume 19, Xú Jiān (徐堅) quotes it as .</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Furthermore, it is located between the great vertebrae (大椎 *Dàzhuī*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Yù Piān* (玉篇, Jade Chapters) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Dàzhù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character 撮 (*cuō*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the name of an acupuncture point,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T00:59:19.601+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">located behind the neck at the first vertebra.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is written as  in the nineteenth chapter of Táng Xú Jiān's *Chūxué Jì*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a knot in wood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Yùpiān*:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is very similar to the joints of the spine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using the wood radical to make  is</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a wooden  joint,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">more appropriate in meaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">According to the "belonging to the exterior" theory, the jaw and shoulders</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is very similar to the spinal joint.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the "meeting and gathering of the five tubes" belong to the interior theory.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using the wood radical to form  [instead of 撮],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is more meaningful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When the jaw is hidden,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:04:50.767+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(*Líng Shū* (Spiritual Pivot), *Bèi Shū Piān* (Back-Shu Points Chapter):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:04:50.767+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The lung *shū* point is between the third vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Considering "jaw and shoulder" from an external perspective,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the shoulders are high.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When the neck vertebra points to the sky,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:04:50.767+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the heart *shū* point is between the fifth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and "meeting and gathering of the five tubes" from an internal perspective.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:04:50.767+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the liver *shū* point is between the ninth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When the jaw is hidden,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the storage points are above.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the shoulder is high.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:00:46.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These are all caused by each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:04:50.767+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the spleen *shū* point is between the eleventh vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:04:50.767+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the kidney *shū* point is between the fourteenth vertebra.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When the neck vertebra points to the sky,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Língshū Bèi Shū Piān:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Língshū Bèi Shū Piān:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *fèi shū* is located between the third vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the hidden *shū* points are located above.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *fèi shū* is located between the third vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These are all caused by the interaction of these factors.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the *xīn shū* is located between the fifth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the *xīn shū* is located between the fifth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Líng Shū - Bèi Shū Piān:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the *gān shū* is located between the ninth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the *gān shū* is located between the ninth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Fèi Shū is located between the third vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the *pí shū* is located between the eleventh vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the *pí shū* is located between the eleventh vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the *shèn shū* is located between the fourteenth vertebra.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the *shèn shū* is located between the fourteenth vertebra.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xīn Shū is located between the fifth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">) Sīmǎ Xùn's *jì*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Gān Shū is located between the ninth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is another meaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pí Shū is located between the eleventh vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:01:12.536+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shèn Shū is located between the fourteenth vertebra.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Shī Jīng*, Minor Odes of the Kingdom, "platform hat with a black gathering",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the commentary says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Black gathering",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(*Língshū*, "Back Transport Points" chapter:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The lung transport point is between the third vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a black cloth hat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The Zheng Yi says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the heart transport point is between the fifth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the liver transport point is between the ninth vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Saying "gathering"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means it's a small gathering holding the *jì* in place.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the spleen transport point is between the eleventh vertebra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the kidney transport point is between the fourteenth vertebra.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Based on this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">) Sīmǎ's hairstyle of gathering the hair into a bun,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">using *huì cuō* as a *jì*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it should also be a small gathering holding the hair in place,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">represents a different meaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">hence the name.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the "Tái Lì Zī Cuō" section of the "Xiǎo Yǎ" in the Book of Poetry,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the commentary states:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.86" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Huì* and [●] are interchangeable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:08:47.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Also, in the *Shì Sàng Lǐ*, the *tuó biàn* uses mulberry,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zī Cuō"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.87" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shuōwén:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:08:47.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the commentary says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.88" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[●],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:08:47.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Considering the *jì* as a *tuó*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to a crown made of black cloth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">a bone hairpin that can gather the hair.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:08:47.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">taking the meaning of hair being gathered together.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">又, in the 士 (shì) class funeral rites, the *tiáo biàn* (髫弁) cap is made of mulberry.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhèng Yì explains:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The term "cuō"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:08:47.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Huì* and *tuó* are also interchangeable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shū (疏) explains:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.90" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the Book of Songs, State of Wei, "The gathered *biàn* like stars,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.91" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xǔ (Shèn) quotes it as [●].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"The *jì* (髻, hair knot) is called *tiáo* (髫),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means simply gathering and holding the bun in a small bunch.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:08:47.625+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Jíyùn* has the character [●],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Based on this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Taking it to mean the gathering and joining of hair.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.92" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the Zhou Li, "Gathered five-colored jade flags",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Huì* (會) and *tiáo* (髫) are interchangeable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">considering that "huì cuō" refers to a bun,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.93" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the commentary:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it likely means a small gathering and holding of the hair,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Jíyùn* (集韻) dictionary has the character ●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.94" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The old text uses [●] instead of *huì*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pronounced *cuō* (撮),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Shì Sānglǐ* (士喪禮, Ritual of the Funeral of a Gentleman), the *kuàobiàn* headdress is made of mulberry wood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">hence the name.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Meaning a hair knot.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.86" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Huì" is interchangeable with "●".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shū (疏, commentary) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.87" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Shuō Wén says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is likely that people popularly created this specialized character for head hair knot from *huì cuō* (會撮).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"The *jì* (髻, hair bun) is called *kuài* (鬠)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìngfān (慶藩) notes that the *Shìwén* (釋文) quotes Cuī (崔) as saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"It is named so to capture the meaning of gathering hair together."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.88" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"●"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Huì* (會) is interchangeable with *kuài* (鬠).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to a bone hairpin used to gather the hair.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"'*Huì cuō* (會撮)'"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:05:49.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Jíyùn* (集韻, Rhyme Dictionary) has the character ●.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Furthermore, in the "Shì Sàng Lǐ", the "tuó biàn" is made of mulberry,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.106" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Is the *xiàng zhuī* (項椎, nape)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.90" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the "Wèi Fēng", it says "Huì biàn rú xīng",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.91" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xǔ Shèn quotes it as "●".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.107" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character should be written as ●.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the commentary explains:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Tuó" refers to the bun,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.92" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the "Zhōu Lǐ", it says "Huì wǔ cǎi yù qí",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.108" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Yùpiān* (玉篇) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.109" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"●,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">signifying the gathering and assembling of the hair.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.93" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the annotation says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.110" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Is a wooden mallet,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.94" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the old texts, "huì" is written as "●".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Huì" is also interchangeable with "tuó".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.111" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Pronounced *cú huó qiè* (徂活切)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, in the mourning rites for a shì (士), the tuó biàn (鬠弁) is made of mulberry wood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, in the mourning rites for a shì (士), the tuó biàn (鬠弁) is made of mulberry wood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jí Yùn includes the character "●".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The commentary states:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.112" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Cuō* (撮) and ● are similar in sound.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Its pronunciation is *cuō* (撮).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The commentary states:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means *jì* (髻, hair bun).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">"The jì (髻, hair bun) is called tuó (鬠),"<seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00">"Taking it to mean the gathering of hair."</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"The jì (髻, hair bun) is called tuó (鬠),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.113" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Shī Zǐ* (尸子) says, "To take risks using *cuō* (撮)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is likely that this popular usage created a specialized character for hair buns from *huì* (會) and *cuō* (撮).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.114" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Cuō* (撮),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Taking it to mean the gathering of hair."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Taking it to mean the gathering of hair."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.123" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:13:57.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *cuō* () mentioned in the *Shī Zǐ* (尸子),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Huì (會) and tuó (鬠) are interchangeable."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.115" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is a device for loading.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Huì (會) and tuó (鬠) are interchangeable."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìngfān (慶藩) notes that the *Shìwén* (釋文, Explanations of Characters) quotes Cuī (崔) saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.116" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Its pronunciation is the same as *zuàn* (鑽).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.124" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:13:57.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is the *cuán* (欑) in the ritual.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Jíyùn* dictionary has the character ●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:07:36.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Jíyùn* dictionary has the character ●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Huìcuō* (會撮),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.123" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:14:21.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What Shī Zǐ 尸子 calls </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.117" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Zhōu Lǐ Sāng Dàjì* (周禮喪大記) says, "The ruler's burial uses *shùn cuán* (楯欑)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.125" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:13:57.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Guǎn Zǐ* (管子) has Cuī (崔)'s version, written as *guǎn* (筦).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pronounced cuō (撮),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.106" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"means a wooden hammer (项椎)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.124" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:14:21.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is what the *Lǐ* 禮 (Rites) calls "zuǎn" 欑.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.118" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">With the note:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.126" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:13:57.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Zài Shàng* (在上), Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Meaning a hair bun (髻).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.119" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Chún* (輴),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.107" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"The character should be written as ●."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.125" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:14:21.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Guǎn Zǐ* 管子, Cuī 崔 makes it "guǎn" 筦.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.127" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:13:57.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Guǎn* (管),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.126" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:14:21.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ 李 in *Zài Shàng* 《在上》 (In Authority) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.108" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Yùpiān* (玉篇, Jade Chapters) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It seems that vulgar usage created a special character for head buns from "huì cuō (會撮)".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.120" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Is a vehicle for carrying the coffin."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.121" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Cuán* (欑),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìngfān's (慶藩) note: The commentary cites Cuī (崔) as saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:13:57.888+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Is *shū* (腧, acupuncture point)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.109" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"●,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.122" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Is similar to *zōu* (菆, coffin)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Huì cuō (會撮),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.110" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"is a wooden hammer."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.111" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Its pronunciation is *cúhuóqiè* (徂活切)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.106" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Means the nape of the neck,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.123" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What Shī Zǐ 尸子 called </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.124" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is what the *Lǐ* (禮) calls zuǎn 欑.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.112" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The sounds of *cuō* (撮) and ● are similar.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.107" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"The character should be ●."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.125" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Guǎn Zǐ* 管子, Cuī 崔 makes it guǎn 筦.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.113" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Shī Zi* (尸子) says, "Take risks with *cuō* (撮)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.108" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Yùpiān* dictionary states:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.114" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Cuō* (撮)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.109" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"●,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.126" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In *Zài Shàng* (在上), Lǐ 李 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.127" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Guǎn" 管</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.110" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Means a wooden mallet,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.115" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a vehicle or container for loading.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.111" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Pronounced cú huó qiē (徂活切)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:09:19.559+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means shū 腧 (acupoints).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.116" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Its pronunciation is the same as *zuān* (鑽).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.112" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Cuō (撮) and ● are similar in sound."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.117" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Zhōu Lǐ Sāng Dàjì* (周禮喪大記, Record of Great Funerals in the Rites of Zhou), the sovereign's coffin is carried on a *shùnduān* (楯欑).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.118" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The commentary says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.113" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Shī Zǐ* says, "Undertaking danger with a cuō (撮)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.114" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Cuō (撮),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.119" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Duān* (輴),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.120" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"is a cart for carrying the coffin."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.115" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Means a vehicle for carrying,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.121" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Zuàn* (欑),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.116" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Its pronunciation is the same as zuàn (鑽)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.117" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Zhōu Lǐ* *Sàng Dàjì* states that the ruler's burial uses a dùn cuán (楯欑),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.122" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"is like *zōu* (菆)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.123" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *cuō* () mentioned in the *Shī Zi* (尸子)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.118" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And the commentary says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.124" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the *zuàn* (欑) in the *Lǐ* (禮, Rites).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.119" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Chūn (輴),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.120" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Is a carriage for carrying the coffin,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.125" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Guǎn* (管, Guanzi), Cuī (崔)'s version makes it *guǎn* (筦).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.121" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Cuán (欑),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.126" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In *Zàishàng* (在上), Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.127" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"*Guǎn* (管),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.122" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Is like zōu (菆)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.123" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The "" mentioned in the *Shī Zǐ*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:11:48.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"is *shū* (腧, a point on the body where acupuncture needles are inserted)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.124" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is the cuán (欑) in the rites.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.125" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In the *Guǎn Zǐ*, Cuī (崔) makes it guǎn (筦).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.126" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In "Zài Shàng (在上)," Lǐ (李) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.127" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Guǎn (管),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-536a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T01:12:55.747+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Means shū (腧)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:13.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zhēn" 鍼, zhí jīn 反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:13.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ 司馬 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:13.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Cuò zhēn" 挫鍼</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:13.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means sewing clothes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:13.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Zhì jiě" 治繲, jiā mài 反.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:13.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ 司馬 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Zhēn》 zhí jīn fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Cuò zhēn"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means sewing clothes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Zhì xiè》 jiā mài fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means washing clothes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Same direction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī makes ●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pronunciation huàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Hú kǒu》 Xú pronounces hú.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lǐ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means eating.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character is sometimes written as 互 (hù),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-538a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">or as ●.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Four】【Commentary】 Qiè</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is a small winnowing basket.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Jīng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is rice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It says that he sweeps the market,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">beats the winnowing basket qiè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">scatters the earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and separates the fine from the coarse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Another explanation:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Beating the qiè"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to spreading yarrow stalks to divine trigrams.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Broadcasting jīng"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:41:58.088+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to accurately judging good and bad fortune, and distinguishing spiritual omens.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This refers to judging good fortune and misfortune and distinguishing the refined essence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:41:58.088+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Some sweep the market to provide for their families,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:41:58.088+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">others tell fortunes to sustain their lives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Some sweep the marketplace to provide for their families,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">others sell divination to make a living,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:41:58.088+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">What they earn can support ten people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:41:58.088+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】《Gǔ qiè》 chū gé fǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-539a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and what they earn can support ten people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】 《Gǔ Cè》 (鼓筴): "chū gé fǎn,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:41:58.088+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú also pronounces it jiá.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:39:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Xú (徐) also has the pronunciation "jiá."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:17.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the Jiāngdōng (江東) pronunciation is "qǔ."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:17.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(The textual explanation pronounces it "qǔ,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:17.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so the character should be written as "xǔ" (糈) (三).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:17.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character "jīng" (精) has no ancient pronunciation "qǔ,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:17.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and it is mistaken due to its similar shape to the character "xǔ" (糈).)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:17.272+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Shuō Wén* (說文) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, the Jiāngdōng pronunciation takes [the term].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(The gloss explains that the pronunciation takes [the term],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the character should be 糈 (xǔ).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character 精 (jīng) had no pronunciation of "qǔ" in ancient times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is mistaken because its form is similar to the character 糈.) Shuōwén</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">糈 (xǔ),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is grain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:44:27.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《竄匿》is pronounced nǚ lì fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-544a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:44:27.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-540a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Yǐ Shí" is pronounced sì.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:44:27.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] When the state has major corvée labor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-541a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:44:27.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is because they have chronic illnesses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-541a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore they do not hide themselves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:44:27.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore they do not receive the benefits of the work.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-542a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Subcommentary] When there are affairs with the border barbarians,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-542a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">brave men are conscripted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-546a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:44:27.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-542a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but those who are crippled and sick</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-542a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cannot withstand being sent on campaigns,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-542a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so they naturally have no fear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-542a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they roll up their sleeves and roam freely,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-542a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">relying on their uselessness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Escaping and Hiding" - "Nǚ" [female radical] and "lì" [strength radical] reversed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-544a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【6】【Commentary】It is because they cannot bear the corvée labor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-542a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore they do not hide themselves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] 《攘》is pronounced rú yáng fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sub-commentary】The state has major corvée labor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《臂於其閒》is pronounced as written.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">because there are chronic diseases,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so they are not subject to its work requirements.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">閒,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-546a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】【Commentary】If it is labor, then they do not participate;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-546a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if it is a gift, then they receive it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means inside.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Evading》, the force of female resistance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sub-commentary】Six *shí* and four *dǒu* is called a *zhōng*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-544a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Six】【Commentary】 It is because they are unable to bear the corvée labor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī's version reads "攘臂於其開,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 The state has important corvée labor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The ruler worries about and pities widowers and widows,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and cares for the poor and sick;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">開,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">because they have chronic illnesses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "within the door."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore they do not accept its tasks.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">their physical disabilities are already severe,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-543a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Hiding》, "nǚ" and "lì" are reversed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">so what they receive is even more.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-546a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Seven】【Commentary】 Corvée labor they do not participate in,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-546a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but gifts they receive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-544a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【6】【Commentary】It is because they are not capable of handling corvée labor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Guō’s commentary says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if it is labor, then they do not participate;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】When the state has major corvée labor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 Six *shí* four *dǒu* is called a *zhōng*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if it is a gift, then they receive it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is because someone has a chronic illness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The ruler is concerned about widowers and widows,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and has compassion for the poor and sick,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】《Three *Zhong*》Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-545a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore they are not subjected to its labor requirements.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">those whose physical disabilities are severe,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Six *hú* and four *dǒu* is called a *zhōng*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-546a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:43:55.758+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【7】【Commentary】They do not participate in labor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">receive even more goods.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎Lú Wénchāo says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The old version incorrectly has *hú* as *é*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Guo's commentary says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now corrected.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Corvée labor they do not participate in,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Bù yǔ》[Not Participating] is pronounced yù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-547a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but gifts they receive."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【8】【Commentary】A divine person has no use for objects,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】 《Three Zhōng》, Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Six *hú* four *dǒu* is called a *zhōng*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but objects each can be self-utilizing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They attribute merit and fame to the collective talents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The old version incorrectly says "six *é*,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">mingling with things and leaving no trace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now corrected.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, they avoid the harm of human leisure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">abiding in the reality of constant beauty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-548a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Bù Yǔ》 is pronounced yù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Eight】【Commentary】 A spiritual person has no use for things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is one whose virtue is disjointed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sub-commentary】To disjoint one's form is like forgetting one's form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but each thing obtains its own use,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to disjoint one's virtue is like forgetting one's virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">attributing merit and fame to the collective talents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">merging with things and leaving no trace,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, to disjoint one's crippled illness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is precisely forgetting one's form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore avoiding harm from human interference,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Ér kuàng zhīlí cánbìng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">dwelling in the reality of constant beauty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:45:35.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">shì shì wàng xíng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-549a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is one who has a fragmented virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 To have a fragmented form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like forgetting the form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to have a fragmented virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like forgetting virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, to have fragmented disabilities,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:46:26.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is precisely forgetting the form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:00.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】To have a "branch-detached" form</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:00.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like forgetting the form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:00.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to have a "branch-detached" virtue</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:00.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like forgetting virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:00.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Moreover, to have a "branch-detached" deformity</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:00.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is precisely forgetting the form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] To be "disfigured" in form</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is akin to forgetting form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be "disfigured" in virtue</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is akin to forgetting virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How much more so for someone with a crippled and diseased body,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">who merely happens to have forgotten form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Since he is not a sage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he therefore cannot have forgotten virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Those who forget virtue</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">possess wisdom encompassing all things yet revert to foolishness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">their brilliance rivals the three luminaries (sun, moon, stars) yet they return to obscurity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus, they achieve success without claiming credit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">act without reliance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">attribute merit and fame to all talents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and harmonize with all things without leaving a trace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is what it means to forget virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If forgetting form is sufficient to nourish the body and live out one's years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and avoid harm from the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how much more so for someone who forgets virtue!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Their superiority, inferiority, superficiality, and depth</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cannot be discussed in the same breath.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Thus, we know that one who is "disfigured" in virtue</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:06.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is said that the character should be written as "shù" (數).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:06.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Master Guō's explanation is especially mistaken.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-550a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is none other than a sage!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Corrections] (1) The Shìdétáng edition is missing the characters "ér yóu" (而遊).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:06.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(4) The character "shì" (恃) is emended based on the commentary and the Shìdétáng edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:06.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Kǒngzǐ was traveling to Chǔ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) The character "bò" (簸) is emended based on the Shìdétáng edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(3) According to the phonetic gloss, "jīng yīn qǔ" (精音取) is not mentioned;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:06.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the madman of Chǔ, Jiēyú, wandered outside his gate, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">what is referred to as "yī yīn suǒ" (一音所)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:06.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Phoenix, oh phoenix,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">refers to the character "bò" (播),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, it is said that the word should be taken as "number" (數 shù).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō's (郭 Guō) explanation is quite mistaken.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(4) The word "shì" (恃), relying on the commentary and the Shìdétáng (世德堂) edition, is emended.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it says the character should be written as "shù" 數.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Kǒngzǐ (孔子) went to Chǔ (楚).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō’s 郭 interpretation is a mistake.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(4) The character "shì" 恃 (to rely on) is changed based on the commentary and the Shìdétáng edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The madman of Chǔ (楚), Jiē Yú (接輿), wandered to his door and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:55:27.552+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Phoenix, oh phoenix,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Kǒngzǐ 孔子 went to Chǔ 楚.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The madman of Chǔ, Jiē Yú 接輿, wandered to his door and said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, it is said that the word should be taken as "number" (數 shù).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Oh phoenix! Oh phoenix!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guō (郭) said something quite wrong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how is it that virtue has declined so</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-551a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Four) The word "恃" (shì) is changed according to the commentary and the Shìdétáng (世德堂) edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The coming age is not to be awaited,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When Kǒngzǐ (孔子) went to Chǔ (楚),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the past age is not to be pursued</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the madman of Chǔ (楚), Jiē Yú (接輿), wandered by his gate, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When the world is governed by the Way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Oh phoenix, oh phoenix,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the sage achieves success;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">when the world is without the Way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The coming age is not worth waiting for,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the sage merely survives</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the past age is not worth chasing after!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In these times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one barely escapes punishment</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">When the world has the Way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the sage succeeds;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Blessings are lighter than a feather,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">yet no one knows how to carry them</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">when the world lacks the Way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:59:58.775+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">exhausting the suitability of harmonious understanding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the sage survives!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">calamities are heavier than the earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:59:58.775+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The rise and fall of the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">In these times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:59:58.775+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are so slight as to be imperceptible,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">yet no one knows how to avoid them</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:59:58.775+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is said, "How is it?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one can barely avoid punishment!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Enough, enough,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Blessings are lighter than feathers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">influencing people with virtue!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-554a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:59:58.775+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation] "How is it?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and no one knows to carry them;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Perilous, perilous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-554a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:59:58.775+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "how is it like?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">disasters are heavier than the earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">drawing a line on the ground and walking along it</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and no one knows to avoid them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Confused, confused,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Enough, enough,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not harm my steps</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to govern people with virtue!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">My steps are (1) turned aside and crooked,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Dangerous, dangerous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not harm my feet</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to draw a line on the ground and run along it!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is best to exhaustively understand what is appropriate for the situation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Confused, confused,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The flourishing and decline of the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not hinder my steps!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is subtly insufficient to be noticed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">My steps are (one) crooked,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-552a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not injure my feet!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it says "How is it?".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-554a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:57:57.664+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】"Hé Rú" (何如),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[One] [Commentary] One should follow the times and go straight ahead,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">exhausting the suitability of convergence and connection.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The rise and fall of the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are insignificant and not worth perceiving,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-553a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is said, "how is it."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-554a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation] "How is it" (何如 hé rú) is like "how is."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-554a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T02:58:32.927+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the same as "how is it?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-556a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:03:09.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">As for the time of going,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-556a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:03:09.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the rulers Yáo (堯) and Shùn (舜),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-556a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:03:09.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">their transformations have long passed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-556a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:03:09.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and cannot be found again.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-556a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:03:09.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Focus on what is appropriate for the present situation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-556a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:03:09.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without troubling yourself with looking ahead or looking back.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-560a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:14.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then the subtle appropriateness can be fully realized,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-560a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:14.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and punishment and reputation can be avoided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:14.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Elucidation】 方 (fāng),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:14.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is similar to 當 (dāng).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:14.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, in a time of loss and disorder,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:14.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it accurately belongs to the declining era of the Zhōu (周) dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-560a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And then the subtle appropriateness can be preserved,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-560a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and punishment can be avoided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Fāng 方,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like "should."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now, in a time of chaos and disorder,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">precisely belonging to the declining Zhōu 周 dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:06:15.776+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is precisely what was referred to earlier as "preservation,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to act cautiously and speak humbly</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:06:15.776+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is not something borrowed from external things;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:06:15.776+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how can there be any question of relying on the weight of a feather!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is barely enough to avoid execution.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To then presume to cling to principles and seek employment</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:06:15.776+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To act in accordance with one's nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">would not that be absurd!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:06:15.776+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and for that action to never exceed due measure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the language of Jiē Yú 接輿,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:06:15.776+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the ultimate ease in the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-561a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">mocking Kǒngzǐ 孔子.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">That which we call "complete" just now,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">does not rely on external things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-562a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] Jǐn 僅 is pronounced jìn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">How could it bear the weight of even a feather!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Five] [Commentary] To be able to walk and then to rest,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be able to hold and then to let go,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To act according to one's nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to listen to what the ears hear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and not to overdo things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the easiest thing in the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to see what the eyes see,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to know to stop at what one does not know,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To lift oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to carry oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to be able to cease at what one cannot do,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the lightest thing in the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to use what one is capable of using oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to do what one can do oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">However, knowing uses boundlessness to injure nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the mind uses desires and aversions to ruin genuineness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to indulge one's own nature within and to have no trace of concern for what is outside one's proper sphere—</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the utmost ease of non-action (wúwéi 無為).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, they abandon this effortless ease of non-action and engage in the utmost difficulty of purposeful action.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">There has never been a case</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">They discard the lightness of self-elevation and take up the heavy burden of carrying external things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">of someone failing to preserve their nature and life through non-action;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is the common affliction of the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-564a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】《zhì yì 至易》 is read with the sound "chǐ 豉" in reverse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">nor is it heard in principle</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">that one's life and nature are preserved without resulting in blessing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-564a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The same applies below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-564a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《zhī yǐ 知以》 is pronounced "zhì 智".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, that blessing</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">That which is called "whole"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-564a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《yù wù 欲惡》 is pronounced "wū lù 烏路" in reverse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:09:19.983+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore disaster is extremely heavy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is not something borrowed;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sixth】 【Commentary】 To lift that which is within one's nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then even bearing ten thousand jun (鈞, a unit of weight) will not feel heavy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:09:19.983+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Disaster is extremely heavy, yet no one knows to avoid it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">how could it be as heavy as a goose feather?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But if external things are entrusted to it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:09:19.983+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the great delusion of the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To act in accordance with one's nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to act without exceeding proper bounds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">even if the weight does not fill a zi zhu (錙銖, small amounts),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:09:19.983+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Subcommentary】 Vision, hearing, knowledge, and ability,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-563a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:05:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is the easiest thing in the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there will be an inability to bear the responsibility.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:09:19.983+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are as if having limited boundaries.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To focus on what is internal</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:09:19.983+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Stopping within those boundaries,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is fortune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore fortune is extremely light.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To focus on what is external</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, calamity arrives heavily.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Calamity arrives heavily, yet no one knows to avoid it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is disaster,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gù huò zhì chóng. Therefore, calamity arrives with great weight.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">this is the great delusion of the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">huò zhì chóng ér mò zhī zhī bì, When calamity arrives with great weight, and no one knows to avoid it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Now, sight, hearing, knowledge, and ability,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">seem to have their limits.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-565a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">cǐ shì zhī dà mí yě. this is the great delusion of the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【shū】 fú shì tīng zhī néng, [Commentary] Now, seeing, hearing, knowledge, and abilities,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Remaining within those limits</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">ruò yǒu yá fēn. seem to have limitations and boundaries.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">allows one to preserve life;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">seeking beyond those limits</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:07:03.454+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zhǐ yú fēn nèi, If one stays within these boundaries,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">will inevitably lead to premature death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Preserving life is the reason for fortune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">premature death is the reason for calamity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yet the fortune within one's limits</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is lighter than a goose feather,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and those who are greedy and competitive</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not know that it rests within themselves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The calamity beyond one's limits</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is heavier than the solid earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and those who are stubbornly deluded</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">do not know to avoid it and remove it from their bodies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is generally the common ailment of the common people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-566a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, it is attributed to Kǒng [孔] and Lù [陸] to make clear its burden.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-567a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of Text] 《Zhī Bì》[知避] (know to avoid) was previously written as "zhì" [寘],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-567a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-567a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"To place."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-567a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">《Bù Shèng》[不勝] (cannot overcome) is pronounced shēng [升].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Seven] [Commentary] Now, drawing a line on the ground and making people follow it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the tracks cannot be hidden;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">possessing oneself and then approaching things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one is not in harmony with things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, the great person does not illuminate me to illuminate them, but allows them to illuminate themselves;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">does not bestow favor on me to oversee people, but entrusts people to their own virtue (dé) [德] (three),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore, they can thoroughly pervade all things and profoundly identify with both them and me,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">indistinctly becoming one with the world, so that inside and outside share the same fortune.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:10:31.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Already,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:30.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">yǔ wù bù míng yǐ. you will not be in harmony with them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:30.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gù dà rén bù míng wǒ yǐ yào bǐ ér rèn bǐ zhī zì míng, Therefore, the great person does not illuminate "I" to illuminate "that" but allows "that" to illuminate itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:30.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">bù dé wǒ yǐ lín rén ér fù rén zhī zì (dé) 〔dé〕(sān), does not benefit me to oversee people but entrusts people to benefit themselves (three),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:30.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">gù néng mí guàn wàn wù ér xuán tóng bǐ wǒ, thus being able to thoroughly penetrate all things and profoundly identify "that" and "I,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:30.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">mǐn rán yǔ tiānxià wéi yī ér nèiwài tóng fú yě. obliterating the distinction, being one with the world, and internally and externally sharing the same blessings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:30.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【shū】 yǐ, [Commentary] Finished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">yǔ wù bù míng yǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, dà rén do not use my brightness to illuminate them, but allow them to be self-illuminating;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">they do not use my virtue to oversee people, but entrust people to their own (attainment of) virtue (sān).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, they can thoroughly penetrate all things and profoundly equate them and myself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-568a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Obliterating the distinction, they become one with the world, and both internally and externally, they share the same fortune.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 "Yǐ" (已) means to stop.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It also means to stop.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Dài" (殆) means danger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Also means danger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zhòng Ní (仲尼) was born at the end of the declining Zhōu (周) dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">during a time of decadence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Holding onto the traces of the sages,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">he traveled to different states seeking employment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">frequently encountering rejection and expulsion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and being repeatedly criticized.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, he emphasized "yǐ hū" (已乎),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning it is better to stop and not act.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one uses the Five Virtues to govern the common people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:19.924+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is like losing the "yáng".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is like losing the sun.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">sacrificing oneself to imitate things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:19.924+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Losing the "yáng" and relying on being alone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Losing the sun, rely on solitude,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:19.924+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not wandering externally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it will inevitably lead to endangering oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">just like drawing tracks on the ground</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not drifting outward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:19.924+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then my actions will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then my actions will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to make people follow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:19.924+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If everyone in the world completes their "wú" (吾, "self"),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If all under heaven complete their "self,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:19.924+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all who are called "wú" will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">a futile waste of skill and labor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with no way to conceal [the tracks].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all who claim "self" will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Mí (迷) means to lose.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Using oneself to lead things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is like losing the sun.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To lose also means to go astray.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If one who has lost the sun relies on solitude,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-569a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the meaning is also the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-570a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Text】"Huà Dì" (畫地) is pronounced huò.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and is not swayed by external things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yáng (陽) means brightness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Eight】【Note】 "Mí Yáng" (迷陽),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then my actions will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and also movement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lù Tōng (陸通) advised Ní Fù (尼父, Confucius),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If the world all make complete their "me,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It is like losing the sun.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">instructing him to hide his tracks and conceal his light,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all who call themselves "me" will all be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Losing the sun and relying on solitude,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not being swayed by external things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to embrace the inaction of solitary reliance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] *Mí* 迷 means,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to lose.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and to forget the bright wisdom of responding to things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then my conduct will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Then, stopping within one's proper limits,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If everyone in the world completes their "self,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Yáng* 陽 means,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">brightness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:13:57.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all who claim "self" will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">there will be no harm to the actions of preserving my complete life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Losing one's yang and relying on singularity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] Sīmǎ (司馬) says, "Mí yáng (迷陽) means to conceal the yáng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">movement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lù Tōng 陸通 advised Ní Fǔ 尼父,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">not being swayed by externals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">meaning to feign madness."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Jiǔ (九)] [Note] Accomplishing one's actions in a roundabout way is enough.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to conceal his tracks and hide his light,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then my conduct will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to practice the inaction of relying on solitude,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] Xì (郤) means empty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If everyone in the world completes their "I,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to forget and discard the wisdom of responding to things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all those who refer to "I" will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Qū (曲) means to follow and comply.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then to stop within one's allotted sphere,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-571a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-574a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Empty your mind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】*Mí* (迷) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without harming the actions of my complete life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-574a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">follow the nature of things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all who claim "self" will be self-sufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"lost".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] "Losing the Sun," Sīmǎ 司馬 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Yáng* (陽) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] "Xì qū (郤曲) means to remove opposition and return."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Losing the Sun"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">隨順物性，[Follow the nature of things,]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The dictionary writes it as ●.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all who call themselves "I" are self-sufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"brightness,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is hiding the sun,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guǎng Yǎ (廣雅) says, ●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">speaking of feigned madness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"movement."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】《郤曲》去逆反。[Explanation of the Text] "Xi Qū" (郤曲) is pronounced qù nì fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00">Following and conforming to the nature of things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-574a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Nine][Note] Subtly completing one's actions</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lù Tōng (陸通) advised Ní Fù (尼父)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The dictionary makes it ●.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Suíshùn wùxìng, [Following and complying with the nature of things,]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all who call me "I" will be self-sufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-574a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is sufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to conceal his tracks and hide his light,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">zé fán chēng wú zhě zìzú yě. [then all who praise me will be self-sufficient.]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Guǎngyǎ* says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】《Xì Qū》: *qù* means to oppose or reverse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Commentary] *Xì* 郤 means,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to embrace the inaction of solitary reliance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character dictionary writes it as ●.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shìwén】"Xì Qū" qù nì fǎn. ["Xì Qū" means to reject what is contrary or rebellious.]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">emptiness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">to forget the clever wisdom of responding to things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Guǎng Yǎ* says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Qū* 曲 means,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "curved" or "crooked" (qū).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Zìshū zuò ●. [The dictionary writes it as ●.]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎Lú Wénchāo says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">●</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">compliance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then stop within his allotted share,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Guǎngyǎ yún, [The Guǎngyǎ says,]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">According to my investigation, the current *Shuōwén* and *Guǎngyǎ* both write it as .</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means crooked.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-572a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without harming the conduct of preserving my whole life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:15:25.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">●, [●,]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Emptying the mind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎Qìngfān examines 郤,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Lú Wénchāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】Sīmǎ (司馬) says concerning *Mí Yáng* (迷陽):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:25.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">) 匿 (nì) also,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and the explanation of the text quotes the dictionary as making it ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Examining the current *Shuōwén* and *Guǎng Yǎ*, both are written as .</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Mí Yáng* (迷陽) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">complying with the nature of things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:25.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">representing the crooked, hidden, and concealed form of  (nì).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is correct.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">) means "to conceal" (nì yě),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">◎ Qìngfān notes: *Xì*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"subduing the *yáng*,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all who call themselves "me" will be sufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:25.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character originally followed ● (the shape of the old character) and was written as ●.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Shuōwén* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-573a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">suggesting feigned madness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the commentary in the character dictionary writes it as ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it resembles the shape of , which is crooked and hidden.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation of the Text] "*Xì Qū*" 去逆反 (going against reversing).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:25.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Now it is written as  (nì).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">) "Nì" means to conceal;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character dictionary makes it ●.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-574a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Nine】【Note】Completing conduct in a roundabout way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">which is correct.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "crooked movement" (qū xíng yě),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:25.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Annotations] (1) The missing passage 引 (yǐn) in Zhāng Jūnfáng's edition reads "郤曲 (xì qū)" instead of "吾行 (wú xíng)".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character originally followed ● and was written as ●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it depicts a crooked and hidden form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Guǎngyǎ* 廣雅 says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is formed from ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Shuōwén* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-574a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">one is self-sufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now it is written as .</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:25.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) In the Shìdétáng edition, the characters "兩者 (liǎng zhě)" are missing from "治者亂者 (zhì zhě luàn zhě)".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character was originally written as ●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:16:28.704+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】*Xì* (郤) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Corrections】 (1) An omission in Zhang Jūnfáng's version renders "my actions" (吾行) as "Xi Qū" (郤曲).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and takes 只 as its phonetic component.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"></seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now it's written as .</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">) "Concealment,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"emptiness."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">imitates a bent, hidden form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Corrections】(1) The commentary mistakenly quotes Zhāng Jūnfáng's version of Wú Xíng, which reads "xì qū" instead.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) "Those who govern" and "those who cause chaos"...</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means crooked behavior,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Guǎngyǎ* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Qū* (曲) means</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character originally was written as ●, becoming ●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is formed from ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(3) The character "德 (dé)" is corrected according to the edition of Zhào Jiànyì.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"compliance."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) The Shìdétáng edition lacks the words "liǎng zhě" (both) in "zhì zhě luàn zhě" (the governed and the disorderly).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now written as 匿 (nì).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means "crooked" (qū yě).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">with 只 as its phonetic component.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(3) The character "dé" is corrected according to Zhào Jiànyì's edition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Emptying the heart</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees in the mountains invite their own felling, and burning oil invites its own consumption</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Collations】(1) Omissions misquote the Zhāng Jūnfáng version, where "吾行" (wú xíng) is written as "郤曲" (xì qū).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Jíyùn* makes it ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Guǎng Yǎ*:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and complying with the nature of things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(Sān) Dé zì yī Zhào Jiànyì běn gǎi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) "Those who govern" and "those who cause chaos,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cassia is edible, therefore it is cut down;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"></seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-575a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">then all who claim "self" will be self-sufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means "the crookedness of things" (wù qū yě).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the Shìdétáng version omits the words "兩者" (liǎng zhě - "both of").</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees in the mountains invite their own destruction;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lacquer is useful, therefore it is tapped</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means crooked.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of the Text】*Xì Qū* (郤曲) means "removing opposition."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Another meaning is "to receive crookedly" (qū shòu yě).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">grease and fire invite their own consumption</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees of the mountains bring destruction upon themselves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Jíyùn* writes it as ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The dictionary writes it as ●.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Everyone knows the use of usefulness, but no one knows the use of uselessness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:26:58.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">[Explanation] "《山木自寇也膏火自煎也》 (shān mù zì kòu yě gāo huǒ zì jiān yě)" (zi ran) is a reversal.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cinnamon is edible,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Yùpiān* pronounces it qiū jǐ fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">lamp oil brings burning upon itself 【One】.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">**[Shì Wén]** "Shānmù zì kòu yě, gāo huǒ zì jiān yě." Zǐ Rán fǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Guǎngyǎ* (廣雅) says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:26:58.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is felled;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The *Shuōwén* also says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-579a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">lacquer is useful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:24:40.374+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cinnamon is edible,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It means the crookedness of things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:26:58.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Wood becomes the handle of an axe, and then it fells itself;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:18:21.03+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-579a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees in the mountains, like catalpas and paulownias, because of their useful timber, are exposed to felling and destruction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is tapped</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shì Wén】 "The trees of the mountain bring their own destruction, the grease in the lamp burns itself out." Zǐ Rán's 反 (fǎn).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">It also means crooked reception.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The wood grows into an axe handle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(is pronounced like yǐn.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:26:58.904+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Oil creates fire, and then it consumes itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Everyone knows the usefulness of the useful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Yùpiān* pronounces it *qiū jí fǎn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and thus fells itself;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">)  (nì) also means to conceal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The tree grows a handle for the axe,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the grease gives rise to fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-578a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:23:19.715+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but no one knows the usefulness of the useless</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-579a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Oil can brightly illuminate, filling lamps and torches; because of its usefulness, it is subjected to burning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">*Shuōwén* also says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">resembling a bent and hidden form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and thus fells itself;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and thus consumes itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">●</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character was originally written ●,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation】 "Mountains have trees that bring about their own destruction, and lamp oil burns itself out." Zǐ Rán refuted this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shì Wén (释文)】 "The mountain trees invite their own felling; the burning oil boils itself." Zǐ Rán (子然) gives the opposite meaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the grease rises to fuel the fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(pronounced like *yǐn*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-579a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is not just true of oil and wood, it is also true of people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and thus consumes itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now written .</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Because there are trees on the mountain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it is burned by fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">means to conceal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Wood produces axe handles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Wood produces axe handles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Notes】 (1) Quē Wù cites Zhāng Jūnfáng's edition, where "wú xíng" is written as "xì qū."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【釋文】"Shānmù zì kòu yě, gāohuǒ zì jiān yě." Zǐ Rán fǎn. Explanation: "The mountain wood invites its own destruction, and the lamp oil fries itself." Pronounced Zǐ Rán.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">**[Èr] [Shū]** Cassia bark has a spicy fragrance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The mountain has trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Which in turn chop it down;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Which in turn chop it down;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">it resembles the shape of , crooked, concealed, and hidden.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:19:52.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) The Shì Détáng edition omits the words "liǎng zhě" in "zhì zhě luàn zhě."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ (司馬) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and is therefore subjected to chopping and felling;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is burned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees grow into axe handles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">lacquer is used to make utensils,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Oil gives rise to fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Oil gives rise to fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The character was originally written as ●, using ● as its component,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then is used to chop itself;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Two】 【Commentary】 Cinnamon's heart is spicy and fragrant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Which in turn consumes it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Which in turn consumes it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and therefore it is harvested.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-576a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">now it is written as .</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Explanation of Terms】"Shān mù zì kòu yě gāo huǒ zì jiān yě": Zǐ Rán pronounces it differently.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">oil gives rise to fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is subjected to chopping and felling;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Both are examples of talent</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cuī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Corrections】 (1) *Quēwù* misquotes Zhāng Jūnfáng's version, writing "my conduct" as "Xì Qū".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:22:40.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then is consumed by the fire itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">lacquer provides utensils,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The mountain has trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The mountain has trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">that is cut short by axes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-577a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:20:30.828+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">(2) "Those who govern, those who cause chaos,"</seg>
