                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Wood grows into axe handles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore it is burned by fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore it is burned by fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and is then used to fell itself;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">both are victims of their talent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">**[Sān] [Zhù]** If something is useful, it contributes to others' accomplishments;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Two】【Commentary】 Cinnamon heart is spicy and fragrant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Two】【Commentary】 Cinnamon heart is spicy and fragrant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shì Wén】"The trees of the mountain invite their own felling, and the grease of the lamp invites its own consumption." Zǐ Rán's gloss.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">grease starts a fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and prematurely die by the axe.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if it is useless, it preserves its own life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, it is subjected to chopping and felling;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Sīmǎ says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, it is subjected to chopping and felling;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then consumes itself.</seg>
