                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and then turn around and fell themselves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, it is cut and harvested;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-580a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Because the mountain has wood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To enable the people to preserve themselves and to make both them and us comfortable,</seg>
