                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Both are due to their talents,</seg>
