                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If it is useless, then it preserves its own life.</seg>
