                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To enable the common people to not lose their self-preservation, and for both sides to be comfortable,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Both are due to their talents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Èr】【Shū】Cassia heart is spicy and fragrant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are useful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it suffers chopping and felling;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is to be subtly unaware that the marvel lies within oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">oxen with white foreheads,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Is to be subtly unaware that the marvel lies within oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees by crooked paths,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and are cut down by axes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lacquer provides utensils and uses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 The catalpa, cypress, tangerine, and pomelo trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and pigs with upturned snouts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 The catalpa, cypress, tangerine, and pomelo trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">trees of Shāngqiū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Three】【Note】If one is useful, then one contributes to the other’s success;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">therefore it is cut and tapped;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lamp oil, fire, cinnamon, and lacquer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">This is useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">oxen with white foreheads,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if one is useless, then one preserves its life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Lamp oil (gāo huǒ), cinnamon (guì), lacquer (qī),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">both, because of their talent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These are all useful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Yet people all flaunt their talents as useful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pigs with upturned snouts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To cut one's own flesh for the sake of the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are useful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-581a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">are cut short by axes and hatchets.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees with crooked boughs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees with crooked boughs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is something the world knows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but do not realize that fragmenting their virtue is the use of uselessness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And worldly people all flaunt their talents as useful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To enable the people to preserve themselves, while both they and I are comfortable,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The wood of Shāngqiū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">The wood of Shāngqiū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Guō (郭) [Xiàng's 向] commentary says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Sān】【Zhù】If useful, then they contribute their effort to others;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if useless, then they preserve their own lives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">but do not know that to fragment their virtue is to be useful in being useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">without anyone being aware of it, is to have the marvel within oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cattle with white foreheads,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cattle with white foreheads,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">"Being useful means contributing to the accomplishments of others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To cut one's own flesh to benefit the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pigs with upturned snouts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Guō's note says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:20.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">being useless means preserving one's own life completely."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Commentary】 Catalpa trees, cypress trees, mandarin orange trees, pomelo trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Pigs with upturned snouts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These are all useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If there is usefulness, then they contribute to the accomplishments of others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">is what the world knows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">burning oil, cassia bark, and lacquer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">These are all useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">To enable the people to preserve themselves while both they and I are well-suited,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But worldly people all flaunt their talents as a useful use,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But worldly people all flaunt their talents as a useful use,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are useful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:27:59.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if there is no usefulness, then they preserve their own lives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees with crooked branches (qū yuán zhī shù),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-582a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">unconsciously unaware of the marvel residing in oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And do not know that fragmenting their virtue is a useless use.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">And do not know that fragmenting their virtue is a useless use.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">【Shū】Catalpa, cypress, orange, and pomelo trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">trees in Shāngqiū (商丘),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Guō's commentary says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Guō's commentary says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If something is useful, then it contributes to the success of others;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Cows with white foreheads (bái sǎng zhī niú),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">lamp grease, cassia, and lacquer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:17.228+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If something is useful, then it contributes to the success of others;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pigs with upturned snouts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are useful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If it is useless, then it preserves its own life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:29:09.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If it is useless, then it preserves its own life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Trees with crooked axles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">the wood of Shāngqiū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But people all flaunt their talents to be put to useful purposes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">white-browed oxen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and do not know that crippling their virtue is to be put to useless purposes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">pigs with upturned snouts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Guō's (郭) commentary says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">these are useless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If it is useful, then it contributes to the accomplishment of others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">But worldly people all flaunt their talents for useful use,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:31:21.591+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if one is useless, then one preserves its life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">and do not know to disjoint their virtue for useless use.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">Therefore, Guō's commentary says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">If useful, then they contribute their effort to others;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0386_tls_007-583a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T03:32:38.959+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0386-en-3c235c9d">if useless, then they preserve their own lives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-2a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:17.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Jiēyú said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-2a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:17.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"This is deceiving virtue;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-2a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:17.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it is to govern the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-2a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:17.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">like crossing the sea by digging a river</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:17.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">or making mosquitoes carry mountains.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:17.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now, the governance of a sage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-3a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:32.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to dwell in the vast wilderness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-3a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:32.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Why do you have the leisure</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-3a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:32.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to burden my heart with governing the world?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-3a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:32.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He asked again.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-3a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:32.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The nameless person said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-3a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T05:38:32.661+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Let your mind roam in tranquility,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-7a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:06.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I saw his power of resistance stifled."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-7a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:06.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lièzǐ went in,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-7a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:06.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and told Húzǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-7a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:06.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Húzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-7a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:06.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Just now, I showed him the heavens and the earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-7a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:06.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">names and realities did not enter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:31.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he again brought him to see Húzǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:31.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Before he had even settled,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:31.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he lost himself and fled.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:31.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Húzǐ said, "Pursue him!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:31.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lièzǐ pursued him but did not catch up.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:31.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Returning, he reported to Húzǐ, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:49.337+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he did not undertake responsibilities,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:49.337+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">nor act as a master of knowledge.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:49.337+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Embodied, he exhausted the endless,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:49.337+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and wandered without traces;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:49.337+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he exhausted what he received from Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:48:49.337+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">without revealing it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:08.537+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yet they are excessive in virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:08.537+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Attached tumors and hanging warts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:08.537+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are they from form?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:08.537+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yet they are excessive in nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:08.537+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">To have much benevolence and righteousness and use them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:08.537+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is it to be aligned with the five viscera?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:30.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in support of unattainable laws, is it not?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:30.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">And Zēng Shěn and Shǐ Yú are examples of this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-2a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:30.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Those who grow excessive in debate</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-2a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:30.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">pile up tiles, knot ropes, and distort sentences,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-2a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:30.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">roaming in their minds between the hard and white, the same and different,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-2a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:30.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and exhausting themselves in small steps and useless words, is it not?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:48.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">biting it off will cause crying.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:48.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">These two things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:48.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">one either exceeds the proper number</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:48.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">or falls short of the proper number,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:48.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but in either case, the worry is the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:49:48.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The benevolent people of today,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:35.336+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">which goes beyond mere skill.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:35.336+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">When I first began to butcher oxen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:35.336+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what I saw was nothing but the ox itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:35.336+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">After three years, I no longer saw the whole ox.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:35.336+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:35.336+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now, at this time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:54.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">That is why after nineteen years the blade is as sharp as if it had just been sharpened on a whetstone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:54.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Although, whenever I come to a complicated part,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:54.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I see how difficult it is to do;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:54.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I become cautious and alert,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:54.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">my gaze is fixed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-3a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:50:54.954+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and my movements are slow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:18.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but does not desire to be kept in a cage.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:18.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Though the spirit may be kingly, it is not good."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:18.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">When Lǎo Dān died, Qín Shī went to mourn him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:18.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">crying out three times and then leaving.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:18.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The disciples said, "Was he not a friend of our master?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_003-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:18.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-1a.3-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:36.789+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chapter Four: In the World of Men</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:36.789+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yán Huí saw Zhòngní,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:36.789+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and asked for permission to go away.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:36.789+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:36.789+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Where are you going?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:36.789+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:56.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if mixed, then there is too much;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:56.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if too much, then there is disturbance;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:56.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if disturbance, then there is worry;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:56.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if worry, then there is no saving.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:56.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The ultimate person of ancient times</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:51:56.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">first preserved it within themselves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:18.313+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what use is there in seeking to be different?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:18.313+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If you simply give no instructions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:18.313+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">kings and dukes will inevitably take advantage of people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:18.313+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and compete for quick results.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:18.313+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">And your eyes will be dazzled by it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:18.313+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and your expression will be peaceful toward it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">惡用而求有以異？È yòng ér qiú yǒu yǐ yì? What's the use of striving for distinction by employing what is evil?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">若唯無詔，Ruò wéi wú zhào, If you simply issue no commands,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">王公必將乘人Wánggōng bìjiāng chéngrén the kings and dukes will surely take advantage of others</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而鬭其捷。ér dòu qí jié. and contend in quickness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而目將熒之，ér mù jiāng yíng zhī, Their eyes will be dazzled by it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而色將平之，ér sè jiāng píng zhī, Their faces will smooth it over,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">口將營之，kǒu jiāng yíng zhī, Their mouths will manage it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">容將形之，róng jiāng xíng zhī, Their appearances will embody it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">心且成之。xīn qiě chéng zhī. And their hearts will complete it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">是以火救火，shìyǐ huǒ jiù huǒ, Therefore, using fire to fight fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以水救水，yǐ shuǐ jiù shuǐ, using water to fight water,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">名之曰益多。míng zhī yuē yì duō. is called making it even more.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">順始無窮，shùn shǐ wúqióng, Following the beginning leads to endlessness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">若殆以不信厚言，ruò dài yǐ bùxìn hòuyán, If you recklessly employ insincere flattery,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">必死於暴人之前矣！bì sǐ yú bàorén zhī qián yǐ! you will surely die before violent men!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">且昔者桀殺關龍逢，qiě xīzhě Jié shā Guān Lóngféng, Moreover, in the past, Jié killed Guān Lóngféng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">紂殺王子比干，Zhòu shā wángzǐ Bǐgān, and Zhòu killed Prince Bǐgān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">是皆脩其身shì jiē xiū qí shēn These both cultivated their persons</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以傴拊人之民，yǐ yǔ fǔ rén zhī mín, in order to comfort and soothe the people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以下拂其上者也，yǐ xià fú qí shàng zhě yě, and used their inferior position to oppose their superiors.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">故其君因其脩以擠之。gù qí jūn yīn qí xiū yǐ jī zhī. Therefore, their rulers used their cultivation to crush them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">是好名者也。shì hào míng zhě yě. These are those who love fame.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">昔者堯攻叢枝、胥敖，xīzhě Yáo gōng Cóngzhī, Xū'áo, In the past, Yáo attacked Cóngzhī and Xū'áo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">禹攻有扈，Yǔ gōng Yǒuhù, and Yǔ attacked Yǒuhù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">國為虛厲，guó wéi xū lì, Their states became empty and desolate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">身為刑戮，shēn wéi xínglù, and they themselves suffered punishment and execution.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">其用兵不止，qí yòngbīng bùzhǐ, Their use of arms did not cease,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">其求實無已。qí qiú shí wú yǐ. Their pursuit of reality was endless.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">是皆求名實者也，shì jiē qiú míng shí zhě yě, These are all those who sought fame and reality,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而獨不聞之乎？ér dú bù wén zhī hū? But haven't you heard of them?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">名實者，聖人之所不能勝也，míng shí zhě, shèngrén zhī suǒ bùnéng shèng yě, Fame and reality are what even sages cannot overcome,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而況若乎！ér kuàng ruò hū! How much less can you!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">雖然，suīrán, However,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:28.949+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">若必有以也，ruò bì yǒu yǐ yě, if you must have a method,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">惡用而求有以異？ Why use [cunning] to seek to be different?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">若唯無詔， If you simply issue no commands,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">王公必將乘人 the kings and dukes will surely take advantage of people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而鬭其捷。 and compete in quickness [of action].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而目將熒之， Their eyes will be dazzled by it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而色將平之， their faces will attempt to appease it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">口將營之， their mouths will scheme for it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">容將形之， their appearances will embody it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">心且成之。 and their hearts will eventually accomplish it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">是以火救火， This is like using fire to fight fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以水救水， or using water to fight water,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">名之曰益多。 which is called adding more.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">順始無窮， To comply with the beginning is endlessly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">若殆以不信厚言， if you are likely to disbelieve sincere words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">必死於暴人之前矣！ you will surely die before violent men!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">且昔者 Jié 桀殺 Guān Lóngféng 關龍逢， Furthermore, in the past, Jié killed Guān Lóngféng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhòu 紂殺 Wángzǐ Bǐgān 王子比干， Zhòu killed Prince Bǐgān,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">是皆脩其身 these were all those who cultivated themselves</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以傴拊人之民， in order to stoop and care for the people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以下拂其上者也， and use the bottom to brush against their superiors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">故其君因其脩以擠之。 therefore, their rulers used their cultivation to suppress them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">是好名者也。 These were those who loved fame.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">昔者 Yáo 堯攻 Cóngzhī 叢枝、 Xū’áo 胥敖， In the past, Yáo attacked Cóngzhī and Xū’áo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yǔ 禹攻 Yǒuhù 有扈， Yǔ attacked Yǒuhù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">國為虛厲， the states became desolate and ruined,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">身為刑戮， and they themselves suffered punishment and execution.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">其用兵不止， Their use of troops did not stop,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">其求實無已。 their pursuit of reality had no end.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">是皆求名實者也， These were all those who sought fame and reality,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而獨不聞之乎？ and have you alone not heard of this?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">名實者，聖人之所不能勝也， Fame and reality are something that even sages cannot overcome,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而況若乎！ how much more so you!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">雖然， However,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:52:43.332+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">若必有以也， if you must have a method,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:07.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">These were all those who sought both fame and practical results,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:07.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but have you not heard of this?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:07.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Fame and practical results are something even the sages cannot overcome,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:07.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how much less you!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:07.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Nevertheless,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-2a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:07.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if you must have some method,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:25.279+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Being inwardly upright</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:25.279+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">means being a companion with Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:25.279+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Being a companion with Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:25.279+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">means knowing that the Son of Heaven and oneself are both sons of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:25.279+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">So why should I expect people to praise my words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:25.279+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and why should I expect people not to praise them?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:42.748+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Alas! How could it be acceptable?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:42.748+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">To enact many laws and regulations</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:42.748+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">without thorough investigation</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:42.748+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">may indeed leave one without blame.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:42.748+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">But even so, it only goes this far.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:53:42.748+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">How can this attain transformation!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:05.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">do not listen with your mind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:05.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but listen with your *qì*!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:05.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Listening stops at the ears,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:05.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the mind stops at symbols.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:05.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">*Qì* is</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:05.108+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">emptiness that awaits things."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:23.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I have heard of flying with wings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:23.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but I have not heard of flying without wings;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:23.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I have heard of knowing with knowledge,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:23.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but I have not heard of knowing with non-knowledge.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:23.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Look at that window,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-6a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:23.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">from the empty room comes forth light.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-7a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:45.752+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If the matter does not succeed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-7a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:45.752+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then there will surely be troubles related to human affairs;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-7a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:45.752+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if the matter succeeds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-7a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:45.752+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then there will surely be troubles related to yin and yang.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-7a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:54:45.752+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Only by neither succeeding nor failing will there be no troubles.'"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:04.215+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">there is nowhere where he is not the ruler's (servant),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:04.215+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">there is nowhere to escape between heaven and earth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:04.215+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is called a great prohibition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:04.215+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, in serving one's parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:04.215+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">one does not choose a place to be at ease,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:04.215+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">this is the utmost of filial piety;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:23.046+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">there will inevitably be an excess of flattering words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:23.046+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when there is shared anger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:23.046+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">there will inevitably be an excess of malicious words.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:23.046+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">All excesses are falsehoods,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:23.046+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and if they are false, then no one will believe them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:23.046+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and if no one believes them, the transmitter of the words will suffer calamity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:43.095+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and there are clever words and biased arguments.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:43.095+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">When a beast dies, it does not choose its cries;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:43.095+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">its breath is abundant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:43.095+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and then harmful thoughts arise together.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:43.095+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If criticism and investigation go too far,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-8a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:43.095+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then there will surely be unworthy thoughts responding to it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:59.037+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it will endanger my country;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:59.037+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if I act with him with constraints,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:59.037+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it will endanger myself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:59.037+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">His wisdom is just enough to know the faults of others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-9a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:59.037+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but not enough to know the reasons for those faults.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:55:59.037+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If that is the case, what should I do?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-10a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:18.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Attain this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-10a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:18.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and enter a state of flawlessness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-10a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:18.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Do you not know about the mantis?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-10a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:18.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Angrily raising its arms to stop a chariot wheel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-10a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:18.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">unaware that it cannot possibly succeed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-10a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:18.883+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">this is because it overestimates its own abilities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-10a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:37.055+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but the love is lost,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-11a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:37.055+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how can one not be cautious!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:37.055+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The artisan Shí of Qí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:37.055+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">arrived at Qū Yuán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:37.055+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and saw an oak tree at a village shrine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:37.055+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Its size could shelter several thousand cattle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-11a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:54.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if made into a door, it would ooze sap;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-11a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:54.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if made into a pillar, it would be eaten by insects.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-11a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:54.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">It is a useless tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-11a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:54.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">good for nothing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-12a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:54.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and therefore can live so long."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:56:54.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The craftsman Shí returned home,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-12a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:16.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">why do you assess things in this way?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-12a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:16.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">And you, a dying, scattered person,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:16.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how would you know about scattered wood!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:16.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Jiàng Shí woke up and examined his dream.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:16.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">His disciple said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:16.451+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"It is pursuing uselessness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-14a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:33.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Tasting its leaves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-14a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:33.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">caused the mouth to fester and become sore;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-14a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:33.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Smelling it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-14a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:33.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">caused a person to become drunk and ill, not ceasing for three days.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-14a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:33.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zǐqí said: "This is truly a useless tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-14a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:33.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">that is why it has grown to be so large.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:53.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhīlí Shū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:53.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">his chin hidden by his navel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:53.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">his shoulders higher than his head,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:53.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">his pigtail pointing to the sky,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-16a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:53.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">his five viscera on top,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:57:53.02+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and his two thighs were ribs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-17a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:11.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when the world is disordered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-17a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:11.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">sages survive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-17a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:11.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">In this age,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-17a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:11.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">one barely escapes punishment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-17a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:11.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Blessings are lighter than feathers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_004-17a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:11.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and no one knows how to carry them;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:28.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">were as numerous as those who followed Zhòng Ní.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:28.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Cháng Jì asked Zhòng Ní, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:28.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Wáng Tái is a cripple,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:28.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet those who follow him are equal to you in dividing Lǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:28.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He does not instruct while standing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:28.543+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">nor does he debate while sitting,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-2a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:46.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he would not abandon them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-2a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:46.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He understands that he has no need to rely on external things, and does not change with them;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:46.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he directs the transformations of things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:46.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and guards their origin."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:46.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Cháng Jì 常季 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-2a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:58:46.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"What does this mean?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:04.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">receiving his mandate from Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-3a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:04.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">only Shùn 舜 was uniquely upright,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-3a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:04.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">fortunately able to correct his life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-3a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:04.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in order to correct the lives of the people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-3a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:04.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Truly, the sign of preserving the beginning is the reality of not fearing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-3a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:04.684+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">One brave warrior can bravely enter nine armies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-4a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:23.581+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Are you comparing yourself to the one in power?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-4a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:23.581+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Shēntú Jiā 申徒嘉 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-4a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:23.581+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"In our teacher's school,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:23.581+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Are there indeed powerful officials such as yourself?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:23.581+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Do you take pleasure in your power</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:23.581+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">And then look down on others?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-5a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:43.569+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet, not being hit is fate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-5a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:43.569+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Many people laugh at me for my missing foot when they have both their feet intact,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-5a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:43.569+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and I was indignant and angry;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-5a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:43.569+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but when I went to our teacher’s place,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:43.569+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I despondently returned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T16:59:43.569+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I don't know if our teacher cleanses me with goodness?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-6a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:01.194+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">How could I know that Fūzǐ 夫子 is still like this!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-6a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:01.194+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Kǒngzǐ 孔子 said, "Qiū 丘 is indeed narrow-minded.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-6a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:01.194+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Why doesn't Fūzǐ 夫子 come inside?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-6a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:01.194+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I will explain what I have heard!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-6a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:01.194+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Wúzhǐ 无趾 went out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-6a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:01.194+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Kǒngzǐ 孔子 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:19.894+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">'Rather be his concubine than another man's wife,'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:19.894+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and there have been dozens who have done so.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:19.894+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I have never heard him lead the singing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:19.894+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he always harmonizes with others.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:19.894+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Without the position of a ruler</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-8a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:19.894+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to help people escape death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:36.483+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhòng Ní said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:36.483+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I, Qiū, once served as an envoy to Chǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:36.483+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">where I happened to see piglets</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:36.483+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">feeding on their dead mother.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:36.483+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Before long, they all blinked, as if startled, and abandoned her, running away.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:36.483+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Not seeing that,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:54.907+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Duke Āi asked: "What is meant by 'complete talent'?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:54.907+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhòng Ní said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:54.907+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Life and death, survival and ruin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:54.907+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">poverty and wealth, success and failure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:54.907+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">being worthy or unworthy, praise and slander,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:00:54.907+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">hunger and thirst, cold and heat,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:15.572+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to rule the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:15.572+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">holding the reins of the people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:15.572+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and worrying about their death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:15.572+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I thought myself to be supremely enlightened.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:15.572+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now that I have heard the words of a perfect man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:15.572+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I fear that I lack the substance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:36.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">so what use is knowledge?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:36.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He does not carve,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:36.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">so what use is glue?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-13a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:36.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He has no loss,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-13a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:36.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">so what use is virtue?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-13a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:36.745+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He does not trade,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-14a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:53.28+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"If men have no emotions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-14a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:53.28+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how can they be called men?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-14a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:53.28+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhuāngzi said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-14a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:53.28+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"The Dào gives them their appearance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-14a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:53.28+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Heaven gives them their form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_005-14a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:01:53.28+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how could they not be called men?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.3-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:02:14.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chapter Six: The Great Teacher</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:02:14.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">To understand what Heaven does,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:02:14.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and to understand what man does,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:02:14.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is perfection.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:02:14.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">To understand what Heaven does</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:02:14.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is to be born of Heaven;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:04.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">enters water without getting wet,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:04.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">enters fire without getting burned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:04.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">It is through knowledge like this that one can ascend and rely on the Dao.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:04.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The True Persons of old,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:04.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in their sleep, did not dream;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-1a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:04.786+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when awake, they had no worries.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:22.063+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">not abandoning the Dao with the mind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:22.063+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">not assisting Heaven with human effort.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:22.063+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">These are called true people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:22.063+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If they are like this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:22.063+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their minds are forgotten,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:22.063+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their appearance is still.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:42.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Those like Hú Bùxié, Wù Guāng, Bó Yí, Shū Qí, Jī Zǐ, Xū Yú, Jì Tā, Shēntú Dí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:42.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are servants of the servants of others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:42.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">conforming to the conformity of others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-2a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:42.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and do not allow themselves to conform to what is their own.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-3a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:42.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-3a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:03:42.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The True People (Zhēn Rén) of old,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-3a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:01.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">taking virtue as their guidance</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-3a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:01.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">meant speaking of how they were as capable as those who reached the hill;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-3a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:01.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet people truly thought they were diligently practicing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-3a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:01.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, that which they liked was singular,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-3a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:01.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and that which they disliked was singular.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-3a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:01.238+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Their singularity was singular,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:21.185+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Rather than praising Yáo (堯) and criticizing Jié (桀),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:21.185+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it is better to forget both</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:21.185+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and transform with their Way.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-4a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:21.185+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The Great Clod (dà kuài) burdens me with form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-4a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:21.185+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">toils me with life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-4a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:21.185+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">eases me with old age,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-4a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:39.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how much more so what all things depend on</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:39.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and what the transformations await!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:39.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now, the Dao,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:39.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">has reality and truth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:39.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">acts without acting, and has no form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:39.853+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it can be transmitted but not received,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:57.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Jiān Wú obtained it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:57.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and with it, dwelt on the great mountains;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:57.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Huángdì obtained it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:57.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and with it, ascended the cloudy heavens;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:57.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhuān Xù obtained it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-5a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:04:57.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and with it, dwelt in the dark palace;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:05:17.548+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Nánbó Zǐ Kuí said: "Can the Dao be learned?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:05:17.548+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:05:17.548+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Alas! How can it be!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:05:17.548+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">You are not the person for it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:05:17.548+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now, Bǔ Liáng Yǐ had the talent of a sage</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:05:17.548+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but not the Dao of a sage.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:07.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he who gives birth to life does not live.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:07.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">As for its nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:07.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">there is nothing it does not escort,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:07.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">nothing it does not welcome;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:07.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">nothing it does not destroy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-6a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:07.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">nothing it does not complete."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:26.879+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I will be friends with him."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:26.879+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The four men looked at each other and laughed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:26.879+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">understanding each other perfectly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-8a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:26.879+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and so became friends.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:26.879+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:26.879+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Soon after, Zǐyú fell ill.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:47.738+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if, gradually, he were to transform my buttocks into wheels,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:47.738+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and my spirit into a horse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:47.738+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I would ride it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:47.738+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">why would I need another carriage!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:47.738+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Furthermore, obtaining is a matter of timing;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:47.738+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">losing is a matter of accordance with nature;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">浸假而化予之尻以為輪， For a long time, I have been transforming my buttocks into wheels,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以神為馬， and my spirit into a horse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">予因而乘之， I therefore ride it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">豈更駕哉！ Why would I change mounts?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">且夫得者，時也； Moreover, gaining is a matter of timing;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">失者，順也； losing is a matter of acquiescence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">安時而處順， If one is content with timing and abides by acquiescence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">哀樂不能入也。 sorrow and joy cannot enter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">此古之所謂縣解也， This is what the ancients called being released from bondage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而不能自解者， but those who cannot free themselves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">物有結之。 it is because things have bound them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">且夫物不勝天</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">久矣， Moreover, things cannot overcome Heaven for a long time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">吾又何惡焉！」 so what is there for me to resent!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">喘喘然將死， panting and near death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">其妻子環而泣之， His wife and children surrounded him, weeping.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lí 往問之， Lí went to inquire about him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">曰： and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">「叱！避！无怛化！」 "Shoo! Get away! Do not disturb the transformation!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">倚其戶與之語曰： Leaning against the door, he spoke to him, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">「偉哉造化！ "Great is the Creator!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">又將奚以汝為， What will He make you into next?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">將奚以汝適？ Where will He send you?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以汝為鼠肝乎？ Will He make you into a rat's liver?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以汝為蟲臂乎？」 Will He make you into an insect's arm?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zǐlái 曰： Zǐlái said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">「父母於子， "Parents to their children,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">東西南北， in the east, west, south, and north,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">唯命之從。 only follow their commands.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">陰陽於人， The Yin and Yang to people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">不翅於父母； are no less than parents;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">彼近吾死</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:06:58.168+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而我不聽， now that they are bringing me closer to death, if I do not listen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Soaking for a while, it may transform my buttocks into a wheel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and my spirit into a horse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I will then ride it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">why would I need to change carriages?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Moreover, obtaining something is a matter of timing;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">losing something is a matter of following the natural course.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Being content with the time and dwelling in accordance with the natural course,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">sorrow and joy cannot enter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is what the ancients called being 'released from bonds,'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but those who cannot release themselves</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are bound by external things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Furthermore, things cannot overcome Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-9a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">since long ago,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">so what should I resent!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">俄而 Zǐlái 有病， Soon after, Zǐlái became ill,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">panting and about to die.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">His wife and children surrounded him and wept.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lí 犁 went to ask about him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Shoo! Move away! Do not alarm the transformation!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He leaned against the door and spoke to him, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Great indeed is the Creator!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">What will He make you into next?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Where will He send you?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Will He make you into a rat's liver?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Will He make you into an insect's arm?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zǐlái 子來 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Parents in relation to their child,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">east, west, north, south,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">only follow their commands.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yīn 陰 and Yáng 陽 in relation to people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are no different than parents;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">now that they are bringing me close to death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:15.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if I were not to listen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:37.693+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in the east, west, south, and north,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:37.693+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">only follow their command.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:37.693+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yin and Yang to people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:37.693+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are no less than parents.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:37.693+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now that they are approaching my death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:37.693+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and I do not listen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">東西南北，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">唯命之從。 East, west, south, and north, I follow their command alone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">陰陽於人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">不翅於父母； The *yīn* and *yáng* in relation to man are no less than parents;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">彼近吾死</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而我不聽，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">我則悍矣，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">彼何罪焉！ If they approach my death and I do not listen to them, then I am rebellious. What crime have they committed?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">夫大塊載我以形，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">勞我以生，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">佚我以老，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">息我以死。 Now, the Great Clod (Earth) burdens me with form, toils me with life, eases me with old age, and rests me with death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">故善吾生者，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">乃所以善吾死也。 Therefore, to treat my life well is precisely to treat my death well.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">今大冶鑄金，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">金踊躍曰</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">『我且必為鏌鋣』，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">大冶必以為不祥之金。 Now, if a great smelter is casting metal, and the metal jumps up and says, "I must certainly become a Mòyé sword," the great smelter will surely regard it as an inauspicious metal.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">今一犯人之形，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">而曰『人耳人耳』，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">夫造化者必以為不祥之人。 Now, having once assumed human form, and then saying, "A human! A human!" the Creator will surely regard him as an inauspicious person.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">今一以天地為大鑪，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">以造化為大冶，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">惡乎往而不可哉！」 Now, considering Heaven and Earth as a great furnace, and the Creator as a great smelter, where could one go and not be permissible!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">成然寐，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-10a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">蘧然覺。 Chéng Rán went to sleep heavily and awoke with a start.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">子桑戶、孟子反、子琴張三人相與友，曰： Zǐsāng Hù, Mèngzǐ Fǎn, and Zǐqín Zhāng were three friends who said to each other:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">「孰能相與於无相與，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">相為於无相為？ "Who can associate with each other in non-association, and help each other in non-helping?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">孰能登天遊霧，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">撓挑无極； Who can ascend to heaven and wander in the mists, stirring and shaking the boundless?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">相忘以生， 无所終窮？」</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:07:50.685+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">三人相視而笑， Forgetting each other in life, without end or limit?" The three looked at each other and laughed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:23.751+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Who can associate with each other in non-association,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:23.751+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and act for each other in non-action?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:23.751+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Who can ascend to the sky and roam through the mist,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:23.751+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">thrash about in the boundless void,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:23.751+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">forget each other in life, without end or limit?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:23.751+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The three looked at each other and laughed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:45.784+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">They have no cultivation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:45.784+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and disregard their physical bodies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:45.784+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">singing beside a corpse, their expressions unchanged.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:45.784+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I don't know what to call them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:45.784+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">What sort of people are they?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:08:45.784+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Kǒngzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-14a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:06.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-14a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:06.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I, Qiū, am a punished person of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-14a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:06.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Even so, I will share it with you."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-14a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:06.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zǐgòng said: "May I ask about his way?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-14a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:06.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Kǒngzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-14a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:06.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Fish create each other in the water,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-15a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:25.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">his heart felt no sorrow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-15a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:25.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and he showed no grief while in mourning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-15a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:25.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lacking these three things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-15a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:25.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he has ostensibly observed mourning well and covered the state of Lǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-15a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:25.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Can it be that there are those who obtain a reputation without actually possessing the reality</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:25.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I find this quite strange."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-16a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:46.261+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but no emotional death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-16a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:46.261+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Mèng Sūnshì simply awoke;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-16a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:46.261+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when people cry, he also cries;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-16a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:46.261+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">this is according to what it should be.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-16a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:46.261+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Moreover, we are mutually giving ourselves over to our ears;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-16a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:09:46.261+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how can we know what I call 'I'?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-17a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:05.47+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Xǔ Yóu said: "No.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-17a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:05.47+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">For the blind cannot participate in the beauty of eyebrows and eyes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-17a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:05.47+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the visually impaired cannot participate in the observation of blue and yellow embroidery."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-17a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:05.47+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yìérzi said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-17a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:05.47+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"If Wúzhuāng lost his beauty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-17a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:05.47+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and Jùliáng lost his strength,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-18a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:24.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I have forgotten ritual and music."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-18a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:24.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhòng Ní said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-18a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:24.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"That is good,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-18a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:24.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but still not enough."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-18a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:24.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Another day, he saw him again and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-18a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:24.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">said, "I have progressed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-18a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">And you are truly virtuous!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-19a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I, Qiū, beg to follow behind you."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-19a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zǐ Yú was friends with Zǐ Sāng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-19a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and it rained continuously for ten days.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-19a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zǐ Yú said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-19a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Zǐ Sāng is probably ill!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_006-19a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"It is fate!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-1a.3-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chapter Seven: Responding to Emperors and Kings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Niè Quē asked Wáng Ní,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:10:43.325+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">asking four times, and receiving "I don't know" four times.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Can such a person</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">be compared to an enlightened ruler?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yáng Zǐ Jū stepped back respectfully and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-4a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"May I ask about the governance of an enlightened ruler?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-4a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lǎo Dān said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-4a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"The governance of an enlightened ruler</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-4a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">covers the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-4a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but seems not to be his own doing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-5a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">With only females and no males,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-5a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how could there be eggs!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-5a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">To contend with the world through the Dao,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_007-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:11:40.415+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and to be absolutely certain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">round things are not made round with compasses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">square things are not made square with squares,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">things that adhere are not held together with glue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">things that are bound are not bound with ropes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, the world spontaneously comes into being</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and does not know how it comes into being,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">together they all gain</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and do not know how they gain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, ancient and modern are not different,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-5a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:29.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and cannot be diminished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-6a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:51.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their careers are different,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-6a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:51.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their reputations have different names,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-6a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:51.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but regarding harming their nature by sacrificing themselves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-6a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:51.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">they are the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-6a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:51.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zāng 臧 and Gǔ 穀, two people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-6a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:13:51.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">herded sheep together and both lost their sheep.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:10.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">so where do we find gentlemen and petty men in that?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:10.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Moreover, if someone attaches their nature to benevolence and righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:10.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">even if they are as knowledgeable as Zēng Shēn and Shǐ Yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:10.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">they are not what I would call skilled;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:10.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if someone attaches their nature to the five flavors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:10.981+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">even if they are as knowledgeable as Yú'ér,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:31.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">It is to be pleased with what pleases others</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:31.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">without being pleased with one's own pleasure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:31.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">To be pleased with what pleases others</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:31.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">without being pleased with one's own pleasure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:31.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">even if one is like Zhí (盜跖, Robber Zhi) or Bó Yí (伯夷),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_008-7a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:31.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is equally perverse and misguided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:53.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">made them thirsty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:53.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">made them gallop,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:53.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">made them race,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:53.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">straightened them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:53.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">aligned them;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:14:53.263+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in front, there was the suffering of being adorned with ornaments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-1a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:18.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is called being released by Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:18.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:18.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, in the age of the highest virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:18.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their movements were steady,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:18.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their gaze was simple.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:18.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">At that time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:44.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">meticulously creating ceremonies (lǐ),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:44.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then the world began to divide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:44.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, if pure simplicity is not broken,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:44.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">who would make sacrificial vessels!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:44.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If white jade is not damaged,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-2a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:19:44.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">who would make jade tablets (guī zhāng)!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-3a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:04.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, that the horse's knowledge leads to thievery</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:04.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is the fault of Bólè (伯樂).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-4a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:04.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:04.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">In the time of the Hèxū Shì (赫胥氏),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:04.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the people lived not knowing what to do,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_009-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:04.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">moved not knowing where to go,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:24.579+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">In that case, is what the village calls wisdom</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-2a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:24.579+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">not accumulating things for the great thief?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:24.579+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, let us try to discuss this:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:24.579+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is there anything among what the world calls wisdom</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-2a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:24.579+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">that does not accumulate things for the great thief?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-2a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:24.579+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">What is called a sage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:41.026+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Let us try to discuss this:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:41.026+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">of those whom the common people call "supremely wise,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:41.026+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are there any who are not accumulating wealth for the great thief?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:41.026+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Of those who are called "supreme sages,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:41.026+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are there any who are not guarding it for the great thief?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:41.026+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">How do we know this to be true?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:57.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">a good man cannot establish himself without the Way of the sage;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:57.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:57.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhí cannot operate without the Way of the sage;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:57.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:57.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the good people in the world are few</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-3a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:20:57.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">while the bad people are many.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:18.26+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then [the robbers] will steal them along with the balances;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:18.26+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if you make tallies and seals to trust with them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-4a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:18.26+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then [the robbers] will steal them along with the tallies and seals;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-4a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:18.26+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if you make benevolence and righteousness to correct them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-4a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:18.26+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then [the robbers] will steal them along with benevolence and righteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:18.26+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">How do we know that this is so?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:38.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and the great robber will cease;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:38.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">cast aside jade and destroy pearls,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:38.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and the petty thief will not arise;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:38.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">burn the tallies and break the seals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:38.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and the people will be simple and unsophisticated;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:38.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">smash the measures of capacity and break the balances,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:58.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when people contain their own wisdom,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:58.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then the world will not be burdened;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:58.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when people contain their own knowledge,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:58.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then the world will not be confused;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:58.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when people contain their own virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-5a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:21:58.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then the world will not be perverse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-6a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:25.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then inwardly they abandon their parents</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-6a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:25.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and outwardly they forsake the affairs of their lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-6a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:25.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their footprints connect to the borders of the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-6a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:25.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and their cart tracks meet beyond a thousand *lǐ*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-6a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:25.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is the fault of superiors being overly fond of knowledge.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-7a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:25.299+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-7a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:40.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in the middle, it obstructs the application of the four seasons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-7a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:40.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Trembling and weak insects,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-7a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:40.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and feathered and winged creatures,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-7a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:40.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">none fail to lose their nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-7a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:40.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">How extreme is the disorder of the world caused by the love of knowledge!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_010-7a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:40.92+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Those after the Three Dynasties (三代, Sān Dài) are examples of this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:58.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If there is neither tranquility nor pleasure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:58.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then there is no virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:58.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">That which has no virtue cannot last long; there is no such thing under Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-2a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:58.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:58.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">When people are excessively happy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:22:58.507+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">they lean toward the *yáng*;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-3a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:15.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to advocate keen hearing?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-3a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:15.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">That is being excessive in sound;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-3a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:15.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to advocate benevolence?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:15.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">That is causing disorder in virtue;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-3a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:15.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to advocate righteousness?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-3a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:15.697+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">That is acting contrary to principle;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:35.719+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it is best to do nothing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:35.719+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Only through non-action</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:35.719+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">can one find peace in one's inherent nature and feelings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:35.719+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, valuing one's own person more than governing the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:35.719+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">allows one to be entrusted with the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:35.719+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Cherishing one's own person more than governing the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-5a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:53.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">When at rest, it is deep and still;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-5a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:53.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when in motion, it hangs suspended in Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-5a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:53.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Is it not the human heart</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-6a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:53.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">that is unrestrained, arrogant, and impossible to control!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-6a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:53.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">In the past, Huángdì first used benevolence and righteousness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-6a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:23:53.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to disturb people's hearts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-6a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:15.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The world loved knowledge,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-6a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:15.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and the people exhausted their seeking.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-6a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:15.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Thereupon, chisels and saws were fashioned,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-6a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:15.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">cords and plumb lines killed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-6a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:15.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">mallets and gouges decided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-6a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:15.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">All under Heaven was in hurried and great chaos.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:43.877+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I have heard that you, my master, have attained the ultimate Dao.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:43.877+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I venture to ask about the essence of the ultimate Dao.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:43.877+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I wish to extract the essence of Heaven and Earth</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:43.877+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to aid the five grains and nourish the people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:43.877+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I also wish to govern Yin and Yang</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-8a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:24:43.877+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to bring about the flourishing of all living things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:05.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I have heard that you, master, are versed in the ultimate Dao,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:05.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I dare to ask, how should one cultivate oneself in order to live long?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:05.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Guǎngchéng Zǐ suddenly got up,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:05.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:05.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"An excellent question indeed!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:05.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Come!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:27.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Heaven and earth have their offices,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:27.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yin and Yang have their storehouses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:27.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">carefully guard your body,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:27.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and things will naturally flourish.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:27.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I guard the One to dwell in its harmony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-9a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:27.932+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">therefore, I have cultivated myself for twelve hundred years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:48.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">People will all die,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:48.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but I alone will endure!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:48.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yún Jiàng was traveling east,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:48.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">passing the branches of the whirlwind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:48.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and happened to encounter Hóngméng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:25:48.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Hóngméng was just patting his belly and hopping about in joy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:26:11.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">passing the wilds of Yǒu Sòng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:26:11.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and happened to encounter Hóng Méng again.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:26:11.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yún Jiàng was overjoyed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:26:11.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">walked quickly forward and said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:26:11.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Has Heaven forgotten me?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-11a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:26:11.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Has Heaven forgotten me?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:28:56.293+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it is the fault of those who govern men!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:28:56.293+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yún Jiàng 雲將 said: "Then what should I do?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:28:56.293+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Hóngméng 鴻蒙 said: "Ah,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:28:56.293+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how poisonous!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:28:56.293+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Hasten, hasten and return!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:28:56.293+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yún Jiàng 雲將 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:17.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">do not pry into its nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:17.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and things will naturally come into being."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:17.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yún Jiàng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:17.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Heaven has bestowed virtue upon me,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:17.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and shown me silence;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-12a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:17.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I seek it in person,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:36.085+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how ignorant are those who possess land!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:36.085+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">For those who possess land</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:36.085+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">possess a great thing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:36.085+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Those who possess a great thing</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-13a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:36.085+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">should not be treated as a mere object;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-13a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:36.085+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to treat it as an object and not as an object,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:57.056+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">praising and discoursing on physical form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:57.056+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">merging with the Great Unity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:57.056+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and within the Great Unity, there is no self.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:57.056+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Without self,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:57.056+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how can one possess anything?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:29:57.056+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Those who cling to possessions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Praising and discussing the physical body,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">conforms to the Great Oneness (dà tóng),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">being greatly one, yet without self.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Being without self,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how can one possess possessions!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Those who perceive possessions</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are the gentlemen of the past;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">those who perceive nothingness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-14a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are friends of Heaven and Earth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">What is lowly but cannot be neglected is matter (wù);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is humble but cannot be dispensed with is the people (mín);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is hidden but must be done is affairs (shì);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is coarse but must be stated is law (fǎ);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is distant but must be dwelled in is righteousness (yì);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is intimate but must be expanded is benevolence (rén);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is restrained but must be accumulated is ritual (lǐ);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is centered but must be esteemed is virtue (dé);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is unified but cannot be changed is the Way (dào);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is spiritual but must be acted upon is Heaven (tiān).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, the sage (shèng rén) observes Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but does not assist it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is accomplished in virtue (dé)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:16.62+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but is not burdened by it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:47.246+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">that which is spiritual yet cannot but be acted upon,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:47.246+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:47.246+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, the sage observes Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:47.246+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and does not assist it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:47.246+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">achieves through virtue</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:30:47.246+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and is not burdened.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:31:09.509+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">(the Way),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:31:09.509+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">alas!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:31:09.509+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">(the Way)?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:31:09.509+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">(Heaven),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:31:09.509+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">(Way) of man.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_011-15a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:31:09.509+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">That which is revered though doing nothing is,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:31:30.682+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">viewing divisions (of labour, status etc.) through the Dao, the righteousness of the ruler and minister is clarified;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:31:30.682+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">viewing abilities through the Dao, the officials of the world are well-governed;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:31:30.682+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">viewing broadly through the Dao, the responses of the myriad things are complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-1a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:00.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Without a mind for personal gain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:00.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ghosts and spirits submit."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:00.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The Master (Fūzǐ) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:00.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"The Dao covers and supports Heaven and Earth and transforms and generates all things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:00.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">How vast and great it is!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:00.83+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The junzi (君子) cannot but empty his heart for it."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:25.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he will not restrict the benefits of a single generation</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:25.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to personal, selfish gain;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:25.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">nor will he take possession of the kingship of all under Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:25.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">as a place for his own self-aggrandizement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:25.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If made manifest, then there is clarity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-2a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:25.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the myriad things become a single storehouse."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-3a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:51.77+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">abruptly stirring,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-3a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:51.77+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and all things follow!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-3a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:51.77+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is what is meant by those of kingly virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-3a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:51.77+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Seeing into the darkness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-3a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:51.77+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">listening to the silence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-3a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:32:51.77+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Within the darkness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-4a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:11.814+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and Image-Vague found it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:11.814+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The Yellow Emperor (Huángdì) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-4a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:11.814+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Strange!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:11.814+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Image-Vague was able to find it?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:11.814+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The teacher of Yao was Xǔ Yóu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:11.814+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the teacher of Xǔ Yóu was Niè Quē,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-5a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:35.121+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and has never had constancy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-5a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:35.121+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">How could he be worthy to be matched with Heaven?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-5a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:35.121+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Nevertheless,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-5a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:35.121+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he has a clan</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-5a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:35.121+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and ancestors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-5a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:35.121+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and can be a father to the masses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-6a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:54.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Many sons bring many worries,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-6a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:54.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wealth brings many affairs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-6a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:54.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">long life brings many humiliations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-6a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:54.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">These three are not the means by which to nourish virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-7a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:54.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">therefore I decline."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-7a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:33:54.101+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The border guard said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-7a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:11.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The border official left.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-7a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:11.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yáo followed him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-7a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:11.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-7a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:11.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"May I ask a question?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-8a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:11.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The border official said: "Withdraw!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:11.896+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Yáo governed the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-8a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:32.076+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and future generations' chaos will begin from this point.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-8a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:32.076+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Are you going to leave?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-8a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:32.076+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Don't delay my work!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-8a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:32.076+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He tilled the soil contentedly, without looking back.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-9a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:32.076+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:32.076+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">In the very beginning, there was nothing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-9a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:54.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">As if foolish, as if dazed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-9a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:54.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is called profound Dé,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-9a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:54.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">It is in harmony with the Great Order.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:54.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:54.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Fūzǐ asked Lǎodān, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:34:54.97+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"There are those who govern the Way as if they were setting it free,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-10a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Forgetting Heaven;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-10a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Its name is called forgetting oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-10a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The person who forgets himself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-11a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is called entering into Heaven."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Jiānglǘ Miǎn (將閭葂) saw Jì Chè (季徹) and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"The Lord of Lǔ (魯) said to Miǎn (葂), 'Please receive instruction.'"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:36.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"The Great Sage governing the world</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:36.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">stirs the people's hearts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:36.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">making them form teachings and change customs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:36.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">eliminating their thieving hearts</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:36.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and advancing their individual wills,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:35:36.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">as if it were their nature to do so.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-13a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:10.219+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">drawing water as if lifting something out,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:10.219+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">its flow as plentiful as boiling soup;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:10.219+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">its name is *gāo* 槔 (a well sweep)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:10.219+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The gardener grew angry, changed his expression, and laughed, saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:10.219+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I have heard from my teacher that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-13a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:10.219+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">those who use machines</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-14a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:32.208+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">You are about to forget your spirit and vital energy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-14a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:32.208+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">let fall your form and body,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-14a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:32.208+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and perhaps then [you can succeed]!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-14a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:32.208+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">But if you cannot govern your own person,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-14a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:32.208+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how can you have time to govern the world!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-14a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:32.208+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Be gone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-15a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:54.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is on the way of the sage.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-15a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:54.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He entrusts his life and walks with the people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-15a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:54.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">without knowing where he is going,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-15a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:54.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">vague and wholly complete!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-15a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:54.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Schemes of profit and clever devices must make one forget this kind of person's heart.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-15a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:41:54.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">A person like that,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:17.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to embody one's nature and embrace one's spirit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-16a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:17.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in order to wander among the worldly people -</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:17.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are you going to be constantly surprised by that?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-16a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:17.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Moreover, the techniques of primordial chaos,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-17a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:17.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how could you and I be sufficient to understand them!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-17a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:17.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhūnmáng (諄芒) was about to go east to the great valley,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-17a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:39.645+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">with a wave of the hand and a look,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-17a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:39.645+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the people of the four directions all come together;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-18a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:39.645+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">this is what is called sage governance."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-18a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:39.645+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I wish to hear about the virtuous person."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-18a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:39.645+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-18a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:42:39.645+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"The virtuous person,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-20a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:03.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Mén Wú Guǐ and Chì Zhāng Mǎn Jī observed the army of King Wǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-20a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:03.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chì Zhāng Mǎn Jī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-20a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:03.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"It does not compare to the House of Yǒu Yú!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-20a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:03.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Hence, they are far from this trouble."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-20a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:03.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Mén Wú Guǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-20a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:03.345+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"The world is equally governed..."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-21a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:28.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, they act without leaving a trace,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:28.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and affairs are managed without being recorded."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:28.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">A filial son does not flatter his parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:28.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">a loyal minister does not fawn over his ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:28.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">this is the perfection of a subject and son.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:28.416+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If one agrees with everything a parent says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-21a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Shì gù xíng ér wú jì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shì ér wú zhuàn." Therefore, to act without leaving a trace, and to serve without being remembered."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Xiào zǐ bù yú qí qīn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zhōng chén bù chǎn qí jūn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">chén zǐ zhī shèng yě. "A filial son does not flatter his parents, a loyal minister does not fawn upon his ruler; these are the hallmarks of the finest subjects.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Qīn zhī suǒ yán ér rán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">suǒ xíng ér shàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé shì sú wèi zhī bù xiào zǐ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">jūn zhī suǒ yán ér rán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">suǒ xíng ér shàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé shì sú wèi zhī bù xiào chén. If one agrees with everything one's parents say and approves of everything they do, then the world calls one an unfilial son; if one agrees with everything one's ruler says and approves of everything he does, then the world calls one a disloyal minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Ér wèi zhī cǐ qí bìrán xié?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Shì sú zhī suǒ wèi rán ér rán zhī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">suǒ wèi shàn ér shàn zhī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé bù wèi zhī dào yú zhī rén yě. And does one not realize that this is necessarily so? If one deems right what the world deems right, and deems good what the world deems good, then one will not be called a flatterer.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Rán zé sú gù yán yú qīn ér zūn yú jūn xié?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Wèi jǐ dào rén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé bórán zuò sè;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wèi jǐ yú rén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé fúrán zuò sè. In that case, is the world stricter than parents and more venerable than rulers? To be told that one leads others aright causes one to flush with anger; to be told that one flatters others causes one to flush with anger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Ér zhōngshēn dào rén yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zhōngshēn yú rén yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">hé pì shì cí</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">jù zhòng yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shì zhōng shǐ běn mò</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">bù xiāng zuò. And yet one leads others astray throughout one's life, and flatters others throughout one's life, using metaphors and embellished words, and gathering crowds. Thus, one's beginning and end, one's root and branch, do not correspond.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chuí yīshang,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shè cǎi sè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">dòng róngmào,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǐ mèi yī shì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér bù zì wèi dào yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǔ fū rén zhī wèi tú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">tōng shì fēi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:43:48.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér bù zì wèi zhòngrén. To let one's robes hang down, display elegant colors, manipulate one's countenance in order to ingratiate oneself with the world, and yet not consider oneself to be leading others astray. To be in league with the common herd, muddying the waters of right and wrong, and yet not consider oneself to be one of the crowd.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-21a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Shì gù xíng ér wú jì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shì ér wú zhuàn." Therefore, (they) act without leaving traces, (they) serve without leaving stories."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Xiào zǐ bù yú qí qīn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zhōng chén bù chǎn qí jūn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">chén zǐ zhī shèng yě. A filial son does not flatter his parents, a loyal minister does not fawn on his ruler; this is the excellence of a subject.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Qīn zhī suǒ yán ér rán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">suǒ xíng ér shàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé shì sú wèi zhī bù xiào zǐ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">jūn zhī suǒ yán ér rán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">suǒ xíng ér shàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé shì sú wèi zhī bù xiào chén. If whatever parents say is deemed right, and whatever they do is deemed good, then the common people will call (such a son) an unfilial son; if whatever a ruler says is deemed right, and whatever he does is deemed good, then the common people will call (such a minister) a disloyal minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Ér wèi zhī cǐ qí bì rán xié?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Shì sú zhī suǒ wèi rán ér rán zhī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">suǒ wèi shàn ér shàn zhī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé bù wèi zhī dào yú zhī rén yě. But how can it be known that this is necessarily so? If one deems right what the common people call right, and deems good what they call good, then one is not considered someone who flatters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Rán zé sú gù yán yú qīn ér zūn yú jūn xié?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Wèi jǐ dào rén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé bó rán zuò sè;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wèi jǐ yú rén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé fú rán zuò sè. Then is the common people indeed stricter than parents and more honored than the ruler? If one is called a guide of others, one will suddenly change color; if one is called a flatterer of others, one will indignantly change color.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Ér zhōng shēn dào rén yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zhōng shēn yú rén yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">hé pì shì cí</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">jù zhòng yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shì zhōng shǐ běn mò</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">bù xiāng zuò. But one is a guide of others for one's whole life, and one is a flatterer of others for one's whole life, piecing together metaphors and adorning words, gathering a crowd; this is a beginning and an end that do not correspond.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chuí yī shāng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shè cǎi sè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">dòng róng mào,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǐ mèi yī shì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér bù zì wèi dào yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǔ fū rén zhī wèi tú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">tōng shì fēi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:45:24.679+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér bù zì wèi zhòng rén. One lets their robes hang down, arranges colors, moves their countenance, to flatter the world, and does not consider oneself a guide to flattery, becoming a follower of the wealthy, conforming to right and wrong, and not considering oneself one of the masses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-21a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Shì gù xíng ér wú jì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shì ér wú chuán." Therefore, actions leave no traces, and affairs are not transmitted."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Xiào zǐ bù yú qí qīn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zhōng chén bù chǎn qí jūn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">chén zǐ zhī shèng yě. A filial son does not flatter his parents, and a loyal minister does not ingratiate himself with his ruler; this is the height of being a subject.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Qīn zhī suǒ yán ér rán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">suǒ xíng ér shàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé shì sú wèi zhī bù xiào zǐ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">jūn zhī suǒ yán ér rán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">suǒ xíng ér shàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé shì sú wèi zhī bù xiào chén. If one affirms everything their parents say and approves of everything they do, then the common people will call them an unfilial son; if one affirms everything their ruler says and approves of everything they do, then the common people will call them a disloyal minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Ér wèi zhī cǐ qí bìrán xié?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Shì sú zhī suǒ wèi rán ér rán zhī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">suǒ wèi shàn ér shàn zhī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé bù wèi zhī dào yú zhī rén yě. But do they not know that this is necessarily so? If one affirms what the common people call right and approves of what they call good, then they are not called flatterers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Rán zé sú gù yán yú qīn ér zūn yú jūn xié? Then is public opinion indeed stricter than (expectations of) parents and more esteemed than (expectations of) the ruler?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Wèi jǐ dào rén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé bó rán zuò sè;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wèi jǐ yú rén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé fú rán zuò sè. If told that they are speaking against others, they suddenly become angry; if told that they are flattering others, they are likewise enraged.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Ér zhōng shēn dào rén yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zhōng shēn yú rén yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">hé pì shì cí</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">jù zhòng yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shì zhōng shǐ běn mò</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">bù xiāng zuò. Yet they spend their entire lives criticizing others and flattering people, using analogies and embellishing words, gathering crowds; in this way, their beginning and end are fundamentally inconsistent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chuí yīshāng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shè cǎi sè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">dòng róngmào,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǐ mèi yī shì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér bù zì wèi dào yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǔ fū rén zhī wèi tú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">tōng shì fēi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:48:08.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér bù zì wèi zhòng rén, They wear elaborate clothing, display vibrant colors, and manipulate their appearance to ingratiate themselves with the world, yet do not consider themselves flatterers; they ally themselves with influential figures, confuse right and wrong, yet do not consider themselves ordinary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:49:49.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">dòng róngmào,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:49:49.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǐ mèi yī shì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:49:49.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér bù zì wèi dào yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:49:49.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǔ fūrén zhī wèi tú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:49:49.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">tōng shìfēi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-22a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:49:49.535+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér bù zì wèi zhòngrén, "One wears fine clothes, displays attractive colors, and manipulates one's appearance in order to charm the world, yet one does not consider oneself to be guiding or flattering. One becomes a follower of influential people, and agrees with their judgements of right and wrong, yet one does not consider oneself to be one of the common people."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-23a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:13.926+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, lofty words do not ascend into the hearts of the masses;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-23a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:13.926+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the ultimate words are not spoken,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-23a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:13.926+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">because vulgar words prevail.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-23a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:13.926+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">With two *fǒu* (缶) causing such delusion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-23a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:13.926+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the destination cannot be reached.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-23a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:13.926+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">But now, the world is deluded.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-24a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:32.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">First, the five colors confuse the eyes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-24a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:32.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">causing the eyes to lose their clarity;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-24a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:32.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">second, the five sounds confuse the ears,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-24a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:32.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">causing the ears to lose their acuteness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-24a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:32.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">third, the five odors assail the nose,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-24a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:50:32.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">causing distress and confusion in the forehead;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-24a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:52:58.976+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">or a tiger and leopard in a cage;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_012-24a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:52:58.976+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">can this also be considered attainment?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:52:58.976+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.3-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:52:58.976+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chapter Thirteen: The Way of Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:52:58.976+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The Way of Heaven operates and accumulates nothing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:52:58.976+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">therefore the myriad things are completed;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:53:19.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now, emptiness, stillness, tranquility, detachment, silence, and non-action</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:53:19.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are the equilibrium of Heaven and Earth</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:53:19.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and the culmination of morality.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:53:19.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, emperors, kings, and sages find repose in them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:53:19.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Repose leads to emptiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:53:19.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">emptiness leads to substance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:18.15+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then your achievements will be great, your name will be renowned,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:18.15+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and the world will be unified.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:18.15+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">In stillness, one is a sage;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:18.15+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in action, one is a king;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:18.15+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in inaction, one is revered;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-1a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:18.15+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in simplicity, the world cannot compete with one in beauty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:50.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, it is said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:50.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">'Those who know heavenly joy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:50.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their life is the movement of Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-2a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:50.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their death is the transformation of things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-2a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:50.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">In stillness, they share the virtue of Yin;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-2a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:54:50.252+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">in action, they move with the waves of Yang.'"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:14.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and takes non-action as its constancy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:14.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Through non-action,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:14.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">they employ the world with abundance;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:14.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">through action,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:14.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">they are employed by the world and are insufficient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:14.116+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, the ancients valued non-action.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:36.006+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Heaven does not produce,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:36.006+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet all things transform;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:36.006+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Earth does not nurture,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:36.006+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet all things grow;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:36.006+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the emperor practices non-action (wúwéi),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-3a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:36.006+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet the achievements of the world are made.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:59.043+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the sounds of bells and drums,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-4a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:59.043+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the appearances of feathers and banners,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-4a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:59.043+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are the end of music;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-4a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:59.043+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">weeping and wailing in mourning clothes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:59.043+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">elaborate and simple mourning garments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:55:59.043+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are the end of sorrow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-5a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:27.421+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">All things transform and arise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:27.421+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the sprouts and emerging things have forms;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:27.421+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">flourishing and decline, and the degrees of their diminishing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-5a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:27.421+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are the flow of transformation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-5a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:27.421+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Heaven and Earth are supremely divine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-5a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:27.421+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet they have distinctions of noble and humble.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-6a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:52.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then *yīnrèn* 因任 (according to capabilities) came next;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-6a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:52.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">once *yīnrèn* 因任 (according to capabilities) was clarified,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-6a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:52.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then *yuánxǐng* 原省 (examining the basis) came next;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-6a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:52.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">once *yuánxǐng* 原省 (examining the basis) was clarified,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-6a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:52.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then *shìfēi* 是非 (right and wrong) came next;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-6a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:56:52.635+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">once *shìfēi* 是非 (right and wrong) was clarified,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-7a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:57:14.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">spoke of how after five transformations, forms and names can be established,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-7a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:57:14.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and after nine transformations, rewards and punishments can be discussed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-7a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:57:14.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">To speak abruptly of forms and names</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-7a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:57:14.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is to not understand their root;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-7a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:57:14.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to speak abruptly of rewards and punishments</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-7a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:57:14.825+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is to not understand their beginning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:19.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I grieve for the dead,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:19.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">commend children, and show compassion to women.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:19.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is how I employ my mind."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:19.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">(Shùn said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:19.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Beautiful, yes, beautiful indeed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-8a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:19.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but not yet great.")</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:44.255+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then try to go and rely on him."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:44.255+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Kǒngzǐ said: "Good."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:44.255+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">(He) went to see Lǎodān,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:44.255+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but Lǎodān did not allow it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-9a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:44.255+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Thereupon (Kǒngzǐ) recited the Twelve Classics to persuade him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-9a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:44.255+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lǎodān interrupted his discourse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">that is itself a form of selfishness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.578+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">that is itself a form of selfishness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.578+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If you wish to ensure that the world does not lose its shepherd,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.578+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If you wish to ensure that the world does not lose its shepherd,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.578+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">then Heaven and Earth already have their constant principles,<seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T17:59:44.255+09:00">the sun and moon already have their brightness,</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.578+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then Heaven and Earth already have their constant principles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Only one arrow was used.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the sun and moon already have their brightness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the sun and moon already have their brightness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A milu deer appeared in front.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the stars already have their positions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the stars already have their positions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He shot the milu deer, achieving a beautiful hit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and birds and beasts already have their flocks.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and birds and beasts already have their flocks.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Jìn's 晉 Bào Guǐ 鮑癸 was behind him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Only one arrow was used.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He had Shè Shū 攝叔 present the milu deer as an offering,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">A *mí* deer appeared in front.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He shot the *mí* deer and it was shot precisely in the *guī*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Since it is the wrong time of year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the offering of birds has not yet arrived,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bào Guǐ of Jìn was behind him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">You do not consume all that is cooked and raw before you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to provide a meal for the followers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He had Shè Shū present the *mí* deer, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet you accumulate and hoard without limit."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bào Guǐ 鮑癸 stopped him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-12a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lǎozǐ remained silent and did not respond.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Since it is not the season, and the game is not yet plentiful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The one on the left is good at archery,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Shìchéng Qǐ returned to see him again the next day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the one on the right is eloquent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"In the past, I had criticism for you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">they are gentlemen."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to provide a meal for those who follow."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but now my heart is corrected and repents;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:04:45.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:05.257+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is the reason for this?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">So he was excused.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Bào Guǐ stopped him, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:04:45.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Shì Chéngqǐ returned to see him the next day</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:04:45.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Jìn's 晉 Wèi Qí 魏錡 sought a position among the ducal clan,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:04:45.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"In the past, I had criticisms of you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"The one on the left shoots well,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but did not obtain it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:04:45.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but now my heart is corrected.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:04:45.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">What is the reason for this?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and was angry,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">wanting to ruin the Jìn 晉 army.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-235a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">the one on the right is eloquent; they are gentlemen."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He was thus spared.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He requested to withdraw the army,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Wèi Qí of Jìn sought a position among the ducal clan</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but was not permitted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but was unsuccessful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He requested to be a messenger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Becoming angry,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and was permitted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">he wanted to ruin the Jìn army.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Thereupon he went,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He requested to be the one to bring about the army's withdrawal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">requesting battle</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">but this was not permitted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He requested to be an envoy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and then returned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Chǔ's 楚 Pān Dǎng 潘黨 pursued him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and this was permitted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He then went</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">reaching Yíngzé 熒澤.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and requested battle</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He saw six milu deer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">shot one milu deer, and turning around, offered it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">before returning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">Pān Dǎng of Chǔ pursued him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Since you have military affairs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">reaching Yíngzé.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He saw six *mí* deer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I fear that the hunters may not be able to adequately supply fresh meat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">shot one *mí* deer, and turning back, presented it, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:09.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to offer this to the followers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"Sir, you have military affairs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I fear the huntsmen may not be providing enough fresh meat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:03:26.813+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to present this to those who follow."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:20.093+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when you examine, you scrutinize;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:20.093+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">your cleverness and knowledge are displayed in abundance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-13a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:20.093+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">all causing disbelief.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-14a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:20.093+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">There is someone on the border whose name is Thief."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:20.093+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lǎozǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-14a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:20.093+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"The Dao,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-14a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:46.295+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">retreats from benevolence and righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-14a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:46.295+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">treats ritual and music as guests.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-15a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:46.295+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The utmost person's heart is settled."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-15a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:46.295+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">What the world values about the Dao is books,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-15a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:46.295+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but books are merely words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-15a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:07:46.295+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and words have their value.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-16a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:07.318+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">asking Huán Gōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:07.318+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"May I venture to ask, what words is Your Lordship reading?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-16a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:07.318+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The Duke said, "The words of the sages."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-16a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:07.318+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-16a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:07.318+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Are the sages still alive?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_013-16a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:07.318+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The Duke said, "They are already dead."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-1a.3-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:26.639+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chapter Fourteen, *Tiān Yùn* (The Revolving of Heaven)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:26.639+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Does Heaven revolve?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:26.639+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Does Earth remain still?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:26.639+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Do the sun and moon contend for their places?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:26.639+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Who directs this?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:08:26.639+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Who maintains this framework?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:37:49.74+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">oversee and illuminate the lower realm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:37:49.74+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and the world supports them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-2a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:37:49.74+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is called the supreme sovereign."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:37:49.74+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The Grand Steward of Shāng, Dàng, asked Zhuāng Zǐ about benevolence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:37:49.74+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhuāng Zǐ said, "Tigers and wolves are benevolent."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-2a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:37:49.74+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Dàng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:23.008+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">It is easy to practice filial piety with reverence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-3a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:23.008+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it is difficult to practice filial piety with love;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:23.008+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">It is easy to practice filial piety with love,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-3a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:23.008+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but it is difficult to forget one's parents;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-3a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:23.008+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">It is easy to forget one's parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-3a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:23.008+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but it is difficult to make one's parents forget me;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:46.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when I heard it again, I became lax;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:46.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when I finally heard it, I became confused;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:46.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">vast and silent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:46.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I could not find myself."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:46.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The Emperor said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:38:46.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"You are probably like that!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:20.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">one death, one birth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:20.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">one fall, one rise;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:20.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is constant is inexhaustible,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:20.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet none can be relied upon.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-4a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:20.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">That is why you are afraid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:20.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-5a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:48.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The eye is exhausted in what it desires to see,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-5a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:48.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">strength is depleted in what it desires to pursue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-5a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:48.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I have already failed to reach it!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-5a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:48.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">My form fills the void,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-5a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:48.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and then becomes languid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-5a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:39:48.567+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">You are languid, therefore you are weary."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-6a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:19.657+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, Yàn Shì made a eulogy for it, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-6a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:19.657+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">'Listening to it, one does not hear its sound,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-6a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:19.657+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">looking at it, one does not see its form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-6a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:19.657+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it fills the heavens and the earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-6a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:19.657+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">enveloping the six limits.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-6a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:19.657+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If you wish to hear it but have no contact with it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:48.708+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">passersby step on its head and spine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:48.708+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and firewood gatherers take it to burn it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:48.708+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">would they again take</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:48.708+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it and place it in a box with a cover,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:48.708+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">drape it with embroidered cloth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:40:48.708+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wander, dwell, sleep, and lie beneath it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:11.189+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">exhausting yourself without success,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:11.189+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and you will certainly suffer disaster.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:11.189+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">You do not understand the tradition of adaptability,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-7a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:11.189+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">which responds to things without being exhausted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-8a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:11.189+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:11.189+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Moreover, have you not seen the well-sweep?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-8a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:36.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and frowning in her village.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-8a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:36.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The rich men of the village saw this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-8a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:36.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">firmly closed their doors and did not come out,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-8a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:36.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the poor people saw this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-8a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:36.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and took their wives and children and ran away.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-8a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:41:36.48+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">They knew beauty</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:04.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if the Dao could be told to others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:04.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then people would all tell it to their brothers;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:04.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if the Dao could be given to others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:04.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then people would all give it to their children and grandchildren.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:04.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">However, it is not possible, and there is no other reason for this than</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:04.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">that there is no master within, and it does not stop.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:35.862+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">non-borrowing is non-giving.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:35.862+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The ancients called this a journey of gathering truth."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:35.862+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Those who consider wealth to be right</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:35.862+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">cannot renounce emoluments.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:35.862+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Those who consider prominence to be right</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:35.862+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">cannot renounce fame.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">bù dài, wú chū yě. 不貸，无出也。If you do not lend, there will be no giving.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">gǔ zhě wèi shì cǎi zhēn zhī yóu. 古者謂是采真之遊。The ancients called this a journey to seek the truth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǐ fù wèi shì zhě, 以富為是者，Those who consider wealth to be the purpose,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">bù néng ràng lù; 不能讓祿；cannot relinquish emoluments;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǐ xiǎn wèi shì zhě, 以顯為是者，Those who consider fame to be the purpose,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">bù néng ràng míng; 不能讓名；cannot relinquish their reputation;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">qīn quán zhě, 親權者，Those who cherish power,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">bù néng yǔ rén bǐng. 不能與人柄。cannot share authority with others.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">cāo zhī zé lì, 操之則慄，Holding onto it, they tremble;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shě zhī zé bēi, 舍之則悲，relinquishing it, they grieve;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér yī wú suǒ jiàn, 而一无所鑒，and yet are ignorant of everything.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yǐ kuī qí suǒ bù xiū zhě, 以闚其所不休者，They strive after that which brings no rest.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">shì tiān zhī lù mín yě. 是天之戮民也。This is heaven’s punishment of the people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yuàn ēn qǔ yǔ jiàn jiào shēng shā, 怨恩取與諫教生殺，Hatred, kindness, taking, giving, remonstrating, teaching, life, and death—</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">bā zhě, 八者，these eight</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zhèng zhī qì yě, 正之器也，are instruments of governance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wéi xún dà biàn wú suǒ yān zhě wèi néng yòng zhī. 唯循大變无所湮者為能用之。Only one who follows the great changes and is not overwhelmed by them can use them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">gù yuē: 故曰：Therefore it is said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zhèng zhě, zhèng yě. 正者，正也。“Governance” means rectification.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-11a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">qí xīn yǐ wéi bù rán zhě, 其心以為不然者，If one's heart thinks otherwise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">tiān mén fú kāi yǐ.” 天門弗開矣。」the gate of heaven will not open.”</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Kǒngzǐ jiàn Lǎo Dān 孔子見老聃 Confucius met with Lǎo Dān</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér yǔ rén yì. 而語仁義。and spoke of benevolence and righteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lǎo Dān yuē: 老聃曰：「Lǎo Dān said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">fū bō kāng mī mù, 夫播穅眯目，“If you scatter chaff in your eyes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé tiān dì sì fāng yì wèi yǐ; 則天地四方易位矣；then heaven and earth and the four directions will change places;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wén méng zǎn fū, 蚊虻噆膚，If mosquitoes and gadflies bite your skin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zé tōng xī bù mèi yǐ. 則通昔不寐矣。then you will not sleep through the night.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">fū rén yì 夫仁義Now, benevolence and righteousness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">cǎn rán nǎi fèn wú xīn, 憯然乃憤吾心，bitterly agitate my heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">luàn mò dà yān. 亂莫大焉。and there is no greater disorder.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wú zi shǐ tiān xià wú shī qí pǔ, 吾子使天下无失其朴，My son, cause the world not to lose its simplicity;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wú zi yì fàng fēng ér dòng, 吾子亦放風而動，My son, you too, should move with the wind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:42:50.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zǒng dé ér lì yǐ, 揔德而立矣，establish yourself by embracing virtue."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:43:40.812+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Benevolence and righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:43:40.812+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how bitterly they agitate my heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:43:40.812+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">nothing is more chaotic.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:43:40.812+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Cause the world to not lose its simplicity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:43:40.812+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and you, sir, will also release the wind and move,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:43:40.812+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">gather virtue and stand firm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:16.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">rides the clouds</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:16.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and nourishes itself on yin and yang.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:16.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">My mouth was open</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:16.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but I could not close it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:16.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">my tongue was raised but I could not retract it. What lesson could I possibly learn from Lǎo Dān!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:16.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zǐgòng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:38.979+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">King Wén obeyed Zhòu</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:38.979+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and dared not oppose him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:38.979+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">King Wǔ opposed Zhòu</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-13a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:38.979+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and would not obey him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-14a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:38.979+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">therefore I say they are different."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:44:38.979+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lǎo Dān said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-14a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:45:03.655+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and both Confucianism and Mohism arose.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-14a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:45:03.655+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Their beginnings had order,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-14a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:45:03.655+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but now it involves women, what is there to say!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-14a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:45:03.655+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I tell you,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-14a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:45:03.655+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the governance of the world by the Three Sovereigns and Five Emperors</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-14a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:45:03.655+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">was called governance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-15a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:16.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">How difficult it is to persuade people!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:16.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">How difficult it is to make the Dao clear!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:16.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Lǎozǐ said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:16.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Fortunate are you that you have not encountered a ruler of a well-ordered age!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:16.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The *Six Classics*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:16.587+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are the remnants of the former kings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-17a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:50.728+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Kǒngzǐ did not go out for three months,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-17a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:50.728+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and came again, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-17a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:50.728+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Qiū has attained it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-17a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:50.728+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Crows and magpies rear their young,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-17a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:50.728+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">fish deposit foam,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_014-17a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:46:50.728+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">those with slender waists are transformed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:14.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">scholars who wander and reside.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:14.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">To speak of great achievements,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:14.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to establish great names,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:14.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to observe the rites between ruler and subject,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:14.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to rectify the hierarchy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:14.35+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is simply to govern;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:40.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">there is nothing they forget,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:40.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">there is nothing they do not possess;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:40.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">they are serenely limitless,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:40.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and all beauties follow them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:40.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is the Way of Heaven and Earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-1a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:47:40.886+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the virtue of the sages.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-2a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:10.538+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he arises only when it is unavoidable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-2a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:10.538+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He discards knowledge and contrivance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-2a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:10.538+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and follows the principles of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-2a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:10.538+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore there are no natural disasters,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-2a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:10.538+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">no burdens from things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-2a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:10.538+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">no human criticisms;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-3a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:33.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is the perfection of virtue;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-3a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:33.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">being unified and unchanging</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:33.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is the perfection of stillness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-3a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:33.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">having nothing to resist</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:33.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is the perfection of emptiness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-3a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:33.379+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">not interacting with things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-4a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:59.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">daring not to use them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-4a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:59.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">such is the ultimate in treasuring.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:59.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The spirit radiates in all directions, flowing in unison,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:59.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">reaching everywhere,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:59.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">above, touching Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_015-4a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:48:59.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">below, coiling in the Earth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-1a.3-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:23.917+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chapter Sixteen: Cultivating Nature</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:23.917+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Cultivating nature through worldly customs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:23.917+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">worldly scholars seek to restore their original nature;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:23.917+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">indulging desires in worldly customs, they</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:23.917+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">think to attain enlightenment;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:23.917+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">these are called a people obscured and deluded.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:50.245+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">if it overshadows, then things will certainly lose their nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:50.245+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:50.245+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The people of ancient times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:50.245+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">were in a state of chaos and obscurity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:50.245+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and with one generation attained tranquility and indifference.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:49:50.245+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">At that time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:13.918+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and then they abandoned nature and followed the mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:13.918+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The mind and the discriminating knowledge of the mind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:13.918+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">were not sufficient to settle the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:13.918+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and then they supplemented them with (external) culture,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:13.918+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and increased them with broad learning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-2a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:13.918+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Culture destroyed the substance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-3a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:40.843+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">so as not to reveal it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-3a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:40.843+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">It was that the timing and fate were greatly mistaken.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-3a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:40.843+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If they met the proper timing and fate and greatly progressed in the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-3a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:40.843+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then they would return to being without a trace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-3a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:40.843+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If they did not meet the proper timing and fate</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-3a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:50:40.843+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and were greatly frustrated in the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:07.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">refers to carriages and official hats.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:07.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Carriages and official hats on one's person</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:07.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are not one's nature and life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-5a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:07.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but things that come unexpectedly, merely temporary lodgings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-5a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:07.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">As lodgings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_016-5a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:07.075+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">their arrival cannot be prevented,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:33.527+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">He followed the current and traveled east,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:33.527+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">reaching the Běi Hǎi (North Sea).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:33.527+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Facing east and looking,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:33.527+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">he could not see the end of the water.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:33.527+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Thereupon, the Hé Bó began to change his expression,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:51:33.527+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">looked towards Ruò Wàng Yáng and sighed, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:23.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Of all the waters in the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:23.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">none is greater than the sea.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:23.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Ten thousand rivers flow into it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:23.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet one does not know when it will stop and not be full.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:23.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The tail vent drains it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:23.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yet one does not know when it will stop and not be empty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:48.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is like comparing ten thousand things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:48.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">to a hair on a horse's body?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:48.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">What the Five Emperors joined together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:48.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what the Three Kings contended for,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:48.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what the benevolent worried about,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-2a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:52:48.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what the responsible labored for,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-3a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:15.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Observing fullness and emptiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-3a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:15.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">thus, gaining, it does not rejoice;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-3a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:15.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">losing, it does not worry;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-3a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:15.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it knows the divisions have no constancy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-3a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:15.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Understanding the level road,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-3a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:15.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">thus, being born, it does not delight,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:44.602+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is a matter of circumstance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:44.602+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now, refinement and coarseness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:44.602+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">are limited to things that have form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:44.602+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">that which has no form</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:44.602+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is what numbers cannot divide;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:53:44.602+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">that which cannot be encompassed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:08.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">They know that right and wrong cannot be neatly distinguished,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:08.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and that small and large cannot be precisely measured.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:08.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">It is said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:08.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"A person of the *Dào* (道, the Way) is not heard of,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:08.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">utmost virtue is unattainable,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-4a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:08.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and the great person is without self (*wú jǐ* 無己)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-5a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:45+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">according to that which they lack, give them lack,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-5a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:45+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then all things lack;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-5a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:45+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">knowing that east and west are opposites and cannot do without each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-5a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:45+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">then the division of function is determined.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-5a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:45+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Viewing it from the perspective of inclination,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-5a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:54:45+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">according to that which they are so, make them so,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-6a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:17.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The owl catches fleas at night,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-6a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:17.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">perceiving the finest hair,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-6a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:17.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but in the daytime it stares</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-6a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:17.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and does not see the hills and mountains;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-6a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:17.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">this speaks of different natures.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-6a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:17.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore it is said: Yáo 堯, Jié 桀, Shùn 舜, Zǐ Kuài 子噲, Tāng 湯, Wǔ 武, Bái Gōng 白公, Qíjì 騏驥, Huáliú 驊騮, lìshēng 狸狌</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:48.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">In accepting and rejecting, in choosing and discarding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:48.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what shall I ultimately rely on?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:48.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Běihǎi Ruò said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:48.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Viewing things from the perspective of the Dào,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:48.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">what is noble and what is base?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:55:48.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is called reversion and transformation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:15.227+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Years cannot be picked up,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:15.227+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">time cannot be stopped;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:15.227+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">waxing and waning, fullness and emptiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:15.227+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">when the end comes, there is a beginning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:15.227+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is the way to speak of the direction of the great meaning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-7a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:15.227+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and discuss the principles of all things."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-8a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:43.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and thus nothing can harm them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-8a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:43.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Therefore, it is said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-8a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:43.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">'Heaven is within,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-8a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:43.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">man is without,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-8a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:43.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">virtue lies in Heaven.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-8a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:56:43.111+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Knowing the actions of man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:09.059+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the eye pities the heart.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:09.059+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The Kuí 夔 said to the xián 蚿:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:09.059+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I move forward hopping on one foot,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:09.059+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">nothing is like me.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:09.059+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now you make use of ten thousand feet, how can you do it alone?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-9a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:09.059+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The xián 蚿 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:36.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The wind said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:36.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Indeed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:36.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I rise vigorously from the North Sea</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:36.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and enter the South Sea,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:36.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and yet pointing at me overcomes me,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:57:36.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and tripping me also overcomes me.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:06.007+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it was not because they were wise.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:06.007+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">When Jié (桀) and Zhòu (紂) were in power,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:06.007+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">there were no learned men in the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:06.007+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it was not because they lost wisdom;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-11a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:06.007+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it was simply the way things were.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-11a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:06.007+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now, one who travels on water and does not avoid dragons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:41.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I unified the different,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:41.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">separated the hard and the white;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:41.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I said yes to no,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:41.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and no to yes;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:41.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I have perplexed the wisdom of the hundred schools,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:58:41.839+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">exhausted the arguments of many mouths;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-13a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:59:13.399+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Its right knee was already caught.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-13a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:59:13.399+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Thereupon, it hesitated and retreated,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-13a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:59:13.399+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">And told it:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:59:13.399+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">'The sea is thousands of miles in expanse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:59:13.399+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Not sufficient to convey its greatness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T18:59:13.399+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Thousands of fathoms in height,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-14a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:06.316+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">without south or north,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-14a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:06.316+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">opening in all directions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-14a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:06.316+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and merging into the immeasurable;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-14a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:06.316+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">without east or west,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-14a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:06.316+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">beginning in profound darkness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-14a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:06.316+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and returning to the Great Thoroughfare.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-15a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:51.69+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"I have heard that in Chǔ (楚) there is a divine turtle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-15a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:51.69+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">which has been dead for three thousand years.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-15a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:51.69+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The king wraps it in cloth and stores it in a box on top of the ancestral temple.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-15a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:51.69+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This turtle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-15a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:00:51.69+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">would it rather die and have its bones preserved and revered?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-16a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:24.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it will not drink except from the sweet spring.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-16a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:24.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Just then, an owl gets a rotten rat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-16a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:24.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The yuānchú flies past it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-16a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:24.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The owl looks up at it and says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-16a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:24.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">'Shoo!'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_017-16a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:24.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Now you want to use your kingdom of Liáng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:56.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-1a.3-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:56.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Chapter 18: Utmost Happiness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:56.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Is there utmost happiness in the world, or is there not?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:56.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Is there anything that can preserve life, or is there not?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:56.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">What to do now, what to rely on?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:01:56.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">What to avoid, where to dwell?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-2a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:02:55.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">continues day into night,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-2a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:02:55.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">pondering good and bad.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-2a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:02:55.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Their actions for the body are truly alienated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-2a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:02:55.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Man's life</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-2a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:02:55.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is born with worry.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-2a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:02:55.461+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">The long-lived are muddle-headed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:03:29.57+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">they are eager as if they cannot help it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:03:29.57+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and yet they all say they are enjoying it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:03:29.57+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I do not enjoy it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:03:29.57+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">nor do I not enjoy it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:03:29.57+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Is there truly enjoyment or not?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:03:29.57+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I consider non-action to be true enjoyment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Kēng kēng rán rú jiāng bùdéyǐ, They look distressed, as if forced to do something against their will,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér jiē yuē lè zhě, yet they all say they are enjoying it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Wú wèi zhī lè yě, I do not find this enjoyable,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yì wèi zhī bù lè yě. nor do I find it unenjoyable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Guǒ yǒu lè wú yǒu zāi? Is there truly such a thing as enjoyment, or is there not?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Wú yǐ wú wéi chéng lè yǐ, I consider non-action to be true enjoyment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">yòu sú zhī suǒ dà kǔ yě. yet it is what the common people consider the greatest suffering.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Gù yuē: Therefore, it is said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-3a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Zhì lè wú lè, "The ultimate enjoyment is no enjoyment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">zhì yù wú yù." the ultimate praise is no praise."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Tiānxià shìfēi guǒ wèi kě dìng yě. Whether something is right or wrong in the world truly cannot be definitively determined.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Suīrán, However,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wú wéi kěyǐ dìng shìfēi. non-action can determine right and wrong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhì lè huó shēn, Ultimate enjoyment sustains the body,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wéi wú wéi jǐ cún. and only through non-action can it be preserved.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Qǐng chángshì yán zhī. Please allow me to try to explain it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Tiān wú wéi yǐ zhī qīng, Heaven is clear through non-action,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">dì wú wéi yǐ zhī níng, Earth is tranquil through non-action,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">gù liǎng wú wéi xiāng hé, therefore, when the two non-actions combine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">wànwù jiē huà shēng. all things are transformed and born.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Máng hū wù hū, Vast and indistinct,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér wú cóng chū hū! from where does it come?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Wù hū máng hū, Indistinct and vast,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér wú yǒu xiàng hū! what form does it take?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Wànwù zhí zhí, The myriad things flourish,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">jiē cóng wú wéi zhí. all growing from non-action.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Gù yuē: Therefore, it is said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Tiāndì wú wéi yě, Heaven and Earth are non-acting,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">ér wú bù wéi yě, yet there is nothing that they do not do.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Rén yě shú néng dé wú wéi zāi! Who among men can attain non-action?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhuāngzǐ qī sǐ, When Zhuāngzǐ's wife died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Huìzi diào zhī, Huìzi went to offer condolences.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhuāngzǐ zé fāng jījù gǔ pén ér gē. Zhuāngzǐ was squatting, drumming on a basin, and singing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:04:00.119+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Huìzi yuē: "Yǔ rén jū, zhǎngzǐ lǎoshēn, Huìzi said, "Living with someone, raising children, and growing old,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:25.82+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and yet there is nothing that is not done,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:25.82+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">among men, who can attain non-action?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:25.82+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">When Zhuāngzǐ's wife died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:25.82+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Huìzi went to offer condolences.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:25.82+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhuāngzǐ then sat with his legs spread apart, drumming on a basin and singing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:25.82+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Huìzi said: "Living with a person, raising children to old age,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and there is nothing that is not done by it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">As humans, how can we possibly achieve non-action?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">When Zhuāngzǐ's (莊子) wife died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Huìzi (惠子) went to offer condolences.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhuāngzǐ (莊子), however, was squatting with his legs spread out, drumming on a basin, and singing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Huìzi (惠子) said, "Living with someone, raising children and growing old together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">not crying at their death is already enough.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">To also drum on a basin and sing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">is that not excessive!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhuāngzǐ (莊子) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">"Not so.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">At the beginning of her death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">how could I alone not feel a sense of loss?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">But considering her beginning, originally there was no life;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">not only was there no life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but originally there was no form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">not only was there no form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">but originally there was no breath.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Mixed within the vast and indistinct realm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">it transformed and there was breath;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">breath transformed and there was form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">form transformed and there was life;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">now it transforms again into death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">This is like the cycle of spring, autumn, winter, and summer.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">If a person is peacefully resting in a vast house,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">and I am crying and wailing after her,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-5a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">I would consider myself ignorant of fate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">therefore I stopped."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhīlí Shū (支離叔) and Huájiè Shū (滑介叔) were observing the mound of Míng Bó (冥伯),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the emptiness of Kūnlún (崑崙),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">where the Yellow Emperor, Huángdì (黃帝), rested.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Suddenly, a willow grew from his left elbow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">His mood became agitated and he detested it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:05:39.707+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhīlí Shū (支離叔) said, "Do you detest it?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:06:54.406+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhīlí Shū 支離叔 and Huájiè Shū 滑介叔 were viewing the hill of Míng Bó 冥伯,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:06:54.406+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the emptiness of Kūnlún 崑崙,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:06:54.406+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">the place where Huángdì 黃帝 rested.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:06:54.406+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Suddenly, a willow grew on his left elbow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:06:54.406+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">His intention was restless, disgusted by it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_018-6a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T19:06:54.406+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR5c0126-en-79235b2b">Zhīlí Shū 支離叔 said, "Do you detest it?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T21:38:10.032+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and saw six milu deer.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T21:38:10.032+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">He shot one milu deer and, looking back, presented it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T21:38:10.032+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T21:38:10.032+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">"You are engaged in military affairs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T21:38:10.032+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I fear that the hunters may not provide enough fresh meat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T21:38:10.032+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">I dare to offer it to the followers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T22:10:28.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">and the people of Chǔ take advantage of us,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T22:10:28.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">we will lose the army in no time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T22:10:28.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">It is better to be prepared.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T22:10:28.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">If Chǔ harbors no ill will,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T22:10:28.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">removing the defenses and making a covenant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0001_tls_007-236a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T22:10:28.779+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1e0001-en-62245149">what harm is there to being friendly?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0001_tls_001-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-31T23:22:40.55+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0001-en-8a2feca4"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
</TEI>